INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (1658, 'b64aacbce3', '[quote:b64aacbce3="kwikbb"]I don\'t know dude?! So I guess that was him posing as Noodles? I got no idea what hells goin on, but when someone starts calling me a fucking rat when I offer up pretty much the same thing as you had with the paypal gateway... that just shows me nothing but a lack of respect. I\'m about 2 posts away from resigning my commision, cause i got better things to do than go back and forth with a ficticious acct. about someone elses fears regarding a deal! I ain\'t no ones punching bag!\r\n\r\nI don\'t know man, but I gotta take break right now...\r\n\r\nLater,\r\nB[/quote:b64aacbce3]\r\n\r\nI feel the exact same way about it.. I feel like he slammed me as well.. That\'s one thing I never do.. Bring personal shit to the boards. If he\'s having issues at home, that a whole other deal..\r\n\r\nI think he\'s pissed at me for pushing the issue further, but why didn\'t he say anything in the begining?   I really feel like this is a good deal for us.\r\nI just don\'t understand why he\'s so freaked out over $45.\r\n\r\nI kinda take offense to him saying that shit after we offered to help.. Especially when I think about what I had to go through to get him into this hobby..\r\n\r\nHe was leary of spending $15 on a clone, so I had to buy him a car and paint it, and send it to him for free. just to get him interested.   Weird..\r\n\r\n\r\nLike you said I\'m nobodies punching bag.. I don\'t mind if people vent TO me, but not AT me..  Lets keep the PMs on the down low for our personal use...   Fuck... Now I need a hit.. And a beer, and I don\'t even drink...lol\r\n\r\n\r\nI\'m still in on the buy.. I must have em..\r\n\r\n\r\n-Steve');
