INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (1132, '2534f7ab83', 'you get "bitPimp" forum status.\r\nyou get some "surveillance" shots up along with a short bio on the "members" page.\r\nyou get an email address: hogjowlz@lixlink.com *\r\nyou get a website: http://hogjowlz.lixlink.com **\r\nthere will be a funny/cleaver press release written about how you\'ve just been inducted.\r\n\r\n* the email address you can have forward to an existing account, or\r\nyou can use it outright by using your own email client, or\r\nyou can use it outright by using a "webmail" interface that I have ready.\r\neither way, if you decide to become a pimp, let me know what you want me to do with the email, forward or not.\r\n\r\n** right now, all the "ring leaders" have a URL. none of us are using the sites yet though. our initial ideas were to release them all together, making them both a bio page and a tie in to eachother, and possibley other things in the future. right now since nobody is using them and there\'s no great demand, everyone gets 1MB of space (neat). that might increase in the future should we decide to do something with the ring leaders sites, but for now, I\'m keeping the space open for bitPimps.\r\nYou can use the url if you want or not.\r\n\r\nthat\'s about the gist of it.\r\nwhat do you think?');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (1189, '8a5aca53ec', 'This pimp is wildly revered as an innovator by pimps allover the world for installing tracking devices in every hoe in Pimp City.  Always conniving up new ways to take  the territory of rival gangs as well as increasing "prifitability margins" for his own crew. It is rumoured that Hogjowlz has been working on a "top secret" cadillac/tank with enough built in  fire power to claim the rest of the hold out neighborhoods in pimp city.\r\n\r\nturnons: loud radios and quiet hoes\r\nturnoffs: quiet raidos and loud hoes');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (1065, '9cff81e965', '[quote:9cff81e965="noxorc"]\r\nsure, it\'s a no-brainer... I\'d be honored to be a part of this.\r\n\r\nI feel the same about you guys... Like I\'ve stumbled across some old friends.    (like minds).  It\'s good to know, some people are the same, no matter where they are in America...\r\n\r\n-Nigel[/quote:9cff81e965]\r\n\r\nwe feel the same way, another reason why we chose you :)\r\nget ready, you\'re getting ready to see a new forum! lol\r\n\r\nwe\'ll talk more about what\'s going to happen...\r\ni.e. press release about our new member, you - the little "bio" that you\'ll need to write for the "Members" page, and a few other things that you\'ll have an option to do.');
