INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (1081, 'd1355a64a0', '[quote:d1355a64a0="noxorc"]\r\nGreat..  I\'ll try and login now..\r\nI\'ll have the mail forwarded as this point... don\'t recon I\'m going to get a lot.. so forward to  noxorc@attbi.com[/quote:d1355a64a0]\r\nit\'s done :)\r\n[quote:d1355a64a0="noxorc"]\r\nAs to space.... where is your server in your house or do you buy time on an ISP?  One area that I might be able to help, free of charge is hardware.\r\nIf you do it yourself and not rent an ISP.[/quote:d1355a64a0]\r\nCurrently I pay to get hosted. The ideas I have in my head take me to self-hosting, but it\'s just not option to me right now, my other computers are just shit and I know would bomb under a load. Thanks for the offer, wish I could take ya up on it. Maybe one day.\r\n[quote:d1355a64a0="noxorc"]\r\nDo you have a task list that moderators conform to?\r\nIe. if I\'m away from the boards for a couple of days, is that ok?[/quote:d1355a64a0]\r\nThat\'s totally fine, so far there hasn\'t been much moderating at all - the most major being the other night when we created the "Raw" crew stuff.\r\nThere\'s no task list really, just an ongoing "if ya see something that needs to be moderated, do it" and of course "if ya got some other input, good - bad - or otherwise, speak up in the moderators forum".\r\n\r\nOur main goals as moderators, as I see it anyway, is we should keep the place fun, exciting and new. I want to spark interests from all around. I want to attract the good, creative minds that are lurking out there looking for a place to call home - we\'ve got one for them. :wink:');
