INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (1533, 'bcdf4dde5e', 'You and me are thinking the same.\r\nI\'m sorry but I don\'t know any more information about this guy than you do.\r\nI can say that if I had a PayPal account, I\'d be more ready to do this deal due to the "fraud protection" - so if bad things happen - it\'s likely you\'ll get your money back.\r\n\r\nI on the other hand do not have a PayPal account, I\'d have to send a money order. There\'s no real way to get your cash back if he\'s a jerk and rips you off so you\'d better either trust the source or your taking a gamble.\r\n\r\nI tend to think the guy is honest. Payaso says he has called this guy "Ernie" (ezenterprizes) on the phone and talked to him about the whole deal. I can see why this guy wants some cash up front - I would too as an individual. That\'s another reason I prefer to pay an extra few bucks and deal with a well known and reputable company - there are assurances there that don\'t come with purchasing through an individual or a "mom and pop" shop.\r\n\r\nTo confuse you even more there\'s 2 sides to this ultimately.\r\neither:\r\n- he\'s an ass and found his gold mine where he plans on ripping off a large portion of a community and publicly letting everyone know some of his information (stupid - but stupid people do stupid things).\r\nor:\r\n- he\'s legit and trying to gain some footing in the community by doing this pretty large and confusing buy for whatever his purposes.\r\n\r\nwhich leads me to my last worry, this is the largest public buy I\'ve ever seen - I really don\'t see this order going off 100% without a glitch.\r\nThat is to say, I do believe most people will get what they\'ve ordered.\r\nHowever I can already hear stories of "lost shipments", "wrong orders", "missing items", etc. etc.\r\n\r\nOverall I\'m about 60% sure of this guy.\r\nOut of that 60%, I\'m about about 5% sure he\'s going to get enough people to send him the amount of cash he needs to make this "bulk" purchase without getting burned if people don\'t want them.\r\n\r\nBest I can do for ya DT.');
