INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (1913, '1edbc41424', 'Contest Chairmen:\r\nA while ago I offered to donate a 2nd place prize for the contest consisting of a [b:1edbc41424]Perfection 3.0 motor[/b.  I never heard back from you. I\'m adding a [b]Perfection Heat Sink [/b:1edbc41424]to that. And maybe the new  [b:1edbc41424]Perfection Ferrari Modena body[/b:1edbc41424] for 3rd place.  \r\nI\'ve seen the field of entree\'s so far, there are some real pimp Micro\'s out there and just having a 1st place is going to be very hard.  This will help ease the decisions you guys have to make and give the entrants a better chance at being rewarded for their hard work and participation.  I personally want this to be the contest that the Micro world will talk about on all the other boards. \r\n\r\nWhadaya Think?\r\nJust Lemme Know........');
