INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (2276, 'e555dd58be', 'Thank you for fast shipping to Germany!All my Friends are angry about my new Car(Because no one has it too...they want it!!! :-D )I have done a:\r\n-add Boosterplatine with Mosfetmod at first(the LED i put onto that car too)\r\n-Chassilowering\r\n-Cabondecals\r\n-add new spoiler\r\n-New better Steeringmod\r\n-other little Decals\r\nNow you can drive it :eek: \r\n\r\n\r\nI search for old looking Cars like Camaros or other...\r\nDo you know about old looking Bits from USA?\r\n\r\nI search for cool Cars too(like my new Car that you send me)!We in Germany have Cars like shit :sad: )\r\n\r\nI saerch for one Homies too---&gt;Boxer \r\n\r\nGreetings from Germany..Sinned/Dennis');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (1933, 'd443ca4b75', 'I understand man - we\'re more alike than we know.\r\nPlease don\'t read anything into you being removed from administration.\r\nAfter never hearing back from you - I took it as you were very pissed - I took you out because to me,  you not responding said you were un-interested in it.\r\nI\'ve told payaso and nox to try and contact you as well just so you know there\'s no hard feelings.\r\nYou\'re missed dude.\r\nI also made it very clear to them that you are welcome back at anytime and all that "admin" shit can be re-instated immediately.\r\n\r\nDude this dumb (the situation).\r\nWe have a good thing going here that was fun.\r\nA few fuck ups on my part and maybe other peoples parts and here we are.\r\nI really feel what we have here completely out weighs that one incident.\r\nFriends fight sometimes - but they\'re still friends, they\'re not mad forever.\r\n\r\nI\'m willing to do a lot here to make this go back to how it was.\r\nI\'m just not sure what to do or say - if you know, please let me know.\r\n\r\nthis thing started pretty much with 3 of us and then there were 4.\r\nI, and I know the others would love nothing more than to have you come back full force.\r\n\r\nAnyways, I know shit got all fucked up - I\'m not trying to force you one way or the other, though obviously I prefer you to be here as a friend, administrator, etc.\r\n\r\nI don\'t know what else to say besides:\r\nsorry\r\ncome back\r\nlets drop this crap\r\nlets have fun\r\nthe choice is yours - and your choice will be respected\r\n\r\nScott\r\n\r\n[quote:d443ca4b75="kwikbb"]Well Scott, i didn\'t send a reply right away because frankly i didn\'t know what to say. I don\'t how you interpreted that post nor what portion of it you found offensive.\r\nTherefore we are left with the current situation, i\'m not the kind of person to sit idle and take anyones crap so in defense i could only retaliate. I know i\'ve got a short fuse sometimes, so don\'t think i\'m blaming you for the entire incident. There is no doubt that what went down was very bad, so now i guess the best thing to do is play it low-key and leave things as they are.\r\n\r\nI see that i\'ve been removed from administration, which is fine with me.  I\'ve got some extra projects that i\'ll be working on, so my activity\'s gonna be spotty.\r\n\r\n-B \r\n\r\nOh BTW, if you could thank extreme micros for me i\'d appreciate it.[/quote:d443ca4b75]');
