INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (1965, 'ed96668849', '[quote:ed96668849="DarkTari"]Contest Chairmen:\r\nA while ago I offered to donate a 2nd place prize for the contest consisting of a [b:ed96668849]Perfection 3.0 motor[/b.  I never heard back from you. I\'m adding a [b]Perfection Heat Sink [/b:ed96668849]to that. And maybe the new  [b:ed96668849]Perfection Ferrari Modena body[/b:ed96668849] for 3rd place.  \r\nI\'ve seen the field of entree\'s so far, there are some real pimp Micro\'s out there and just having a 1st place is going to be very hard.  This will help ease the decisions you guys have to make and give the entrants a better chance at being rewarded for their hard work and participation.  I personally want this to be the contest that the Micro world will talk about on all the other boards. \r\n\r\nWhadaya Think?\r\nJust Lemme Know........[/quote:ed96668849]\r\n\r\nI think it sounds great...we me talk to the others...\r\nas to not hearing back from me,  Sorry, but this is the first I\'ve heard of this.\r\n\r\nI agree to have a contest that all other boards talk about...that would be awesome.\r\n\r\n-nox');
