INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (2025, 'eb8327713e', 'Hey DT,\r\nI wanted to drop you a line and an offer for you to think about. Take your time and let me know whenever, however ;)\r\nHere\'s the dealio (in no specific order):\r\n- You been representin hard core for the bitPimps community lately\r\n- You\'re offering up 2nd and 3rd place prizes for the community\r\n- You\'re doing and have done some significantly outstanding work on your bits\r\n- You just seem like a cool guy with a lot in common in between the "bitPimps"\r\n\r\nSo what\'s that all about?\r\nI want to offer you up a spot on the "bitPimps" crew. The "inner" circle so to speak.\r\nWhat you\'ll get is:\r\n- the bitPimp rank in the forums, in the bitPimps forum group, put up on the "Members" page with a bio and "survelliance photo", an email you can use or have forward to an existing account (darktari@lixlink.com), a little webspace for you to use if ya want (http://darktari.lixlink.com) - and a few other perks that rise up along the way. :wink: \r\nLast, but not least, I want to also at this time offer up a "moderator" postion to you. There\'s not a lot of work really, just cleaning up junk if you see it - but the pimps have been pretty good so that\'s been easy so far. Just plain old contribution however you can, weather it be to come up with a new "press release", "mod article", images, etc., etc. you know the drill.\r\n\r\nIf you want to be a bitPimp but not necessarily a moderator, that\'s fine too - we can arrange that.\r\n\r\nSo, take however long you need to think this over.\r\nLet me know whatchya think!');
