INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (3873, 'f1801da01f', '[quote:f1801da01f="DarkTari"]Got the decals yesterday, sprayed a clear on them and will test them on a new paint job soon\r\n\r\nThanx\r\n\r\nHow about sending me the file you printed it from\r\n\r\ndarktari@msn.com[/quote:f1801da01f]\r\n\r\nyea no prob.\r\nokay, let me add more variations to the file and send it to you. it\'s very bare bones right, only things in the file are what you got for decals. so I\'ll add more stuff to make it more worth while and then send it to you.\r\n\r\nremember, the chicks probably won\'t work on dark colors, they have transparancies in them. I need to find vector based graphics not rastor graphics.\r\n\r\nmore later.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (3857, '60c171fbcd', '[quote:60c171fbcd="payaso"]Steve Davis\r\n2508 Lynn Lake circle south Apt C\r\nSt Petersburg FL 33712\r\n\r\nThanks Nigel.. I think the decals that scott made have too much clear coat on em.. They need the thinnest coat you can put on.. I reccomend a airbrush.. They lay down the thinnest coats..  \r\nJust a thought..\r\n-Steve[/quote:60c171fbcd]\r\n\r\nScott used ink jet, I am using laser.  I did a test with and without clear coat.\r\nno different, except the process of adding clear coat.\r\nThe laser ink is different than inkjet.\r\nI let a set of non treated decals in water for a good 5 minutes.\r\nno bleeding.\r\nWell, now I got your addy again.. I\'ll drop them in the post.\r\nit\'s just a trial run, like scotts.  Let me know about size, good or bad.\r\nThe font changed at the last moment and changed the size.\r\n\r\n-nigel');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (2857, '311e66f3f0', '[quote:311e66f3f0="Havok"]what up dog?\r\n\r\nI\'ve got a situation, and I need a little advice.....\r\nYou probably saw in Kwik\'s thread about his ZZ cars, where we traded a gloria for a civic, I told him that I got burned on another civic.....\r\nThe guy that burned me is a member of this site and tinyrc..his name is Chris Day....he goes by the name Aquarius....I sent him a perfect Bb body....he sent me a black civic body that was all scratched up on the top and it is missing a side mirror....it looks like shit.....I contacted him, told him it was wrong of him to do that.....he says oops...thought you knew.....he told me he\'d send me a 350Z zipzap body....that was awhile ago, I\'ve tried to\r\ncontact him 3 times...nothin......this kid is 14 years old.....I know his address....what do you think I should do?....I know its just a body..and I could call it a loss....but its on the principle of this I don\'t want to......I gave him a good referral on tinyrc....which I\'m going to change soon.....\r\nhelp me out here man....what do you think?\r\npeace.......[/quote:311e66f3f0]\r\nfirst off - let me say that sucks!\r\n\r\nsecond off - thanks for the heads up on this kid, I\'ll make sure I never do any trades or anything with him, I\'ll let a few of my peeps know too. definetally change your positive referal post asap, otherwise some others that get burned off him will be leary of you too.\r\n\r\nand third - if it were me, and for such a low dollar amount ($20.00 and under), I\'d personally let it go. Why? Because its worth my 20.00 to not let that asshole get me any more pissed than I already would be. It\'s not worth the time and especially the efforts. For the price of that body, you just bought yourself proof positive that you don\'t want to deal with this moron, and the other thing you purchased was a right to let other people know how your transactions went.\r\nFuck him - you\'ll be getting more, you\'ll be better off, etc. etc.\r\nKarma [i:311e66f3f0]really[/i:311e66f3f0] is out there man and he we get what he deserves and so will you. All things come full circle grasshoppa :wink: lol\r\nseriously though.\r\n\r\nJust to give you a little comfort, or maybe it won\'t... but I\'m in a sticky situation right now too, and what sucks is I wasn\'t even going to be until I made myself feel bad for turning the whole thing down, so I changed my mind and now here I am - in the situation that I originally thought I\'d be in until I talked myself into it. (so basically I shoulda trusted my first instincts).\r\nanyways, the situation is that I have  $50.00 floating around right now, and have for the past month or so with no results yet... no nothing... and even if it all does work out, best case scenario I get my shit in about another 2 months.\r\nyea that pisses the fuck outta me baby, but I\'m willing to wait a certain period of time. the moment I feel for sure I\'ve gotten the ole "fuck you", I\'m gonna get my 50.00 worth somehow.\r\n\r\nSo there you see how I handle things.\r\nUnder 20.00 and I get burned, lesson learned, whatever.\r\nOver 20.00 and I get burned, lesson learned, and I\'m coming for your ass somehow to get what\'s owed. lol\r\n\r\nhope that helps homie.');
