INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (15741, '2266f8ad8b', '[quote:2266f8ad8b="Havok"]Wassup brotha\'?\r\n\r\nIt is gooood to be back. I have the next 3 days off.....and besides the SuperBowl (GO PATS!!!!)(I am from Boston you know), I\'m not doing a damn thing except getting my track together and cleaning up my "bit" work area. \r\n\r\nThat means I\'m gonna need some pimpin rides to roll out on that track soon :cool: \r\n\r\n :driving: \r\n\r\nlemme know wassup....and congrats on being "made" :lol:....\r\n\r\nand just in case....heres my address again  :lol: \r\n\r\nWayne Simard\r\n1422 West Monon Drive\r\nBloomington, IN\r\n47403-3020\r\n\r\nlater.........[/quote:2266f8ad8b]Well here\'s what\'s up with your cars... I think I pretty much got them all FETed. I got one set of alloys on. I went to put the alloys on the Zip Zap, and discovered one of the cells blew. So I got a mess in that one to clean up, and I\'m gonna re-dual cell it for ya. So I\'m saving that one for last. I was installing the alloys on your Micro Speed and ran into a couple issues, for one I threw the things from the pens on top of the trash, and the cat knocked it over, and got ink everywhere, by thte time I cleaned that up I was getting frustrated, and then I ended up loosing the steering spring on that car. I have no spare steering springs, so I\'m not sure what to do now. Do you have spare steering springs?\r\n\r\nSo anyways, most of your cars are done, just been putting off shipping them, \'cause I keep thinking, "this weekend I\'m going to do those last 2 wheel mods, so I can ship everything at once."\r\n\r\n...but knowing you\'re back in action, I want to get you some of your cars back, so I\'ll get down to the post office tomorrow, and ship most of them back, except the 2 that need the wheels installed.\r\n\r\n...and I\'m glad to hear your back, it hasn\'t been the same witout you. VDM became my partner, and he\'s cool, but he don\'t smoke up, so it\'s not the same. ;)  :lol: \r\n\r\nAlso I have to tell you, you\'re the one to pushed me to try FET mods when I didn\'t have the confidence. You also supplied me with the materials needed to experiment, and figure how to FET other cars. I\'ve recieved a great deal of recognition because of that, and I\'m really grateful to you for pushing me to try the mod in the first place.\r\n\r\nI mean you gotta know how it is when someone has faith in you, so thanks man.\r\n\r\nDave');
