INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (11799, '10db408169', '[quote:10db408169="hogjowlz"]yo just a heads up. ill be back. i just needed to take a vacation from bits for a minute while i reorganize my head and get shit done that needs it. ill try to pop in every coupla days if i can. \r\n\r\nsorry bout the crazy shit.[/quote:10db408169]hey man, thanks for poppin in and giving a heads up.\r\ndon\'t push yourself man, we know you\'re going through some serious crap right now - take your time and deal with what ya gotta deal with.\r\n\r\nyou know your spot will be just the same as you left it, poop stains and all.\r\ndont feel obligated to have to stop on the boards - do it for you. we do miss ya, but we also want you to have a good life away from here too, like any friends would.\r\n\r\none thing I did want to mention to you though...\r\nI know the contest prizes aren\'t due for another 2 months, but I just wanted to let ya know, if you gotta back away from modding the chassis - that\'s totally understandable. just give us plenty of notice so we can coordinate the efforts.\r\n\r\nanyways, I hope things start looking up for you (if they haven\'t already) and let us pimps know if there\'s anything we can do to help ya out.');
