INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (3963, 'f21d6afb5e', 'Hey!  Hope you\'re feeling better and get some sleep tonight.  I\'m so used to seeing you smile and cracking jokes and you sure weren\'t doing that at the pool tonight.  If you need to be cheered up or have nothing to do Friday, come over!  I would love to have help entertaining Britt!!  She gets bored too quick!  Oh, I forgot to tell you.  You know the "cheese ball" guy that lives next door?  Yesterday Britt went over to his door and knocked.  She introduced herself and told him to talk to her cause she\'s bored.  He came right over and they were listening to cds and were talking.  But he\'s 21.  I can\'t wait until school starts so she meets kids closer to her age!  She scares me!!  So do you though.  I get the distinct impression from listening to you and your friend that you guys are real concious about age.  You have to just tell me if I\'m cramping your style by talking to you so much, being that I\'m so old and all.  I\'m very straight forward so you can be too.  Britt is sleeping and I\'m watching Thirteen Ghosts for the hundredth time.  Guess by all this babbling you can tell that I can\'t sleep again.  This is the only thing that sucks about being single!!!  And on that note, I\'d better stop this email!!  Be cheered and sleep well tonight - I want to see that smile!!!');
