INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (4233, 'fb8f39c4a4', 'Really I was just more or less asking you for the diplomatic way to tell them no. I considered for minute, just because I didn\'t want to be an ass, but really your right I have found a new home. On other forums people can can insult and cut others down as long as they don\'t cuss, but here it\'s the opposite. We just homies kickin\' it in the hood playing with our little cars, we cuss, and rib each other but no one gets hurts, \'cause it\'s all good in \'da hood. Genious little plan you worked out.\r\n\r\nI see we feel the same about RCMod. ;)\r\n\r\nI think I\'m just going to say, "I did it as favor for BitPimps, so I\'d like for them to have it as an exclusive for now, I\'ll consider it for the future though.";);) You know don\'t call me, I\'ll call you. Unless you have a more diplomatic suggestion?\r\n\r\nDave');
