INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (12365, '07d1878bb1', 'Hey been meaning to PM you haven\'t quite got around to it.\r\n\r\nJust to update you. I have all your cars mosfeted, I just have to install the alloys. I meant to get to the wheels yesterday, but VDM sent me his cars to work on, and I just had to lay some flames on the his sick green Beetle. (Of coarse he wasn\'t saying no). So you know me, when I\'m inspired, I gotta act on it.\r\n\r\nBut then lat night when I was finishing off the paint job, I suddenly realized where I went wrong with the Thunder Charger Mosfet mods, and had to test that out. Now I have to redo you Thunder Charger, Microspeed, and Yellow Mini. \r\n\r\nI\'m taking really alot longer than I intended. I gonna buckle down, and focus on getting your cars out this week.\r\n\r\nAlso been meaning to comment on a couple of your cars. \r\n\r\nThat Microsizer Impreza, what motor you got in there? \'Cause this thing is screaming after the FETs. Also I had to put the steering adjuster all the way to the right to get it to track straight, but then it kinda swerved back and forth. I discovered one of you rear wheels had come loose. So I crimped the axle, and glued it back on. It tracks dead straight now, with the steering adjuster dead center. With the combo of speed and handling, that is by far the most perfect car that you have sent.\r\n\r\nAlso, That Yellow Mini is pretty neato. Where did you score that from? I think I\'d like to try to find one of those.\r\n\r\ndave');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (3962, 'f21d6afb5e', 'Hey!  Hope you\'re feeling better and get some sleep tonight.  I\'m so used to seeing you smile and cracking jokes and you sure weren\'t doing that at the pool tonight.  If you need to be cheered up or have nothing to do Friday, come over!  I would love to have help entertaining Britt!!  She gets bored too quick!  Oh, I forgot to tell you.  You know the "cheese ball" guy that lives next door?  Yesterday Britt went over to his door and knocked.  She introduced herself and told him to talk to her cause she\'s bored.  He came right over and they were listening to cds and were talking.  But he\'s 21.  I can\'t wait until school starts so she meets kids closer to her age!  She scares me!!  So do you though.  I get the distinct impression from listening to you and your friend that you guys are real concious about age.  You have to just tell me if I\'m cramping your style by talking to you so much, being that I\'m so old and all.  I\'m very straight forward so you can be too.  Britt is sleeping and I\'m watching Thirteen Ghosts for the hundredth time.  Guess by all this babbling you can tell that I can\'t sleep again.  This is the only thing that sucks about being single!!!  And on that note, I\'d better stop this email!!  Be cheered and sleep well tonight - I want to see that smile!!!');
