INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (4679, '2f2ab00cab', 'All i have is a wt16 RIGHT NOW. Thats kewl, i never heard of that restaurant chain  but EVERYONE here hosts a "hotrod" meet just about every week . Even subway has one every sunday . Some really nice cars. I dont know about Bowie but in Glen Burnie mustangs were like assholes...... everyone had one. I cant stand mustangs. I had a 95 Z28, very nice, power everything, 6 speed, t-tops. I loved F\'in wit all the mustang boys LOL :-)  It was even funner on my crotch rocket. Ahhh, memory lane, now im married with kids and all the toys are gone.  :(   I must rebuild my colection with bigger and better toys now :smile:  Anyhows.....\r\n\r\nShall i expect a money order again?');
