INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (4833, '3fde236eef', '[quote:3fde236eef="Havok"]Cool man,\r\nI\'ll let you know when.....I found out today that hes out of batts, so it might be a minute....hes gonna e-mail me back later today...\r\n\r\nI got a 4-AA thing at RS for $2 and change yesterday in anticipation so that works out great.... :smile:\r\n\r\nnext questions.....what frequency on the chassis? it doesn\'t matter to me...either one will be new or damn near...and do you need a controller....I have no problem with that...I have like 3 of each...\r\n\r\npeace..... 8-)[/quote:3fde236eef]\r\nAt first I was all confused, "what does he mean what frequency I thought we were doing his car?", but then I realized you meant the Zip Zap your sending for me. \r\n\r\nThat\'s cool man, don\'t worry about the frequency or the radio, I was actually expecting a stripped chassis, and I was going to put a TC PCB in it. That\'s why I got confused. I guess if it has the PCB in it already I could use another 27mhz.\r\n\r\nWhatevers clever, I\'m not picky. \r\n\r\nHere\'s a deal on batteries:\r\nhttp://batterieswholesale.com/products_batteries/nimh/nickel-metal-hydride-14-aaa-150-h.htm\r\nlook about 3/4 way down the page they have a sampler pack of 1/4 AAAs, 8 batteries for $13 shipped. It\'s a good deal, but it\'s coming from Australia, so it takes about 10 days to get to you, but if Extreme is out of stock, it may work out to be the same time.');
