INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (14504, '33795c0391', '[quote:33795c0391="CaboWabo"]sup dave...\r\nI need to ask you a question.\r\nThe bitPimps are in a little bind right now.\r\nA few of the moderators have had some personal issues IRL that requires them to be less active as a member (totally understandable).\r\nhowever, that has put us in a bind with the contest prizes.\r\n\r\nwhat we\'re missing is a mod.\r\noriginally we were going to give 1st and 2nd place dual cell mods.\r\nour best dual cell modder can\'t do them right now.\r\nso we switched to fets.\r\nI gave up one of my fets for the 2nd place mod.\r\nnow, we\'re missing the 1st place mod.\r\n\r\nwhat I\'m asking is if you could do a fet mod on a chassis we send you for us to use as our contest prize? (props given on board of course, and we can work out some sort of payment for your time and skill, etc.)\r\n\r\nnow, please know I\'m only asking you because I completely trust you and know your work is the bombastic, I drive it daily.\r\nso, with that - you shouldn\'t feel bad if you cannot help us out here.\r\nno matter if its missing fets, time, cash, whatever - don\'t feel bad if you can\'t do it.\r\n\r\nnow, if you can, that\'s friggin awesome - what I need to know next is what do you need/want for it?\r\n\r\nand just a little more insight in case you do decide you can do this...\r\nI\'m thinking... (and nothing is set in stone, just me thinking)\r\npayaso would be sending you a chassis, you\'d mod it for us and ship it back. your job is done, we got our mod, and our winners get a fetted sled.\r\n\r\nlet me know what you think man\r\nC-Dub (Scott)[/quote:33795c0391]Yeah you know that\'s cool with me. I gots da FETs! :cool: \r\n\r\nI never know what to ask for FET mods, so if you could just cover the shipping, and if you want to throw me anthing extra that\'s cool too. ;)\r\n\r\ndave');
