INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (8032, 'cfc0d72036', '[quote:cfc0d72036="hue35"]Hey, ph2t. Do you have a pic or a link to a pic of a 2-speed tomy car with a mosfet mod? I saw a small fuzzy pic on micro_amp\'s site, but I can\'t really tell what\'s goin\' on. I would love to see a clear pic of that pcb with all the mosfet work done on the top side (no wires routing underneath)... or even a drawing.\r\n\r\nI have to say again, that knight rider mod is incredible... I really want to learn how to read schematics better so I can start trying some of that stuff. I\'m really enjoying the micro soldering a lot. Once you get some successes, it becomes addicting! \r\n\r\nthanks, pimp. \r\n\r\nhue35[/quote:cfc0d72036]\r\n\r\nHey man, unfortunately I don\'t I\'m sorry.  I\'ve never modded a TOMY booster, just a LXX booster.   If you can take a photo of that side of the pcb I\'ll check it out and see what I can do.\r\n\r\nThanks for the props with the kitt lights, took me foreverinaday to build the bloody thing.   I just bought a new soldering tip \'cause the one I had I eventually ground into extinction!  All you need is a fine tip and steady hand and a good back cause there\'s a lot of bending over.   Get a magnifying glass, that helps.  I use one of these buggers quite a lot now.\r\n\r\nCheers,\r\n\r\nph2t.');
