INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (8104, '02ed4d08cc', '[quote:02ed4d08cc="SkyLiNEz 4-eva!"]ive found that some of the mods here edit my posts and make me look gay. i take this as a serious offense. has this happened to others as well? an i have noticed that my post count keeps dropping. am i not wanted here? plz tell me.[/quote:02ed4d08cc]can you show me some examples of posts by you that have been edited "to make you look gay".\r\nThe moderators here don\'t do that stuff unless there\'s something bad in the post that needs to be taken out... \r\nso I\'d be very interested to see where this has happened - so please let me know so I can tell what I need to do.\r\nyour post count probably dropped a bit as we\'ve deleted some of your useless posts like "ok bye I\'m gone" and "vote and tell me if I should leave" type posts. Those have been deleted, because the posts mean nothing to the hobby or the community - that\'s why your post count went down, any post that is legitamate is still intact.\r\nas hogjowlz told you in his PM to you, you do not have to leave - we\'re not "banning" you. All we\'re asking is that you slow down on the posting overload, no more useless posts, and keep your posts on topic, make sure they have something viable to say about the topic.\r\nThis community is about fun and sharing knowledge, we\'re not going to allow our boards be cluttered with useless drivel like you might see on other community forums - by anyone, so we\'re not just singling you out here, there are several others we have had to speak with as well.\r\nJust play by the rules and you\'ll have fun and be aight.\r\nBreak the rules and you\'re gonna have us on your back.\r\nThat\'s about as simple as I can put it.');
