INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (9205, '93f684228b', '[quote:93f684228b="ezenterprises"]I know i can use excel to make columns with titles then go down the rows with each player and his info under each column but how do i take the info once i enter it to make different customized lists of certain criteria? Like make a list from the "database" of all the players that is just Quarterbacks, or a list that is just players on a given team. ETCETCETC. Is it possible or do i have to just manually figure it all out and make my own lists??[/quote:93f684228b]If you used excel, you\'d just tell the column to "sort by" whatever you choose.\r\nother ways would be to have this "database" full of info. and make different "queries" to the database (i.e. I wanna see just quarter backs so the query would say something like: search and return all data entries whose column matches "quarterback".\r\nsomething like that.');
