INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (8477, '6d1adb5123', '[quote:6d1adb5123="ph2t"]hey C\'dog, thanks for awarding me 2nd place, that\'s just mad!  \r\n\r\nMy addy is\r\n\r\nMatt Marcos\r\n17 Adrian Street\r\nBENTLEIGH EAST VIC 3165\r\nAUSTRALIA\r\n\r\nThanks again.  I\'d also like to say that I\'m happy to offer some of my own mods for your prizepool.  be it the custom h-bridge(coming close to finishing it), or say a lights pcb kit, or whatever I think off just let me know. You\'ve got a great site here and I wanna help feed it, lol...\r\n\r\nCheers dude.\r\n\r\nMatt.[/quote:6d1adb5123]yo brotha...\r\nyou still up for this?\r\nis one of the knight rider lights too much to be just giving away?\r\nif so, maybe the surface mount leds setup?\r\n\r\nor you don\'t have to do any of it - your call man.\r\njust know there won\'t be any hard feelings if you don\'t wanna do any of this - it\'s not expected from anyone.');
