INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (10638, 'e1e7b760d9', '[quote:e1e7b760d9="hogjowlz"]if ya do and you want a part in the bitpimps video send em to myaaiko@comcast.net or post em up.\r\n\r\nthat beetle is something else.[/quote:e1e7b760d9]Naw, no more vids right now. I\'ll try to make more this week.\r\n\r\n...and thanks for the compliment on the Beetle, I\'m proud of that thing.\r\n\r\nDave');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (11128, '965c699837', '[quote:965c699837="Havok"]no shit? cool I\'m glad VooDoo came to you...thats my boy...he just sent me the whole series 7 set of Homies(palmeros)...just because I\'ve hooked him up with some free homies....he\'s a pimp :cool:...... don\'t tell him, but I\'m gonna send him some more free shit.....poor guy can only get Walmart clones...he can\'t get anything else unless he drives for 2-3 hours....and even then he gets raped on the prices.....I gotta hook him up....:grin:\r\n\r\n\r\nI wanted to ask you,....and I thought I already did....but I must not have sent the PM I wrote yesterday....again I\'m a burnout :lol:............,\r\n\r\nI have a Cyclona BCG thats 57mhz.....is one of my controllers I sent you a 57mhz? if not I have to find it.....and I have a 27mhz MS complete with the controller to send.....lemme know if you have the 57 and I\'ll send \'em.....other than that....I think thats all I\'ll need FET modded until I get a ZZ SE......I\'ll let you know on that too.... 8-)[/quote:965c699837]Wow, I didn\'t even know series 7 is out. Yeah, VDMs cool. I gave him the Pimp\'s deal.\r\n\r\nNope, you didn\'t send me a 57mhz controller. I do not have one either. guess you\'re gonna have to look harder. ;)\r\n\r\nNo need to send the controller with the 27mhz microsizer. I\'ve got plenty of those.\r\n\r\ndave');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (10640, 'b2f782d445', 'Thats cool, you probably go right by me when you go back. We\'re only 5-6 hours apart.\r\n\r\nbut..... I\'m from Boston originally. I moved to Indiana in \'97. I\'ve lived all over NW Indiana....the region....started in Portage,then Lakestation, Gary, Crown Pointe, Merrillville....and I know alot of people in the South Bend/Elkhart area... you\'ll have to stop by and race my track sometime....also....Extreme Micros (from here), is opening a shop with some tracks in Princeton, IN. Thats by Evansville....hes going to hold races a few times a week, I\'ll be there alot...its only 2 hours away from me....Cabo Wabo and Payaso will also be going sometimes......I figured you may want to know 8-)\r\n\r\nand.... I sent your homies today....they\'re in a white bubble wrap envelope, sent 1st class....so 3-4 days....\r\n\r\nlater man..... :grin:');
