INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (10696, 'ee60894f19', '[quote:ee60894f19="CaboWabo"]I don\'t know if I\'m just totally please with the mosfet and making shit up in my head or if ya did something, but...\r\nit seems I get much better range now with that chassis after you did the mosfet.\r\n\r\nI fuckin love this thing\r\nthanks again for the hook up dude.\r\nI haven\'t said anything about it in the forums yet because I\'m hoping to get some video of it in action - that\'s when I was gonna lay it out for everyone whatchya did for me.[/quote:ee60894f19]Oh yeah, I did do something. I untied that knot from your antenna, that was hidden under the PCB. I do that to all my antennas, I did it to yours without thinking. \r\n\r\nIt does help range, puts about a 1/2" more antenna outside the car.\r\n\r\nCool, glad your happy with it. \r\n\r\nIt seems to add power more than speed, so try your fastest gear ratios, with your fastest motors, and you shouldn\'t be disappointed.\r\n\r\nDave');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (10645, 'fe6f4c0f4b', '[quote:fe6f4c0f4b="DarkTari"]Cool, lemme know when you get a part number.\r\n\r\nHavoc is the one that informed me and said to contact you.\r\n\r\nI\'ll be lookin for your bug.  I finished mine a couple of weeks ago but still haven\'t posted yet.  I\'m putting that in the AusMicro contest but I\'ll post it in [b:fe6f4c0f4b]Custom[/b:fe6f4c0f4b] before I do.\r\n\r\nSo let me know how much per car you\'ll charge.  I\'ll ship to you and pay for return.\r\n\r\nThanx Pimp![/quote:fe6f4c0f4b]The part number is, IRLML2502. Here\'s a link to the the page at digikey.com, http://www.digikey.com/scripts/us/dksus.dll?Detail?Ref=14374&amp;Row=201279\r\n\r\nYeah I couldn\'t wait to see your Beetle any longer, so I got mine together. ;)\r\n\r\nSo you don\'t want to make an offer? You going to force me to set a price? :roll: \r\n\r\nOk then, but you\'re still getting a deal, 4 bucks+shipping, per car. If you\'re ordering the FETs, and want to throw some of those my way that would be cool too. I\'m also in need of PCB covers, steering knuckles, and steering springs. I\'ll knock dollars off for any trade you want to make.\r\n\r\nSound good?\r\n\r\nDave');
