INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (10728, '8ed0df2024', '[quote:8ed0df2024="Havok"]Need any before I post this in my xtra thread?\r\n\r\n[img:8ed0df2024]http://pic7.picturetrail.com/VOL197/1135699/2167259/34061294.jpg[/img:8ed0df2024]\r\n\r\n\r\nand some more shit :grin: .......\r\n\r\nhow\'s the mosfet car(s)? Just curious...mine are tight...\r\n\r\nI\'m going to transfer departments/ get promoted at my job soon....my shift will change to days..7:30am-4:00pm, at least for awhile...I might go back to nights...not sure yet.... I\'m telling you this so we can both go to Todd\'s shop in Princeton....I will be able to any evening...I\'ll be working days Saturday, Sun, and 3 weekdays...that I have to choose when I get there\r\n\r\n\r\nand.....thanks for the vote @ rcmod....you and Voodoo Mafia both voted for me :grin: I\'m just lovin that I got votes...screw winning...this is good enuff... :cool:[/quote:8ed0df2024]I might need the mail carrier dude - not sure, I\'ll have to check tonite when I get home.\r\n\r\nI still haven\'t had the time I\'d like to play with the mosfet dave did for me yet, I have played a little, but haven\'t even had a chance to change motors in it.\r\nand yea, so far the thing is fucking awesome! lol\r\nI love the power gain without the weight gain of an extra battery.\r\n\r\nglad to hear things are looking up for you man (promotion!) - gotta dig that!\r\ndid todd ever hold his other race?\r\nwonder how that went?\r\nI still got plans to get up there someday.\r\n\r\nyea no prob on the votes, you deserve em, that shaggin wagon was off the hook!');
