INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (10765, '8f3f0b2086', '[quote:8f3f0b2086="CaboWabo"]yo man, I\'m going through finally and sifting through all the modifications that are actual articles.\r\nI found another one of yours I\'d like to use if that\'s okay with you?\r\nits the Lo Pro PCB Cover mod found here:\r\nhttp://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewtopic.php?t=943\r\n\r\nany chance you still have those pics laying around somewhere?\r\n\r\nI\'ve been thinking, I might be able to squeeze out 10 MB of space.\r\nif I could, and I gave you that space, could you upload your "important" pics there so the threads stay valid with the pictures?\r\nthis way you don\'t have to delete the images from your server (saving space) and the thread stay valid with imagery.\r\nThe only problem I could see is if you didn\'t optimize images to the fullest, you\'d fill up the 10 mb rather quickly, but it seems you know how to optimize so I\'m thinking you\'d get a lot of use outta the space.\r\n\r\nobviously I\'d prefer not to have to provide the space for it, but for something as legitamate as a modification article that helps others, I\'m willing to bend the rules a bit.\r\n\r\nlet me know what you think.[/quote:8f3f0b2086]You know, I thought my Lo-Pro PCB cover was a good idea, but it didn\'t seem to get much interest.\r\n\r\nAnyways, I still got the pictures somewhere on my harddrive. I\'ve got plenty of space, my old pictures are broken because my wife decided not to renew that domain. I havn\'t even used the first 10mb of my 60mb that came with my Cox service, but I haven\'t fixed the old pictures because, honestly, I\'m too lazy to set up the FTP on that Cox service, and been uploading my pictures one by one. Also I have to go through all my old post, here and at TRC. What a nightmare.\r\n\r\nSo I decided to fix pictures as people ask about them.  :grin: \r\n\r\nI\'ll go ahead and set up my FTP so I can upload everything at once, then if you come across anything you want fixed, you\'ll just have to change the erinsbaby.com/davesstuff/ to members.cox.net/crazylittlecars.\r\n\r\nI\'ll let you know when I get that done.\r\n\r\nDave');
