INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (10867, '6f099785b8', '[quote:6f099785b8="Havok"]Alright......I suck...at anything mechanical apparently...sure I can program a computer..knock your ass out with my martial arts experience....shoot ya from a mile away with a sniper rifle....\r\n\r\nbut I just cannot seem to get these damn rims mounted...I tried with 1 set...3 times...I suck :lol:\r\n\r\n\r\nand now I will get to the point....I think you still owe me $15.00 for the alloys....\r\n\r\nIf I supply all the necessary parts, wil you put together 3 sets of alloy rims for me?...and we\'ll call us even on the $15?\r\n\r\nI have the rims, 2-5 packs (10) of the Pentel RSVP medium line pens(all they had a few days ago) , and some axles and knuckles...I\'ll \r\nget anything else needed....\r\n\r\n\r\nI am pretty confident in my body modding abilities...and I seem to be doing pretty well on my track....but the electronics and mechanics......thats another story....a funny one :lol:\r\n\r\nlet me know whatcha think... :grin:[/quote:6f099785b8]Sounds like  a heluva good deal to me. \r\n\r\nSounds like you got everything I need. \r\n\r\n..and don\'t feel bad, those rims are bitch and a half to mount, notice how many people have bought them, and how few you actually see on cars?\r\n\r\nOh yeah, and you got a picture of that bug w/ a whale tail you had? I\'ve been looking all over for one.\r\n\r\ndave');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (10777, 'e6a2aab8f8', '[quote:e6a2aab8f8="Havok"]No mail carrier for you man....I know I remember sending him to you last month...maybe July...and hey...this is between you and I only.....for now.......use this link to see what I\'ve been doing......  :shock: \r\nIt is very far from done, but I figured I\'d give you a tease.....and there will be a story about the Homies... but that will be later...\r\n\r\n:grin:\r\n\r\n\r\nhttp://www.picturetrail.com/gallery/view?p=999&amp;gid=2790418&amp;uid=1135699[/quote:e6a2aab8f8]lol good thing you can remember, cuz I can\'t lol\r\n\r\nholy fucking shit dude!\r\nthat things gonna be awesome!\r\nthose pics are sweet, I love the light trim, god I gotta do that');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (10778, 'b4140258a4', 'The lights are tight as fuck.......they have 8 functions...and I know you can\'t tell but they are on the chasing mode in the pics.......\r\nand I have a little strobe light above the table too....looks sweet....\r\nI told you how I get migraines from the sun and certain bulbs....well, its just natural that I build a track to race on at night 8-)\r\n\r\nthe base is 6\'x30".....not a lot of space to work with, so I went for the twist on a classic figure 8...... like I said...far from done....I\'m getting a ton of course stickers and shit from bithed in a couple of weeks.....\r\n\r\n\r\nand if you get any series 7 extras....keep me in mind...I can\'t find them around here yet....and its much more fun to trade than but the whole set together...... :grin:\r\n\r\npeace....gotta start workin now... been here for an hour and aint done shit....damn I love my job.......');
