INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (10860, '1809029bf4', 'S2K came out pretty good Brendan.  A couple of suggestions:\r\n[b:1809029bf4]Detail[/b:1809029bf4]: door handles, head lights, driving lights, exhaust, mirrors, etc.\r\n[b:1809029bf4]Question:[/b:1809029bf4] what is the space behind the seats used for?  In the future, when making a convertable, always start your rear shelf at the rear of the front door especially when there\'s little trunk and place your seats just in front of that.  That leaves more trunk to show, makes it look more realistic.  I\'m putting the touches on my body mod tuit, will post soon.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (10862, 'eb433e0218', 'Alright......I suck...at anything mechanical apparently...sure I can program a computer..knock your ass out with my martial arts experience....shoot ya from a mile away with a sniper rifle....\r\n\r\nbut I just cannot seem to get these damn rims mounted...I tried with 1 set...3 times...I suck :lol:\r\n\r\n\r\nand now I will get to the point....I think you still owe me $15.00 for the alloys....\r\n\r\nIf I supply all the necessary parts, wil you put together 3 sets of alloy rims for me?...and we\'ll call us even on the $15?\r\n\r\nI have the rims, 2-5 packs (10) of the Pentel RSVP medium line pens(all they had a few days ago) , and some axles and knuckles...I\'ll \r\nget anything else needed....\r\n\r\n\r\nI am pretty confident in my body modding abilities...and I seem to be doing pretty well on my track....but the electronics and mechanics......thats another story....a funny one :lol:\r\n\r\nlet me know whatcha think... :grin:');
