INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (11115, '965c699837', '[quote:965c699837="Havok"]no shit? cool I\'m glad VooDoo came to you...thats my boy...he just sent me the whole series 7 set of Homies(palmeros)...just because I\'ve hooked him up with some free homies....he\'s a pimp :cool:...... don\'t tell him, but I\'m gonna send him some more free shit.....poor guy can only get Walmart clones...he can\'t get anything else unless he drives for 2-3 hours....and even then he gets raped on the prices.....I gotta hook him up....:grin:\r\n\r\n\r\nI wanted to ask you,....and I thought I already did....but I must not have sent the PM I wrote yesterday....again I\'m a burnout :lol:............,\r\n\r\nI have a Cyclona BCG thats 57mhz.....is one of my controllers I sent you a 57mhz? if not I have to find it.....and I have a 27mhz MS complete with the controller to send.....lemme know if you have the 57 and I\'ll send \'em.....other than that....I think thats all I\'ll need FET modded until I get a ZZ SE......I\'ll let you know on that too.... 8-)[/quote:965c699837]Wow, I didn\'t even know series 7 is out. Yeah, VDMs cool. I gave him the Pimp\'s deal.\r\n\r\nNope, you didn\'t send me a 57mhz controller. I do not have one either. guess you\'re gonna have to look harder. ;)\r\n\r\nNo need to send the controller with the 27mhz microsizer. I\'ve got plenty of those.\r\n\r\ndave');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (10901, 'f771f75b83', '[quote:f771f75b83="crazydave"][quote:f771f75b83="Havok"]Alright......I suck...at anything mechanical apparently...sure I can program a computer..knock your ass out with my martial arts experience....shoot ya from a mile away with a sniper rifle....\r\n\r\nbut I just cannot seem to get these damn rims mounted...I tried with 1 set...3 times...I suck :lol:\r\n\r\n\r\nand now I will get to the point....I think you still owe me $15.00 for the alloys....\r\n\r\nIf I supply all the necessary parts, wil you put together 3 sets of alloy rims for me?...and we\'ll call us even on the $15?\r\n\r\nI have the rims, 2-5 packs (10) of the Pentel RSVP medium line pens(all they had a few days ago) , and some axles and knuckles...I\'ll \r\nget anything else needed....\r\n\r\n\r\nI am pretty confident in my body modding abilities...and I seem to be doing pretty well on my track....but the electronics and mechanics......thats another story....a funny one :lol:\r\n\r\nlet me know whatcha think... :grin:[/quote:f771f75b83]Sounds like  a heluva good deal to me. \r\n\r\nSounds like you got everything I need. \r\n\r\n..and don\'t feel bad, those rims are bitch and a half to mount, notice how many people have bought them, and how few you actually see on cars?\r\n\r\nOh yeah, and you got a picture of that bug w/ a whale tail you had? I\'ve been looking all over for one.\r\n\r\ndave[/quote:f771f75b83]\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nSo how about this......can you mount the rims on axles and knuckles you already have? If so....I will send you back the ZZ you just mosfetted for me, so I\'ll have 1 set of ZZ alloys too. Can we do it? and which of the cars you have do you think we should mount them on....I\'ll go with your opinion.... 8-)\r\n\r\nlemme know....\r\n\r\n:D :D :D :D\r\nI\'m off for 3 days....I don\'t work again till 7pm (cst) on Friday\r\n:D :D :D :D');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (10902, '1354f6d468', 'That\'s a good idea, duh, I have your cars here.\r\n\r\nI\'ll probably do the clones because the pins pull out so much easier, but the knuckles are fully swappable. Some knuckles give you more or less steering. I think most my Microsizers have Thunder Charger knuckles in them now. Then again since those are the cars I know I can fully FET mod, you\'ll probably want to leave the alloys on those.\r\n\r\nWell anyways, I ramble, so ummm...good idea! :lol:');
