INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (12030, '109e40cdb7', '[quote:109e40cdb7="Yagbols"][quote:109e40cdb7="ph2t"][quote:109e40cdb7="Yagbols"][quote:109e40cdb7]Sorry man, I didn\'t mean to get the two countries mixed up.  I\'m looking for the Fairlady 350Z booster set on 57Mhz.  I know they are hard to comebuy but I\'m willing to trade the same stuff as my ZZ SE thread in "looking to score"  If you sent me the booster and a chassis of your own I\'m willing to put headlights, mosfet and all other performance mods on it and send you the chassis back.\r\n\r\nWhat do you think?\r\n\r\nCheers,\r\n\r\nph2t.[/quote:109e40cdb7]\r\n\r\ncool, now looking for a 350z is the hard part :eek:  I have one here its opened/used but still in stock form.  But ill look around for a new one. And if i want to get one of our kitt lights what do i add to the package?[/quote:109e40cdb7]\r\n\r\nWhat\'s the condition man?  Is it good condition?  If it is I\'m happy to take it :)   As for the Knight Rider lights I\'m happy to make them for you.   What I can do is that you send me one of your chassis and I\'ll add the circuit board to it.   The LED board that has the actual lights will be free-standing and you can mod a shell to suit no sweats.   What else do you have to trade?\r\n\r\nph2t.[/quote:109e40cdb7]\r\n\r\nI\'ll go over my stuff later tonite and see what i can trade.  The condition is good.  So do i just send you 1 chassis to modify with all the lights and stuff or do I send 2?[/quote:109e40cdb7]\r\n\r\nJust send the one chassis to do the Kitt lights.   \r\n\r\n[b:109e40cdb7]OR[/b:109e40cdb7]\r\n\r\nAlso I can do a different deal for you.  How does this sound instead.   You send me 2 chassis and I will mosfet mod them both for you for the used 350z booster.   I will also throw in the headlights mod.   So that is 2 mosfeted chassis and a headlights mod for the used 350z booster set.\r\n\r\nPersonally man I\'d rather do that because it is very tricky to do the Knight Rider light PCB.  I\'ve made many crap pcb\'s with a very low success rate.   Also the turnaround time for the mosfet mod is quicker.\r\n\r\nCheers man,\r\n\r\nph2t.');
