INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (11031, '065faedafb', 'Scott\r\n\r\nWanted to email you to ask you something and see if you would allow it prior to going any further.\r\n\r\nI am wanting to sell Extrememicros.com, the name, likeness, remaining stock, all suppliers, and everything that goes along with it.\r\n\r\nBasically, I was wanting to post a small post about looking to sell in the BST forum.  I know BST isn\'t for self biz promotion, but I really wouldn\'t be promoting the biz in a sense, just giving any members who might want to get into the game a shot.\r\n\r\nBasically, I would say the site, and all the goods, suppliers etc is for sale, then leave an email to contact me for further serious inquiries.\r\n\r\nIf you would rather I not, I totally respect that, and if you don\'t mind, I would appreciate that as well.\r\n\r\nAt any rate, the site is hosted for about 6 months still and the domain was bought for 1 year so it has about 6 months left as well.\r\n\r\nI have no clue what the biz is worth though, and wether or not you opt to let me post or not, I would appreciate your input on what a good starting point would be, as I know you are in the website game.\r\n\r\nWe have about 75-100 motors left, roughly 25 150mah cells and 10 210 cells, about 1500 single count worth or tubing left, labels, baggies, packaging stuff, ummm a bit of other stuff.  It doesn\'t sound like a lot, but the turn around is great on the profit.  \r\n\r\nThe site was a lot of work and the name is worth a decent amount I feel as it is fairly well known.\r\n\r\nJust let me know your thoughts.\r\n\r\nThanks again\r\nTodd');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (11032, '065faedafb', 'Scott\r\n\r\nWanted to email you to ask you something and see if you would allow it prior to going any further.\r\n\r\nI am wanting to sell Extrememicros.com, the name, likeness, remaining stock, all suppliers, and everything that goes along with it.\r\n\r\nBasically, I was wanting to post a small post about looking to sell in the BST forum.  I know BST isn\'t for self biz promotion, but I really wouldn\'t be promoting the biz in a sense, just giving any members who might want to get into the game a shot.\r\n\r\nBasically, I would say the site, and all the goods, suppliers etc is for sale, then leave an email to contact me for further serious inquiries.\r\n\r\nIf you would rather I not, I totally respect that, and if you don\'t mind, I would appreciate that as well.\r\n\r\nAt any rate, the site is hosted for about 6 months still and the domain was bought for 1 year so it has about 6 months left as well.\r\n\r\nI have no clue what the biz is worth though, and wether or not you opt to let me post or not, I would appreciate your input on what a good starting point would be, as I know you are in the website game.\r\n\r\nWe have about 75-100 motors left, roughly 25 150mah cells and 10 210 cells, about 1500 single count worth or tubing left, labels, baggies, packaging stuff, ummm a bit of other stuff.  It doesn\'t sound like a lot, but the turn around is great on the profit.  \r\n\r\nThe site was a lot of work and the name is worth a decent amount I feel as it is fairly well known.\r\n\r\nJust let me know your thoughts.\r\n\r\nThanks again\r\nTodd');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (11033, '89693cb211', '[quote:89693cb211="extrememicros"]Scott\r\n\r\nWanted to email you to ask you something and see if you would allow it prior to going any further.\r\n\r\nI am wanting to sell Extrememicros.com, the name, likeness, remaining stock, all suppliers, and everything that goes along with it.\r\n\r\nBasically, I was wanting to post a small post about looking to sell in the BST forum.  I know BST isn\'t for self biz promotion, but I really wouldn\'t be promoting the biz in a sense, just giving any members who might want to get into the game a shot.\r\n\r\nBasically, I would say the site, and all the goods, suppliers etc is for sale, then leave an email to contact me for further serious inquiries.\r\n\r\nIf you would rather I not, I totally respect that, and if you don\'t mind, I would appreciate that as well.\r\n\r\nAt any rate, the site is hosted for about 6 months still and the domain was bought for 1 year so it has about 6 months left as well.\r\n\r\nI have no clue what the biz is worth though, and wether or not you opt to let me post or not, I would appreciate your input on what a good starting point would be, as I know you are in the website game.\r\n\r\nWe have about 75-100 motors left, roughly 25 150mah cells and 10 210 cells, about 1500 single count worth or tubing left, labels, baggies, packaging stuff, ummm a bit of other stuff.  It doesn\'t sound like a lot, but the turn around is great on the profit.  \r\n\r\nThe site was a lot of work and the name is worth a decent amount I feel as it is fairly well known.\r\n\r\nJust let me know your thoughts.\r\n\r\nThanks again\r\nTodd[/quote:89693cb211]Absolutely, you can make your post however, where-ever you wish. I\'m sorry to hear you\'re getting out, I loved your products and dealing with you was great. Hope all goes well with this and your future ventures.\r\n\r\nTo be honest, I don\'t have much input on the business stuff, it seems like being "aquired" so to speak might be the best route and sounds like that is your initial plans.\r\nMore than likely, if you went this route and got aquired, the entity aquiring you will be interested in only 2 - maybe 3 things: your customer base, your stock, and maybe your supplier connections.\r\nI\'m guessing, but I think this because the entity aquiring you will probably be better positioned and able to keep everything the same as things change behind the scenes. (much like how TinyRC aquired Bit Char-G Motors)\r\n\r\nI wish I had more information to give you, but I\'d just be guessing and spewing my opinions, doubtful it would help you much.\r\n\r\nGood luck Todd, I hope you get what you deserve - all the good stuff - you\'re a good guy.\r\n\r\nSide Note:\r\nI\'m a little freaked because just tonite I was thinking about contacting you about buying a few batteries and motors... and then you PM me  :shock: \r\nAgent Smith, is this you? Am I in the Matrix?  :lol:');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (11034, 'c6703ecbe3', 'This guy on TRC discovered some stacked transistors on the bottom of the Zip Zap SE PCB. That would explain the increased performance in forwards. So I had to swap them for FETs, and it totally worked.\r\n\r\nSo now if it\'s cool with you I\'d like to use a couple more to see if stacking a third FET makes a difference, and to see if the one next to it improves reverse.\r\n\r\nHere\'s breakdown of what\'s left. After doing three of my cars, and Cabo\'s that leaves 37. (That\'s 4 per car, but I lost one in my carpet, and broke another ). I just used 2 more for the SE.\r\n\r\nI\'m going to be doing the full FET job on 3 of your cars (that\'s 12), and half FETing 2 of your cars. (that\'s 4 more) I\'m leaving the Micro Speed alone, and I\'m not sure about the Nakamichi.\r\n\r\nSo that\'ll leave 19 FETs after I do the batch of cars you sent me.\r\n\r\nJust wanted to keep you updated before I go using up too many of these things.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (11037, 'c40382e50c', 'you gonna order more fets in?\r\n\r\n  if so I would send some cars to get fetted up and even order some fets to try myself(prolly mess up but hey gotta try to learn)\r\n\r\n  Let me know and let me know a price if you offer this kind of service.\r\n\r\n  Thanks bro');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (11038, '8f6f82e32d', ':lol: are you seriously running low already?\r\ndamn, you been a busy boy! lol\r\n\r\naight, I gots a few things to address here:\r\n- I was already planning on sending you another MS Pro to mosfet and anti-boost sometime in the near future (I\'ve gotta get it to and back from hogjowlz first though), now if you know the SE\'s are kosher I\'d probably like to send you one of those as well. Any of that do-able? even with my timeframe? (could be awhile)\r\n- do you have a thread started somewhere about you offering up fets? I\'ve talked up you doing my fet job in a few places, but not sure if you had a specific place in mind?');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (11039, 'e1893153ad', '[quote:e1893153ad="CaboWabo"]:lol: are you seriously running low already?\r\ndamn, you been a busy boy! lol\r\n\r\naight, I gots a few things to address here:\r\n- I was already planning on sending you another MS Pro to mosfet and anti-boost sometime in the near future (I\'ve gotta get it to and back from hogjowlz first though), now if you know the SE\'s are kosher I\'d probably like to send you one of those as well. Any of that do-able? even with my timeframe? (could be awhile)\r\n- do you have a thread started somewhere about you offering up fets? I\'ve talked up you doing my fet job in a few places, but not sure if you had a specific place in mind?[/quote:e1893153ad]It\'s not so much that I\'m running low, as much as I\'ve got six cars of Havoks to do, and I\'m not sure how many more he\'s gonna want, so I don\'t wanna go using up all his FETs. I really gotta get some of my own.\r\n\r\nThat\'s why I haven\'t really gone around offering up my services, because I just have Havok\'s FETs right now, and while few people have expressed interest, no ones actually sent me money that I can buy some FETs with.\r\n\r\n...so anyways, you know in your case you get the deal. Just ask for return shipping, and either hook me up with some FETs, or donate to the \'cause so I can buy some.\r\n\r\nIf you want to score some you can get them at digikey.com and the part number is IRLML2502. They are 10 for 4.95, ther is a 5 dollar charge for orders under 25. That\'s why Havok ordered 55. Cost him 28 bucks after shipping.\r\n\r\nDave');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (18742, 'fd0a7530ee', 'Hey dood, the short problem was just a bad solder joint... this thing runs great now. Good top end, tons of torque, even steering, and it drives straight with the trim set in the middle. So that\'s that, but to be realistic, I\'m not going to get this in the mail until Monday. I wanna take the time to get it packaged nicely, and my Saturday is kinda screwed. So, sorry for the delay, but it\'ll leave here Monday.\r\n\r\njust wanted to give you an update, and I\'ll tell you when it\'s shipped.\r\n\r\n-Mat');
