INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (11746, '245f93fedd', '[quote:245f93fedd="payaso"]How big was the envelope they were in? I\'m hoping I didn\'t throw them away with some of the junk mail...  You know how that goes...lol \r\n\r\nThanks Dave.\r\n\r\n\r\n-Steve[/quote:245f93fedd]Don\'t worry you didn\'t throw them away. I just called my wife to see if she ever mailed it, and she found it in her purse.\r\n\r\nSorry about this. My wife refuses to keep stamps and envelopes around, because she can mail stuff from her work. So I rely on her to mail stuff. I\'m irritated she forgot about it, but what can I do, she\'s my wife.\r\n\r\nI\'m going to call her at work tomorrow to remind her. So I\'ll make sure it get\'s out.\r\n\r\nAgain, I am sorry, I feel ridiculous that it\'s gotton to this point, over a little piece of masking tape! Maybe if I had put it in a big box she wouldn\'t have forgot about it. I don\'t know anymore.\r\n\r\nDave');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (11064, '76398dcc26', '[quote:76398dcc26="crazydave"]It\'s not so much that I\'m running low, as much as I\'ve got six cars of Havoks to do, and I\'m not sure how many more he\'s gonna want, so I don\'t wanna go using up all his FETs. I really gotta get some of my own.\r\n\r\nThat\'s why I haven\'t really gone around offering up my services, because I just have Havok\'s FETs right now, and while few people have expressed interest, no ones actually sent me money that I can buy some FETs with.\r\n\r\n...so anyways, you know in your case you get the deal. Just ask for return shipping, and either hook me up with some FETs, or donate to the \'cause so I can buy some.\r\n\r\nIf you want to score some you can get them at digikey.com and the part number is IRLML2502. They are 10 for 4.95, ther is a 5 dollar charge for orders under 25. That\'s why Havok ordered 55. Cost him 28 bucks after shipping.\r\n\r\nDave[/quote:76398dcc26]cool man, thanks for the heads up.\r\nwell since I\'ve gotta wait a bit, that\'ll give me time to figure out how best to do this.');
