INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (11066, 'c048508947', '[quote:c048508947="VooDooMafia"]Well I am not sure on my soldering skills as far as fets.\r\n\r\n  I was thinking if I can get sme then cool I will order some LXX as they are cheap and  try it out.  Worst comes to worst I would end up with 4 bodies 2 cells, gears, heatsinks, motors and all teh other stuff I can rip from them for $13.00\r\n\r\n  But there is a few cars I have I would really like to see mosfetted the right way hehe.\r\n\r\n  I dont mind paying upfront for stuff.  Now that $8.00 per car is a nice deal for sure :)\r\n\r\n  What I can do is this.\r\n\r\n  I will send out some cash(unless you take paypal) for you to order some fets in.  I was thinking I have 2 or 3 cars right now I would like to get fetted up and prolly a few more in the future once the SE and stuff arrives.  I would also like to get some fets myself to try it on some cheapo cars.  \r\n\r\n  So if you let me know how much you want me to send for say 3 cars and 2 sets of fets I will send it out ASAP to yea so you can order some fets in.\r\n\r\n\r\n  Thanks\r\n\r\nPete[/quote:c048508947]Well the FETs aren\'t too expensive, so we\'ll just say an even 25+shipping for 3 cars, and 2 spare sets of FETs. I\'ll tell you what, micro_amps charges 20 bucks per car, but I just can\'t bring myself to charge that much.\r\n\r\nI do have paypal. You can make payments to my davesmoejoe@yahoo.com email.\r\n\r\nyeah, if you pay by paypal, I should get the mosfets by the time I get your cars, and be able to get them right back out.\r\n\r\nLet me know if you need my address again.\r\n\r\nDave');
