INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (11741, '12f1a4c0ed', 'How big was the envelope they were in? I\'m hoping I didn\'t throw them away with some of the junk mail...  You know how that goes...lol \r\n\r\nThanks Dave.\r\n\r\n\r\n-Steve');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (11742, '245f93fedd', '[quote:245f93fedd="payaso"]How big was the envelope they were in? I\'m hoping I didn\'t throw them away with some of the junk mail...  You know how that goes...lol \r\n\r\nThanks Dave.\r\n\r\n\r\n-Steve[/quote:245f93fedd]Don\'t worry you didn\'t throw them away. I just called my wife to see if she ever mailed it, and she found it in her purse.\r\n\r\nSorry about this. My wife refuses to keep stamps and envelopes around, because she can mail stuff from her work. So I rely on her to mail stuff. I\'m irritated she forgot about it, but what can I do, she\'s my wife.\r\n\r\nI\'m going to call her at work tomorrow to remind her. So I\'ll make sure it get\'s out.\r\n\r\nAgain, I am sorry, I feel ridiculous that it\'s gotton to this point, over a little piece of masking tape! Maybe if I had put it in a big box she wouldn\'t have forgot about it. I don\'t know anymore.\r\n\r\nDave');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (11743, 'f81423c7be', 'Your package is at my wife\'s work right now, so I\'ll be able to get everything finished up this weekend.\r\n\r\nMy Biglots finally got Microspeed cars in. I picked one up, and the transistors have markings on them so I can figure it out now, after I already swapped the PCB in your Microspeed with a Thunder Charger so I could FET yours. \r\n\r\nI just thought that was ironic.\r\n\r\nDave');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (11075, '30eb82c054', '[quote:30eb82c054="crazydave"][quote:30eb82c054="CaboWabo"]cool man, thanks for the heads up.\r\nwell since I\'ve gotta wait a bit, that\'ll give me time to figure out how best to do this.[/quote:30eb82c054]Actually I was just over excited last night. VDM just PMed me, and is gonna send me some money to do a few of his cars, and DT is suppose to be ordering FETs for me to do his cars, so really I should be covered on FETs by the time you want your stuff done.\r\n\r\n...but can you blame me for being excited? I have the first FET modded SE anywhere. Wanna race? :lol: \r\n\r\nDave[/quote:30eb82c054]hell no I can\'t blame ya! lol\r\nI\'d be all over that like white on rice on a paper plate in a snow storm lol\r\nyou\'s definitaly the first with mosfet SE\'s!');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (11076, '74d9bce875', '[quote:74d9bce875="VooDooMafia"]Yea I know micro amps charges $20.00 per car thats who did my first one lol.\r\n\r\n  I got the automodellista set from him plus single stack fet and return shipping was $50.00USD:(\r\n\r\n  OK I will paypal some $$ over to yea and its conna come from my Biz account so the e-mail will be diff.  It will come from "babastoybox@cogeco.ca"\r\n\r\n  couple things;  What do you need me to mail with the cars?(just chassies, controllers?)\r\n\r\n  How much should I add to that price for return shipping?\r\n\r\n  And is it ok if I just send 2 cars for now then the third later?  I am just waiting for my SE\'s to show up in the next few weeks.\r\n\r\n  I just have you addy in my inbox.  Man I think you live on the longest street in the world LOL[/quote:74d9bce875]I\'m not sure what return shipping will be. Probably at least 4-5 bucks, you think?\r\n\r\nJust need the car and the controller. Really if it\'s like a 27 or 49mhz microsizer, or zip zap I don\'t need the controller either. That\'s cool if you want to sent one later.\r\n\r\nYeah that is a long street name. Funny thing is it runs right through the middle of town, and there really is a school for Indians on it.\r\n\r\ndave');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (11079, 'a0bbcf9be5', 'OK dude I sent out your series 7 set :)  you should get it in like 4-5 days(i hope).\r\n\r\n  If you ever have extra stuff to sell just let me know I am always looking for bodies cheap clones and shit like that.\r\n\r\n  Around here we have clones at walmart for $20.00 canadian(about $14-16USD) but we get no Bits, ZZ\'s, MZ\'s ot digi Q\'s.\r\n\r\n  If I want anyof that I have to drive few hours and pay up the nose for that shit.\r\n\r\n  If you ever come accross digi q stuff let me know I will buy that up in a heart beat lol.\r\n\r\n Pete');
