INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (11340, 'c324abee55', 'ok I am just waiting for some cars to come in the mail damn post lol\r\n\r\n  but I will be sending\r\n\r\n 1.tomy 1 speed\r\n 1.LXX 2 speed\r\n 1. zip zap plus clone for switch\r\n\r\n\r\n  I was also wondering those other 2 sets of fets if I send yea some more cash can you do 2 more cars lol\r\n\r\n  I know I am prolly asking alot.  I have this se that I just got from sessiz and sessiz has an SE that we wanted to get fettted.\r\n\r\n  If this is OK sessiz said he would send some cash of course for his se and I can add what you want in the package from me.\r\n\r\n  then when you want to order fets again I will just get some extra sets then.  Plus if you are still doing it I have a ton of cars that all beg me for fets lol.\r\n\r\n  Let me know what yea thinking\r\n\r\nPete');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (11341, 'b6f31cbd42', '[quote:b6f31cbd42="ph2t"][quote:b6f31cbd42="CaboWabo"][quote:b6f31cbd42="ph2t"]hey man,\r\n\r\njust finishing up on the mods and I will mail it off on Monday 6/10.   \r\nJust a question though.   Being a resourcfull bugger you have shipped the whole shebang! lol.    With the headlights, do you want me to afix them to the gloria shell or just leave them be and you can choose what shell you want to afix them to?\r\n\r\nAlso, don\'t pay me any mad cash yet.   When I go to the post office I will find out the cost of shipping the box back to you.   Once I know that I\'ll let you know.\r\n\r\nAlso man, sessiz has sent me a chassis to fet mod as well and all he did was post the bare chassis not including anything (like motor, axle,heatsink, etc).  He posted this in a padded envelope and I got it without any damage and stuff.   From the looks of the USPS sticker on the bag it only cost him like $2.   Of course we confirmed that I had a controller on the right freq to be able to test first so that negated the need for that.   This is just a headsup to say if you wanted any futher mods in the future that it\'s obviousy more cost effective this way for both of us :)\r\n\r\nCheers,\r\n\r\nMatt.[/quote:b6f31cbd42]right on bro, thanks for keeping me posted.\r\nyea good idea, next time I ship to ya, I\'ll send only the bare essentials....\r\nwonder if him being on the coast lessens price?\r\n\r\nhow do the lights affix? just by sticky?\r\nif they\'re easy - just leave them off, I\'d like to paint the body without them on and then affix them.\r\n\r\nso I take it payaso hasn\'t paid the 4.50 yet?\r\nI thought the deal was I send you the 350 z bodies and 4.50 and you do the mosfets and lights?\r\n\r\nanyways, let me know how ya wanna work it and all the details so I can get my shit straight[/quote:b6f31cbd42]\r\n\r\nMaybe east cost is cheaper, dunno.  Downunder we get raped be it east or west coast.\r\n\r\nThe lights can be affixed using super glue, expoy, whatever.   I paint the internal area black to reduce the glow from the lights seeping through.  Once the lights are glued on I also paint them black.  this means then that the lights only shine out the front, where they\'re meant to.\r\n\r\nNah, payaso hasn\'t sent the money.  But I didn\'t realise the size of the box you were gonna send me :).   Given AUs/US exchange rates the cost will prolly stay the same @ $4.50.    I just dunno though, never sent a box overseas, lol.\r\n\r\nThanks again man.\r\n\r\nMatt.[/quote:b6f31cbd42]right on, I don\'t think the box should make a price difference.\r\nusually it goes by weight and box dimensions, and the box is below the typical increased package price. who knows lol\r\n\r\nif you can safely cram it into a smaller box and give it some padding so it doesn\'t get destroyed, go for it. just saying I could care less about my box lol (that sounded funny didn\'t it?)\r\n\r\nanyways, let me know whatever - whenever homey');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (11342, 'fdde083616', '[quote:fdde083616="CaboWabo"][quote:fdde083616="ph2t"][quote:fdde083616="CaboWabo"][quote:fdde083616="ph2t"]hey man,\r\n\r\njust finishing up on the mods and I will mail it off on Monday 6/10.   \r\nJust a question though.   Being a resourcfull bugger you have shipped the whole shebang! lol.    With the headlights, do you want me to afix them to the gloria shell or just leave them be and you can choose what shell you want to afix them to?\r\n\r\nAlso, don\'t pay me any mad cash yet.   When I go to the post office I will find out the cost of shipping the box back to you.   Once I know that I\'ll let you know.\r\n\r\nAlso man, sessiz has sent me a chassis to fet mod as well and all he did was post the bare chassis not including anything (like motor, axle,heatsink, etc).  He posted this in a padded envelope and I got it without any damage and stuff.   From the looks of the USPS sticker on the bag it only cost him like $2.   Of course we confirmed that I had a controller on the right freq to be able to test first so that negated the need for that.   This is just a headsup to say if you wanted any futher mods in the future that it\'s obviousy more cost effective this way for both of us :)\r\n\r\nCheers,\r\n\r\nMatt.[/quote:fdde083616]right on bro, thanks for keeping me posted.\r\nyea good idea, next time I ship to ya, I\'ll send only the bare essentials....\r\nwonder if him being on the coast lessens price?\r\n\r\nhow do the lights affix? just by sticky?\r\nif they\'re easy - just leave them off, I\'d like to paint the body without them on and then affix them.\r\n\r\nso I take it payaso hasn\'t paid the 4.50 yet?\r\nI thought the deal was I send you the 350 z bodies and 4.50 and you do the mosfets and lights?\r\n\r\nanyways, let me know how ya wanna work it and all the details so I can get my shit straight[/quote:fdde083616]\r\n\r\nMaybe east cost is cheaper, dunno.  Downunder we get raped be it east or west coast.\r\n\r\nThe lights can be affixed using super glue, expoy, whatever.   I paint the internal area black to reduce the glow from the lights seeping through.  Once the lights are glued on I also paint them black.  this means then that the lights only shine out the front, where they\'re meant to.\r\n\r\nNah, payaso hasn\'t sent the money.  But I didn\'t realise the size of the box you were gonna send me :).   Given AUs/US exchange rates the cost will prolly stay the same @ $4.50.    I just dunno though, never sent a box overseas, lol.\r\n\r\nThanks again man.\r\n\r\nMatt.[/quote:fdde083616]right on, I don\'t think the box should make a price difference.\r\nusually it goes by weight and box dimensions, and the box is below the typical increased package price. who knows lol\r\n\r\nif you can safely cram it into a smaller box and give it some padding so it doesn\'t get destroyed, go for it. just saying I could care less about my box lol (that sounded funny didn\'t it?)\r\n\r\nanyways, let me know whatever - whenever homey[/quote:fdde083616]\r\n\r\nWill do.  and again, thanks for the shells, the 350 is mad!');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (11819, '2295104f94', 'Yea thanks again Bro I was accually just gettin ready to take a nap when the door bells rang(fuckin package guy rings it after he puts something in the door).  Now I will have to wait for wife to get home to nap lol.\r\n\r\n  The TC controller is weird but it gets good range.\r\n\r\n  As for dave I think all of my cars will make it to him some day or another lol.  I just sent him 1 ultraman car for fets, 1 LXX light up beetle for fets, ZZ se for fets, ZZ and lxx clone for PBC swap/internal duel cell/lxx to zz controller switch/fets.  So that might keep him busy for  bit.\r\n\r\n  I hope to god he will be able to fet my mini sup as I want as much power as possible when I take it to the pet shop to torment the fish. :)\r\n\r\n  Is there anything you are looking for?  I should have some 4.2 motors soon, I have have a few ultraman cars right now and I am waiting on shippments from toy east and other.\r\n\r\n  As for homies I am waiting on these(not sure if you have seen them)\r\n\r\n[img:2295104f94]http://i1.ebayimg.com/03/i/00/8f/54/2b_1.JPG[/img:2295104f94]\r\n[img:2295104f94]http://images.andale.com/f2/122/120/10576903/1048439184447_1048439184425_SET.jpg[/img:2295104f94]\r\n\r\n\r\n  I am also diggin the truck body I think its gonna go in the shop tonight :)');
