INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (11382, '1d959bcdf1', '[quote:1d959bcdf1="VooDooMafia"]I understand the se are far from being a fetted bit but like you say its an improvment.\r\n\r\n  OK just let me know what to send extra and I will also pass the msg to sessiz :)\r\n\r\nAgain you the hook up king and fo real if you plan on advertizing you doing the fets I know you will have a ton to do :)\r\n\r\n  BTW I am not sure what you have planed for thre contest but I think your 911 gt would look nice in there :)[/quote:1d959bcdf1]Oh I never know what to ask. I guess we could stick to 8 dollars a car, or whatever you think is fair.\r\n\r\nI do plan on posting here and there that I\'ll do the mosfet mod, but first I want to establish a good reputation, that\'s why I\'m doing it cheap for some cool people first.\r\n\r\n\r\n...and the contest, man, I like Yagbols, and he does some excellent work, but I gotta say I\'m a little POed he came up with a Beetle so similar to mine, and posted it the day the contest started.\r\n\r\nSo I\'m pulling out all the stops on this one. Now that I\'m irritated, this has become a comp for reals, you know what I\'m sayin\'?\r\n\r\nI\'ll go ahead and tell you what I\'m planning, because I trust you to keep it hush hush. \r\n\r\nPlan one, a monster Beetle, here\'s the twist, I\'m gonna do a suspension lift, instead of the usual body lift. In that process I\'ll be adding a second axle, and another gear, giving me a really low gear ratio. Dual cells, and stacked FETs should make for an entertaining video.\r\n\r\nPlan two, that I probably won\'t have time to pull off, scratch built pan car chassis, with separate, and suspended motor pod, and HO scale lexan body... no interior kit, just performance.\r\n\r\n..but you didn\'t just read none of that, I never typed it, it never happened. ;) ;)\r\n\r\ndave');
