INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (11547, '2740bb3de8', 'Aight here\'s the deal bro.\r\nI\'m definatly hittin up this show in NYC where they\'ll be racing xmods. Seeing as it\'s RS sponsered I know zips are gonna make a show. If not I\'m gonna be pimpin one fo sho.\r\nI\'m paintin the body so, it\'s cool, I just know you coulda done some fly ass shit is why I asked.\r\nThe decals ya sent work bro and bitpimps WILL be on the ride. The thing is that I can only use the dark or red text, nothing else shows up well unless on white (you know this) And I don\'t like white on a car, lol.\r\nI got the alloys, should turn some heads.\r\nI got aight skills wit the paint, enough to catch some eyes.\r\nI got a duallie cell, shit maybe I\'ll throw in the laymans quad for some drags, LOL.\r\nI got them springs up front.\r\nI gots the 4.2.\r\nI got skills wit the clicker.\r\nI\'m definatly tearing shit up if zips are gonna get some play.\r\nAnd finally I wanna rep like a mutha fucker for all da pimps.\r\nAw shit man I\'m just all hyped and shit bro.\r\nHotties, DJs and R/C cars all this fo free. Not to mention them bars, I\'m forseeing a great freakin night. :lol:');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (11780, '88f4b99abb', 'Hey man, your car has gone out today.  Expect approx 7-10 working days for delivery.   Shipping costed 7.50 AUS so if you could get Steve to paysluts me the $4.50USD to ph2t@prahranpianos.com I\'d appreciate it.\r\n\r\nI\'ve got some video of the biatch which I\'ll post for you tonight.\r\n\r\nCheers mate,\r\n\r\nMatt.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (12516, '12468c7a71', 'Its all good dude\r\n\r\nHope you like the xmod you basterd LOL and as for speed I know sessiz beat some mini z\'s.\r\n\r\n  I guess till mine comes in the mail I will have to deal with the epoch that I oh so love.\r\n\r\n  Hey you do fets right?  You have any idea on the SE fetting problem?');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (12295, '10f6cc9efb', '[quote:10f6cc9efb="VooDooMafia"][quote:10f6cc9efb="crazydave"][quote:10f6cc9efb="VooDooMafia"]here are some quotes from Ausmicro\r\n\r\n[quote:10f6cc9efb]Yo what did you have to do to get it fully fetted? you got a tut or pics of what needed to be done?[/quote:10f6cc9efb]\r\n\r\n\r\nMicro amps\r\n\r\n\r\n[quote:10f6cc9efb]What I am going to do is offer my services to do this mod for people, same as when I was doing FET mods to BCGs and standard ZZs and clones. (and yes I am still doing these mods as well if you want one done, email me or check my website)\r\nI am still charging US$20 for a FET mod, you send the car to me, I mod it, test it, and send it straight back. It really does kick arse once it is modded. Just like a fet modded BCG, only a little heavier. Get into it.\r\nuA\r\nTitaniuMonkey, these cars sell for US$25 in the States (plus postage) and the mods I have been doing have always been US$20. [/quote:10f6cc9efb][/quote:10f6cc9efb]That bastard, I feel like he\'s taunting me, makes me even more determined to figure it out.\r\n :lol: \r\ndave[/quote:10f6cc9efb]\r\n\r\n  Yea fuck that thats just uncool, well hes not gonna like me if these couple deals I have go through.  I will undercut all his prices on the BCG sets.  \r\n\r\n  Fuck and to think I was gonna buy his AE86 tuneup kit off him for $50.00(unfetted) HA, now I will sell them to those OZ peeps for $25 or 30.\r\n\r\n\r\n  [b:10f6cc9efb]Man that pisses me off really.  it goes from being into the hobby to just wanting $$.[/b:10f6cc9efb][/quote:10f6cc9efb]That\'s what I\'m saying. \r\n\r\nEver since I found out what he charged for a mosfet mod, I\'ve been on a mission to make sure that pimps around here didn\'t have to pay that much, by educating them and offering to do it myself.\r\n\r\nI\'ve got this down to 30 minutes, longer if I have to trouble shoot, but 20 bucks for a half an hour to hours work, doing something your supposed to love, that\'s silly.\r\n\r\n...and then what really gets me, is on a message board we exchange information, me and ph2t are offering up legitimate ideas, and for all we know he worked off our ideas. Then he never gives much information back in return. \r\n\r\nTHEN what really gets me, it\'s not even like he created the mosfet mod in the first place. IT came from the Germans who freely post their info. That\'s where I learned how to do it, and they don\'t even speak english very well. \r\n\r\nSo it\'s almost as if he\'s stealing intellectual material for his own profitable gain.\r\n\r\n&lt;rant mode off&gt;\r\n\r\nK, better now, glad I got that off my chest. I\'m just happy others are starting to see into his evil conspiracy.\r\n :lol: \r\nDave');
