INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (11591, '5702be78c2', '[quote:5702be78c2="VooDooMafia"]OK cool\r\n\r\n  Now last thing I forgot to ask is, I know a zip can only be charged on a zip controller.\r\n\r\n  now that the pbc will be switched can it be charged on something other then a zip charger?  Or will I need to mod the zip controller to charge a duel cell?[/quote:5702be78c2]The charger hooks straight to the battery in the car, so the PCB has no effect.\r\n\r\nBesides the first generation of Zip Zap actually fit on my charger bases. The most recent ones, I just have to carve little notches in the side to get the charger base to hold on to it.\r\n\r\nI use the same charger bases for all my cars, that\'s why I hate the SE charger base, now I have mod my controller, cause I hate those short timed charges. :roll:\r\ndave');
