INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (11975, '988c08afa7', '[quote:988c08afa7="VooDooMafia"]Yea I hear ya :)  since I just started modding and most my stuff is just paint jobs and basic ones at that I can pound them off one a day(if I have enough bodies).\r\n\r\n  I take it when you say you have set of alloys to do for havok you mean he has sent you some to mount.  cause if you are now selling alloys let me know as I am always looking for alloys aswell.\r\n\r\n  I got some from ez but been having a bitch of a time mounting the fuckers LOL.\r\n\r\n  BTW.  If you ever need anything added to your TV/Phone?internet just let me know i will hook you up :)[/quote:988c08afa7]Yeah the dealwith havok and the alloys was I mount his up, and I get a set for myself. Seemed like a good deal, but I forgot what a bitch the alloys are to mount up, that\'s what I\'m putting off now. I could have all his cars FETed in an afternoon, but the wheels, are gonna be a headache, and 4 times. :roll:  :lol: \r\n\r\nFunny you mention the TV/phone/internet. We\'re in the process of cutting back on Cox services. We switched from digital cable to classic cable. I don\'t even miss the digital, all the good channels are on classic anyways. We went to down to the most basic phone service, and we\'re getting ready to ditch the high speed internet all together, and just get a cheap DSL connection. I\'ve just been stalling, \'cause I gotta move all my pictures over to my wife\'s server, and edit all my old post. That\'s gonna suck. I\'m supposed to be doing that right now.  :lol: \r\n\r\nDave');
