INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (13153, 'a96e8d0e7d', '[quote:a96e8d0e7d="crazydave"][quote:a96e8d0e7d="ph2t"]If you could I\'d appreciate, just add more data to the s/sheet and upload it to the ftp, :)\r\n\r\nI\'ve gotten a model to work with now.   Basically apart from the 4 fets, I\r\nve added another component that is an inverter/buffer.   It\'s goal is to invert the high signal (2.37V) to a low voltage (0.2V) and vice versa.  This way we might get it to work.  The inverter is of similar size to the fets, another surface mount component,   They are available as free samples from onsemi.com but if I can get it working in a test circuit today I will mail you some I\'ve got,  You only need one per hbridge.\r\n\r\nI\'ll work on this and let you know.  Thanks again for your help dude.\r\n\r\nMatt.[/quote:a96e8d0e7d]Cool, I\'ll get those this evening when my wife gets home from work.\r\n\r\nI hope that inverter/buffer works, because a small component is what we need. Space is really tight in the SE.\r\n\r\n..and hey, thanks for your help man, I\'d be useless without you. ;)\r\n\r\nDave[/quote:a96e8d0e7d]\r\n\r\nUnfortunately the buffer/inverter theory didn\'t work, arghhhh!  Gawd this gives me the shits!   Oh well..  I now have another idea using P-channel fets this time.   We\'ll see how we go.\r\n\r\nph2t.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (12352, '9f9c4afaa2', 'sorry bout such the delay man, glad it got there. take yer time gettin it back...... lemme know when u can do the zz SE fet mod like micro amps and maybe we can deal some more.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (12353, '3febebb6c8', '[quote:3febebb6c8="ezenterprises"]sorry bout such the delay man, glad it got there. take yer time gettin it back...... lemme know when u can do the zz SE fet mod like micro amps and maybe we can deal some more.[/quote:3febebb6c8]\r\n\r\nWill do, let you know that is, lol.   At the \'mo micro is keeping this close to his chest and won\'t share :(.  But hog, crazy and myself are workin\' on it!');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (11967, 'ac2660f999', '[quote:ac2660f999="VooDooMafia"]Thanks for the info and I will take both your words on the super bit.\r\n\r\n  I know that the LXX cars greatly improve with the fets added and considering I have alot of lxx cars(can\'t get anything else around here).\r\n\r\n  As for changing the cars to run off the one controller thats a good idea but most my cars are diff Mhz.  Although a bunch are the same so guess I will look for a tut on this.\r\n\r\n  Ment to ask in last msg how your projects were coming along?  I am egar to see how they turn out, but like all your stuff I am sure even if you aren\'t happy it will look good :)\r\n\r\nPete[/quote:ac2660f999]As for changing my car to run off the same controllers, I wish I had more frequncies, seems most my cars are 27 or 49. I bought a LXX just to give me a 3rd Zip Zap frequency.\r\n\r\nHaven\'t got far on my projects. I\'ve got 4 sets of alloys, and 7 mosfet mods to do for Havok, and I\'ve been putting that off, meanwhile actually playing with, and enjoying my cars instead of modding for once.\r\n\r\nMy main prob is finding good monster truck tires, I know I should go ahead and set it up with out the tires to test my ideas, but I had the perfect set, and my kid lost them. Now I can\'t find those pullbacks anywhere, \'cause I had bought the last one on clearance.\r\n\r\nAnyways, I got time. I don\'t knock out projects out left and right like some people, I sit and think about the big ones.\r\n\r\nDave');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (12024, '29a46714ed', '[quote:29a46714ed="ezenterprises"]is it still ok for me to use the same couple pics in my ebay auctions when i auction a set of rims? I use same exact listing as you saw i ust change the rim name and pic of the exact style. I beleive it was 2 or 3 pics of your bits wit rims and a link to bitpimps site in the description with a thanks to you for allowing me to use the pics. Thought i would re-ask as some shit has been stirred up.[/quote:29a46714ed]yea man, you\'re cool. I\'m more lookin for the fools...\r\n\r\nthanks for double-checking man');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (12025, '3e5eb82c2a', 'Sorry man, I didn\'t mean to get the two countries mixed up.  I\'m looking for the Fairlady 350Z booster set on 57Mhz.  I know they are hard to comebuy but I\'m willing to trade the same stuff as my ZZ SE thread in "looking to score"  If you sent me the booster and a chassis of your own I\'m willing to put headlights, mosfet and all other performance mods on it and send you the chassis back.\r\n\r\nWhat do you think?\r\n\r\nCheers,\r\n\r\nph2t.[/quote]\r\n\r\ncool, now looking for a 350z is the hard part :eek:  I have one here its opened/used but still in stock form.  But ill look around for a new one. And if i want to get one of our kitt lights what do i add to the package?');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (12026, 'ea10b85311', '[quote:ea10b85311="Yagbols"][quote:ea10b85311]Sorry man, I didn\'t mean to get the two countries mixed up.  I\'m looking for the Fairlady 350Z booster set on 57Mhz.  I know they are hard to comebuy but I\'m willing to trade the same stuff as my ZZ SE thread in "looking to score"  If you sent me the booster and a chassis of your own I\'m willing to put headlights, mosfet and all other performance mods on it and send you the chassis back.\r\n\r\nWhat do you think?\r\n\r\nCheers,\r\n\r\nph2t.[/quote:ea10b85311]\r\n\r\ncool, now looking for a 350z is the hard part :eek:  I have one here its opened/used but still in stock form.  But ill look around for a new one. And if i want to get one of our kitt lights what do i add to the package?[/quote:ea10b85311]\r\n\r\nWhat\'s the condition man?  Is it good condition?  If it is I\'m happy to take it :)   As for the Knight Rider lights I\'m happy to make them for you.   What I can do is that you send me one of your chassis and I\'ll add the circuit board to it.   The LED board that has the actual lights will be free-standing and you can mod a shell to suit no sweats.   What else do you have to trade?\r\n\r\nph2t.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (12031, '109e40cdb7', '[quote:109e40cdb7="Yagbols"][quote:109e40cdb7="ph2t"][quote:109e40cdb7="Yagbols"][quote:109e40cdb7]Sorry man, I didn\'t mean to get the two countries mixed up.  I\'m looking for the Fairlady 350Z booster set on 57Mhz.  I know they are hard to comebuy but I\'m willing to trade the same stuff as my ZZ SE thread in "looking to score"  If you sent me the booster and a chassis of your own I\'m willing to put headlights, mosfet and all other performance mods on it and send you the chassis back.\r\n\r\nWhat do you think?\r\n\r\nCheers,\r\n\r\nph2t.[/quote:109e40cdb7]\r\n\r\ncool, now looking for a 350z is the hard part :eek:  I have one here its opened/used but still in stock form.  But ill look around for a new one. And if i want to get one of our kitt lights what do i add to the package?[/quote:109e40cdb7]\r\n\r\nWhat\'s the condition man?  Is it good condition?  If it is I\'m happy to take it :)   As for the Knight Rider lights I\'m happy to make them for you.   What I can do is that you send me one of your chassis and I\'ll add the circuit board to it.   The LED board that has the actual lights will be free-standing and you can mod a shell to suit no sweats.   What else do you have to trade?\r\n\r\nph2t.[/quote:109e40cdb7]\r\n\r\nI\'ll go over my stuff later tonite and see what i can trade.  The condition is good.  So do i just send you 1 chassis to modify with all the lights and stuff or do I send 2?[/quote:109e40cdb7]\r\n\r\nJust send the one chassis to do the Kitt lights.   \r\n\r\n[b:109e40cdb7]OR[/b:109e40cdb7]\r\n\r\nAlso I can do a different deal for you.  How does this sound instead.   You send me 2 chassis and I will mosfet mod them both for you for the used 350z booster.   I will also throw in the headlights mod.   So that is 2 mosfeted chassis and a headlights mod for the used 350z booster set.\r\n\r\nPersonally man I\'d rather do that because it is very tricky to do the Knight Rider light PCB.  I\'ve made many crap pcb\'s with a very low success rate.   Also the turnaround time for the mosfet mod is quicker.\r\n\r\nCheers man,\r\n\r\nph2t.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (12525, '98fa469f3b', 'hey man, I checked postage, it will cost $7.50 AUS, for airmail.  That\'s $5USD.  So to total the order for the following:\r\n\r\n2 gloria\'s and one rx7 and 1 wheel set\r\n\r\nThat\'s then $13 + $5 = $18 total USD.\r\n\r\nSo just paypal me at ph2t@prahranpianos.com and I\'ll post it off on Monday.\r\n\r\nCheers,\r\n\r\nMatt.');
