INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (12121, 'a755161a2b', 'Have you built any tracks for your cars??  I\'m trying to setup something, but I have about 10 things going on at once. :lol:  I\'m gonna hit Pearl tonight and pick up some supplies.  I have limited space, but I still think I can make a fun track that doesn\'t have too many twisties.  Are you picking up any Xmods?  They sound like fun so I might pick up one or two to tinker with.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (12122, '011fde03cf', 'The limited space issue is whats keeping me from building a track also. I\'ve got some great ideas for them, but most are "Off road" ideas.\r\n\r\nI love jumping, and climbing em on technical type stuff.  Right now I race at the tennis courts if I want to run all out, but in the apartment I set up dvd cases, and cd cases till I have a track reaching the coffee table. Then I climb it, and try to go back down.. \r\n\r\n\r\nI\'ll probably get a X-mod or 2, but not sure when. Not really in a big hurry since I\'m more into the "micro rc cars"  I\'d have to go out to run it.\r\n\r\nWhat else are you into?  Do you still party? (like go to the bars, and stuff like that)  My wife, and I are pretty laid back.   Not big on the bars cause we ain\'t drank in years...lol\r\n\r\n\r\n-S');
