INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (12127, '3d299881d2', '[quote:3d299881d2="payaso"]The limited space issue is whats keeping me from building a track also. I\'ve got some great ideas for them, but most are "Off road" ideas.[/quote:3d299881d2]\r\n\r\nSounds like everyone has the space issue problem.  What I wouldn\'t do for an empty garage. :lol:  Originally, I was trying to setup a rally/off road course, but I figured I better start out with a simpler design first.   \r\n\r\n[quote:3d299881d2="payaso"]\r\nI\'ll probably get a X-mod or 2, but not sure when. Not really in a big hurry since I\'m more into the "micro rc cars"  I\'d have to go out to run it.\r\n\r\nWhat else are you into?  Do you still party? (like go to the bars, and stuff like that)  My wife, and I are pretty laid back.   Not big on the bars cause we ain\'t drank in years...lol\r\n\r\n-S[/quote:3d299881d2]\r\n\r\nI\'m having second thoughts about getting an Xmod because I know I will spend a wad on upgrades, but I\'ll probably end up with one.  My girlfriend just moved here a month ago, so I\'ve been busy getting her settled.  I used to do the bar thing, but it seems like too much of a hassle now.  She has a 10 year old son, so we\'re usually doing the family thing on weekends.  I\'m a moderator on the srtforums, so I spend some time on there.  I got an srt 4 almost a year ago, so I take it to the track now and then.  When I first moved into my place, I used to go to the Gandy and fish once in a while, but nothing lately.  I kind of suck at fishing, but I\'d usually go with one of my friends and just hang out.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (12128, '5f78734470', 'Got em today, and they are simply outstanding man... I don\'t know how you do it, but you do...\r\n\r\nIt\'s been a while since I\'ve really been impressed with a bit related part, and this is doin it for me. Thanks a million. That sticker paper works awesome. I think you could easily sell these on ebay or something for $3 bucks a pop... \r\n\r\nEither way, you got a cool skill.\r\n\r\nCan\'t wait to try em out.\r\n\r\n\r\n-Steve');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (12129, '5e4e0c8f0d', '[quote:5e4e0c8f0d="payaso"]Got em today, and they are simply outstanding man... I don\'t know how you do it, but you do...\r\n\r\nIt\'s been a while since I\'ve really been impressed with a bit related part, and this is doin it for me. Thanks a million. That sticker paper works awesome. I think you could easily sell these on ebay or something for $3 bucks a pop... \r\n\r\nEither way, you got a cool skill.\r\n\r\nCan\'t wait to try em out.\r\n\r\n\r\n-Steve[/quote:5e4e0c8f0d]Well, I\'m glad you like it, and I am sorry it took so long to get there, that really was an unusual circumstance.\r\n\r\nAs for how I do it, more than 10 years ago, when my nerves gave out, and my hands started shaking, I turned to \'cut and paste\' as an alternative art style. Since then I\'ve become more comfortable with an exacto blade than a pen.\r\n\r\nI\'ve considered selling them on ebay, but if I get to the point where I charge money, then I want everything to be perfect, and I want to get sheets of paint mask, so it\'ll be thinner, and more flexible, and wont get stretched being transferred from paper to paper.\r\n\r\nI still need to make you a placement diagram. Can\'t do it today, my wife took the camera. I can get to it tommorrow afternoon. If you need it sooner, I just need a picture of the hood, and side panel to show you placement.\r\n\r\nAnyways, glad it finally showed, and even more so, I\'m happy you\'re impressed with them. If you ever need anything else, feel free to ask, and I\'ll make sure it gets to you much quicker. ;)\r\n\r\nDave');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (12530, '4c10346e04', 'yea its propo and spring suspention.  I got this one from ebay for 50 shipped from hong kong.\r\n\r\n  I hope to get some vids of it in action tonight.\r\n\r\n  As for the propo I am not sure how to tell how many steps it has but seems like alot.\r\n\r\nthey have parts and stuff [url]http://www.apexrc-racing.com/[/url] here so you can get idea of what the chassie look like plus kwikbb has some pics of his here \r\n[url]http://homepage.mac.com/blormore/PhotoAlbum8.html[/url]');
