INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (12141, '5e4e0c8f0d', '[quote:5e4e0c8f0d="payaso"]Got em today, and they are simply outstanding man... I don\'t know how you do it, but you do...\r\n\r\nIt\'s been a while since I\'ve really been impressed with a bit related part, and this is doin it for me. Thanks a million. That sticker paper works awesome. I think you could easily sell these on ebay or something for $3 bucks a pop... \r\n\r\nEither way, you got a cool skill.\r\n\r\nCan\'t wait to try em out.\r\n\r\n\r\n-Steve[/quote:5e4e0c8f0d]Well, I\'m glad you like it, and I am sorry it took so long to get there, that really was an unusual circumstance.\r\n\r\nAs for how I do it, more than 10 years ago, when my nerves gave out, and my hands started shaking, I turned to \'cut and paste\' as an alternative art style. Since then I\'ve become more comfortable with an exacto blade than a pen.\r\n\r\nI\'ve considered selling them on ebay, but if I get to the point where I charge money, then I want everything to be perfect, and I want to get sheets of paint mask, so it\'ll be thinner, and more flexible, and wont get stretched being transferred from paper to paper.\r\n\r\nI still need to make you a placement diagram. Can\'t do it today, my wife took the camera. I can get to it tommorrow afternoon. If you need it sooner, I just need a picture of the hood, and side panel to show you placement.\r\n\r\nAnyways, glad it finally showed, and even more so, I\'m happy you\'re impressed with them. If you ever need anything else, feel free to ask, and I\'ll make sure it gets to you much quicker. ;)\r\n\r\nDave');
