INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (12170, 'd2f732c466', 'here\'s a better tutorial i found for ya:\r\n\r\n hmm yah about the pen thing..\r\ni added an exhaust today on my Evo\r\n\r\nwhat i did was..make a hole in where the plastic mock exhaust is...and take/find a pen [probably a gel pen] that has a metal tip.\r\ntake off everything, even the ink part...the cap, then the plastic part that connects it to the ink with plyers or something similar...\r\nand voila...easy muffler...all u need to do is clean it, and make sure there is no ink left in it...and make sure your hole u made is big enough, but not to big so where it falls out \r\n\r\nwish i had a camera... \r\n\r\n\r\nit\'s by MTL.... payaso took some pics when he did this mod:\r\n[url]http://www.tinyrc.com/forums/attachment.php?s=&amp;postid=7974[/url]\r\n[url]http://www.tinyrc.com/forums/attachment.php?s=&amp;postid=7975[/url]\r\n[url]http://www.tinyrc.com/forums/attachment.php?s=&amp;postid=7992[/url]\r\n\r\n\r\nyou have to be a member of tinyrc.com to view those images though..... i hope you are!');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (12171, '7258ada81c', 'CW, just wanted to give you the heads up that this guy is using stuff from over here and probably not giving y\'all much credit for it.  Also wanted to share a recent email that I sent him.  He\'s been a pest over at MRCC and made it sound like he was dissing you guys with no regard.\r\n\r\n[quote:7258ada81c]Thank you Scott, yeah the whole thing took us by surprise, since we \r\ngive \r\nmad links to the sources everywhere, and don\'t copy the whole tutorials \r\njust link directly to them. Now ZipZaps.com, we copied the tutorials \r\nbecause A) official company and B) they had these microcosmic windows \r\nthat \r\nwere hard to use.\r\n\r\nThe images, we just copied and put them right next to the same title as \r\nthe \r\npage they linked to and even said "(at the BitPimps website)" and \r\nlinked \r\ndirectly to the index of the site, not just the article, in the word \r\nBitPimps. This is no more than Google News does every day. And why go \r\nthrough the trouble of copying those images? Usability. People like to \r\nknow \r\nwhat they are clicking on before they click on a link, and a picture \r\nspeaks \r\na thousand words. We never thought we\'d make people mad but as Marty \r\npointed out... you make some people mad by breathing.\r\n\r\nAt this point, any energy we spend talking to these people will just \r\nmake \r\nthem more mad because they\'ve already made up their minds, so our only \r\nreal \r\noption is to just ignore it. [b:7258ada81c]BitPimps, for all their fluster, has not \r\nbothered to actually send us an e-mail so we assume that that\'s all \r\nthey \r\nhave at the moment... fluster.[/b:7258ada81c]\r\n\r\nI\'m David, but me and three other guys put this together. See our About \r\npage.\r\n\r\nAs for blogging, hah hah... the buck stops there. There is no way you \r\ncan \r\navoid having people link to whatever the heck they want. It is common \r\nlaw \r\namong webmasters not to directly link to files or images, but webpages? \r\nGive me a break.\r\n\r\nThanks for your time, Scott.  I\'ll be leet-speaking when next you see \r\nme, \r\nprobably ;)\r\n\r\nAt 10:43 AM 10/17/2003, you wrote:\r\n\r\n&gt;DavidBeoulve,\r\n&gt;\r\n&gt;MadScott has sent you this email from \r\n&gt;http://www.microrccenter.com/forum/index.php.\r\n&gt;\r\n&gt;\r\n&gt;Please take a moment to read through our forum guidelines found here, \r\n&gt;http://www.microrccenter.com/forum/index.php?act=boardrules.  Just to \r\ngive \r\n&gt;you a heads up, you are starting to get a few folks at MRCC mad by \r\nusing \r\n&gt;images without their permission.  You may want to email or PM folks \r\nbefore \r\n&gt;you decide to blog or use their images.  Just trying to help you out \r\nhere.\r\n&gt;\r\n&gt;Thanks,\r\n&gt;Madscott\r\n[/quote:7258ada81c]\r\nLike I said, more than anything I just wanted to give you guys the heads up because he\'s starting to piss off guys like ph2t.  Thanks for the time man.\r\n\r\nMadScott');
