INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (12343, '5476293008', '[quote:5476293008="hogjowlz"]ya i can understand him wanting to make $$ but he could still do it and release his findings. or you could buy one from him and take some pics\r\n :-D[/quote:5476293008]\r\n\r\nYeah true, but his argument for fet mods has always been "I\'m doing this as a service to people you can\'t electronically mod"  this argument sorta doesn\'t stand anymore, oh well... As to getting one from him you know he "pots" his work now.  Puts black epoxy over the mod, :(');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (12344, '5476293008', '[quote:5476293008="hogjowlz"]ya i can understand him wanting to make $$ but he could still do it and release his findings. or you could buy one from him and take some pics\r\n :-D[/quote:5476293008]\r\n\r\nYeah true, but his argument for fet mods has always been "I\'m doing this as a service to people you can\'t electronically mod"  this argument sorta doesn\'t stand anymore, oh well... As to getting one from him you know he "pots" his work now.  Puts black epoxy over the mod, :(');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (12217, '9082628d16', '[quote:9082628d16="VooDooMafia"]Hey dave I asume you recieved the package nad I am sending this PM to say again that I am sorry for the change :(  Next time I will make sure its paypal or bills :)[/quote:9082628d16]Got sidetracked yesterday, didn\'t get a chance to check the mail.\r\n\r\nI checked it this morning, and it was there. Perfect timing too, because I have tommorrow off, I should get it mostly finished. \r\n\r\nI gotta tell you, part of the reason I feel guilty charging too much, is because I love playing with everybody\'s cars. Like I said to Havok, I don\'t need to own every micro, but I sure do want to check each one out. \r\n\r\nSo that MAT car is a bonus for me, because that\'s almost was my first bit, but I opted for the Skyline set at the last minute. That one would have already been extra fun for me to mod, but then you sent it to me still sealed in the box. I\'m all excited, I can\'t wait to crack that one open, and get it all FETed up. That LXX Beetle is going to be fun to too, \'cause I\'m considering ordering a couple of those.\r\n\r\nThere is one problem with the SE. micro_amps has just annouced that he\'s figured out the problem with the SE, but of course he\'s not sharing the solution.\r\n\r\nI play nice with the guy to get any info I can out of him, but really he pisses me off. He\'s an ass out for some money. He\'ll pretend to share infomation, but all he\'s ever saying is, it can\'t be done for these reasons, and then he\'ll pop up and say he\'s solved it, but will not tell us how. I\'ve seen it before, seems like a clever marketing ploy to me.\r\n\r\nSo anyways, I\'m thinking I should sit on the SE for a few days, to see if I can eek some kind of clue out of him, or figure it out myself.\r\n\r\nGod dammit that mofo pisses me off. How the hell can he just pop up and say he did it, and not tell us how?!?! :mad: \r\n\r\nDave');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (13204, 'a6007083f4', '[quote:a6007083f4="payaso"]That sounds cool to me.  I took the SE to the tennis courts last night to see what it had in a big area.. I love it so much, that I\'m sending him 2 or 3 more..lol\r\n\r\nGive me a ring when you get some free time.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n-S[/quote:a6007083f4]\r\n\r\nWow, that sounds like quite an improvement if you\'re sending him a few more to modify.  I think that stuff I ordered from Hong Kong will probably take another week or two to arrive.  If my girlfriend doesn\'t have to work tonight, I won\'t be watching her son, so I might have some free time.  I\'ll give you a ring when I get home from work.');
