INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (12229, '5a069ca5d8', '[quote:5a069ca5d8="VooDooMafia"]Its all good man I am in no hurry.  Well keep your eyes on ph2t aswell he seems to get alot of info from micro amps and he seeems to sare it ok.\r\n\r\n  Have you ever fetted anything bigger then a zz/bit?  I was thinking about the epoch indoor racer or the xmods(as I know the mini z\'s can be done).\r\n\r\n  Yea I like the LXX beetle with the lights and for the price there are good.  I did find that they have a nice long run time.\r\n\r\n  As for the ultraman car if you want one let m eknow I have a few left and I can ship one your way :) Least I can do for all the kick ass shit you are doing :)[/quote:5a069ca5d8]Yeah, good idea, I\'ll work on ph2t as well. I\'m sure when he gets a hold of a SE he\'ll share what he knows, \'cause he\'s a pimp like that.\r\n\r\nNo, I\'ve never FETed anything larger than a bit. I\'m sure i might be able to figure it out, but it\'s gonna take some work.\r\n\r\n...and nah, I don\'t really need an Ultraman car. I was just saying that\'ll be fun to work on because I almost bought one. I only almost bought one because they were going cheaper than the other Bit Char-Gs.\r\n\r\nI\'ll keep you updated on my progress.\r\n\r\ndave');
