INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (12244, '68b2206c07', '[quote:68b2206c07="VooDooMafia"]Been tring to but hes not on MSN ever.  gonna try and get asmuch info as I can for you and all the others :)\r\n\r\n  Personally I think its bull, I hope he was just tired and will come back and spill the beans(micro amp that is).[/quote:68b2206c07]Ph2t PMed me, it was really ironic because we were just talking about how he\'d cool about it. that\'s why I asked if you had talked to him.\r\n\r\nAnyways, he emailed micro-amps, and he basically straight up said he didn\'t mean to be a prick, but he put a few hours into it, and intended to get something back out of it.\r\n\r\nI\'ve got the reply if you want to read it.\r\n\r\nSo ph2t asked me if I\'d help him work it out. I\'m like, of coarse. Silly guy I was going to ask him help me work it out. :lol: but at any rate , he wants the knowledge to be made public, as do I.\r\n\r\nSo we\'ll see what we can come with. Haven\'t heard back yet, it\'s probably late there.\r\n\r\nHey how much do you want for a MAT car? I got it out of the box, and I\'m digging it. I\'m imagining it lowered, painted red, with some bit rims that have the centers painted gold. :???: \r\n\r\nDave');
