INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (12738, '3929cf10f9', '[quote:3929cf10f9="crazydave"]You know that\'s what killing me about the XMods. Sure I can swing 50 bucks, but what makes these cool to me is they are upgradable to AWD, and coming from 1/10th scale I feel bearings are a must. So now I\'ve already spent a hundred, and I don\'t even have rechargable batteries for it yet. Then there\'s motors, You gots to gets da motors, I mean come on how can you not?\r\n\r\nYeah sure I could buy that stuff little by little, and I\'m gonna hafta, but I hate that! :mad: \r\n\r\nDave[/quote:3929cf10f9]\r\n\r\n  Yep I hear that I had larger scale hobby buggies and truck when I was younger and if I could get a nice street car 1/10 scale I prolly would(super,skyline).\r\n\r\n  As for the xmods the shipping is whats gonna kill me so if I just get the starter, AWD and motors I can prolly cash in some of the favors I colected in the toy world(there a re a few guys I ship stuff to that they cant get).\r\n\r\n  You know the price on some of you mods you can prolly make some good extra coin that way.  Hell even just selling precut flames for different bodies.  Toss them on some waxpaper and for 3-4 bucks each.\r\n\r\n  I would really consider if I was you selling a few mods on ebay, I saw a ZZ duel cell with just the chassie(no motors, hubs, wheels body)and the controller and it went for like 40 bucks usd');
