INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (12379, '3d52b09bdc', 'Sorta like the zip zaps being a clone of bits. There are many simularities but alotta differences also.\r\nThe mini z is manufactured by kyosho and has been out for about 3 yrs. The 2 reasons I never picked one up or was even interested in them are...\r\n1. The size is alot bigger than what I usually like to have fun with (ie. bits).\r\n2. The freakin price is in my opinion outrageous. Any where from $80- $120 for a stock RTR kit.\r\nXmods with their $50 base price kinda hooked me though. I\'m planning on scavanging many mini z parts for these (maybe not though cuase even the parts prices are ridiculus ie. $5 for 4 lug nuts). :(');
