INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (15826, '4616b33ba0', 'I\'ve been eyeing your suspension mod for the last week or so.  Great work.  If I ever get off my duff I may just have to give it a go.  \r\n\r\nI\'m still new to the whole online bit thing, but managed to find this in my travels http://members.surfeu.de/cyberjunky/buggy.html  \r\nSeen it before?  I\'m digging that front suspension. \r\n\r\nWe do alot of racing but unfortunately because some of the guys are not that skilled we keep things pretty stock.  There are a small number of us looking to break out of this stock racing rut and run something a little more modified.   \r\n\r\nThe closest thing to a \'mod\' we allow is the gears I\'ve been resin casting.  It was easier (and cheaper) for me to cast gears for use on some of our bits than it was to have everyone go out and buy up Tomy gear sets.  I\'ve found them handy when I want to build up rear axles as well. :o)   I\'m currently working on a few resin bodies as well as replacement steering knuckles (resin body with stainless steel pins).  \r\n\r\nNot quite the performance mod\'s I\'ve seen online (fets, etc) but cool nonetheless.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (12387, '3c7701aad4', 'I am extending a bit to fit under custom casted resin body. Doing major modifications to the appearence of the chassis, but dual cell is to heavy for me. \r\n\r\nI have a plethera of shen pcb\'s lieing around, and a couple bit boosters, i would like to get the boosters set up with better speed, torque and steering. \r\n\r\nHow much you think that would cost?');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (12396, '556c08ba00', '[quote:556c08ba00="sessiz"]Hells yeah man I want a paintjob, but only if ya can put a lil signiture on it. :lol: \r\nYour flame jobs are a work of art, you got a good eye bro.\r\nLet me know what you need from me when you can. :-)[/quote:556c08ba00]Welp, here\'s the deal...My paint jobs aren\'t for sale. I\'ve figure at a decent hourly rate, and the time that goes into each job, plus materials, no one would ever want to pay that.\r\n\r\n...BUT if a fellow pimp like you wants a paint job, I would be honored to do you up something. It\'s just that, like I say all the time, money\'s tight over here, so I would just ask that you cover my cost, which would just be shipping. I would only ask that you pay for paint if you want some bizzarre color I\'ll never use. I\'m running low on paint, and was going to stock up next pay day, so I\'ll take any color suggestions now.\r\n\r\nYou could ship me a body, or if you want to pay me to pick something up, I\'ll send the extra body back too. I\'ve got a pretty good selection around here lately.\r\n\r\nLet me know what you think, and we\'ll try to work something out.\r\n\r\ndave');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (12512, '313adb7876', 'Hey dude whast going on?\r\n\r\n  Just keeping in touch on whats up :)\r\n\r\n  hey had a question about the springs you get.  I picked some up at the hobby shop(had to dig through piles of discount/old stock) but it seems like they need to be cut alittle. Is this the same with the ones you get or should I keep diggin and try and find shorter ones?\r\n\r\nThanks Dude');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (12399, '50928fe4e5', 'That\'ll be great! ill be sending you one booster and one regular chassis, you can fet the booster and put cop lights on the regular...are you still putting headlamps to one of the chassis?');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (12400, '842e428f20', '[quote:842e428f20="Yagbols"]That\'ll be great! ill be sending you one booster and one regular chassis, you can fet the booster and put cop lights on the regular...are you still putting headlamps to one of the chassis?[/quote:842e428f20]\r\n\r\nIf you can find a [b]new[b] 350z booster set I\'ll do the following.\r\n\r\nfet mod the booster \r\nfet mod the single spped and add the cop lights\r\n\r\nsorry dude but the fets cost me $$.\r\n\r\nFor the 2nd hand 350z I\'ll do the following:\r\n\r\nfet mod the booster and add cop lights to the single speed.\r\n\r\nThe cop lights circuit will cost more $$ than the headlights pcb.   Don\'t wanna sound like a prick but it\'s gonna cost.  If you can find a new booster let me know how much it cost you so I can get a better idea of the trade.   Last thing I want to do is screw you, lol!\r\n\r\nph2t.');
