INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (13061, '72071a65af', '[quote:72071a65af="bdebde"]Well, I didn\'t get any notification on the private message. I think it is on my servers end, too. I have a trouble ticket in with them, I will have to see if they can find anything. They keep trying to tell me that it is on the senders end and they can do nothing, but I will keep bugging them. Very annoying to not get emails. I wonder how many are not getting through that I don\'t know about. Thanks for checking into that for me though.[/quote:72071a65af]yea so far everyone I\'ve asked on the boards gets the emails.\r\nI know a lot of mail servers are experiencing troubles due to some Microsoft/XP viruses (Swen/Automat).\r\nI don\'t know if any of this is effecting your situation, but here it is anyway:\r\n[b:72071a65af]ISPs blocking webhosting customers from using SMTP[/b:72071a65af]\r\nA lot of major dialup/dsl/cable ISPs are now blocking EXTERNAL ACCESS to port 25 to prevent SPAM (outgoing email server). If you cannot send emails with outlook, use your dialup/dsl/cable ISP outgoing mail server (contact them for the hostname). \r\n\r\nATT WorldNet, Earthlink,MSN,RCN,Mindspring,Sympatico,Cox...and more are blocking port 25 (or use redirection).');
