INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (13082, 'ff7c4bf9fe', 'Hey Roland,\r\n\r\n I finally got through to a supervisor with my ISP, after 6 or 8 flunkies telling me that nothing could be done about it. Seems other people with my ISP have not been getting emails either. They have a team investigating it and need to know what addresses are not getting through. I was wondering if you tried sending from your different mail accounts, so I could tell them all of them.Thanks. Oh, stuff went out in the mail today on it\'s way to you. Hotmail is down right now (great) so I don\'t know if you sent me anything. I will check later. I will sent this in an email too. You did say you still recieved my emails, correct?\r\n\r\nBruce');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (13083, '92aeb8113f', 'Bloody hell Bruce, I sent a whole lot of copied \'previous\' emails to you using the hotmail address, and now you are saying that is down as well !!\r\nWe just cant win here.\r\nI got this as an email as well from the gte.net address, so they are still getting through to me, just not allowing me to respond.\r\nThe addresses I have been using all originate from dodo.com.au such as rolands@dodo.com.au and microamps@dodo.com.au\r\nSo the cars are on the way, good stuff, thanks. I will let you know when I receive them.\r\nLet me know how you go with this email stuff keep in touch and I will be happy to send test emails anytime you need them done so you can see if things are working.\r\nRegards,\r\nRoland\r\nJust so you know, this is a copy of what I receive when I send you an email.\r\n----------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\nThis message was created automatically by mail delivery software (Exim).\r\n\r\nA message that you sent could not be delivered to one or more of its\r\nrecipients. This is a permanent error. The following address(es) failed:\r\n\r\n  bdebde@gte.net\r\n    SMTP error from remote mailer after MAIL FROM:&lt;rolands@dodo.com.au&gt; SIZE=4223:\r\n    host relay.gte.net [206.46.170.12]: 550 You are not allowed to send mail:sc021.verizon.net\r\n\r\n------ This is a copy of the message, including all the headers. ------\r\n\r\nReturn-path: &lt;rolands@dodo.com.au&gt;\r\nReceived: from [203.194.51.29] (helo=c2i5w0)\r\nby relay01.kbs.net.au with smtp (Exim 3.36 #1)\r\nid 1AEQ3B-0000k5-00\r\nfor bdebde@gte.net; Tue, 28 Oct 2003 20:22:06 +1100\r\nMessage-ID: &lt;003601c39d35$a1422500$1d33c2cb@c2i5w0&gt;\r\nFrom: "Roland" &lt;rolands@dodo.com.au&gt;\r\nTo: "Bruce Ellis" &lt;bdebde@gte.net&gt;\r\nSubject: Fw: email problems?????\r\nDate: Tue, 28 Oct 2003 20:26:54 +1100\r\nMIME-Version: 1.0\r\nContent-Type: multipart/alternative;\r\nboundary="----=_NextPart_000_0033_01C39D91.D3D9F040"\r\nX-Priority: 3\r\nX-MSMail-Priority: Normal\r\nX-Mailer: Microsoft Outlook Express 6.00.2800.1106\r\nX-MIMEOLE: Produced By Microsoft MimeOLE V6.00.2800.1106\r\n\r\nThis is a multi-part message in MIME format.\r\n\r\n------=_NextPart_000_0033_01C39D91.D3D9F040\r\nContent-Type: text/plain;\r\ncharset="Windows-1252"\r\nContent-Transfer-Encoding: quoted-printable\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n.=20\r\n----- Original Message -----=20\r\nFrom: Roland=20\r\nTo: Bruce Ellis=20\r\nSent: Tuesday, October 28, 2003 8:04 PM\r\nSubject: email problems?????\r\n\r\n\r\nBruce,\r\nI am getting notifications from your email provider gte.net about emails =\r\nnot going through.\r\n\r\nIf you get this can you let me know please.\r\nI also am not able to view the vid you posted, but would love to orgnise =\r\nposting something like this on my website, with credit to you.\r\nAlso some news regarding my website too.\r\nPlease let me know if you receive this\r\nRoland\r\nP.S. Do you have MSN or Yahoo accounts? (I do but use them very =\r\ninfrequently) Maybe this might overcome the email problem. Id like to =\r\ndiscuss a few things.\r\nR');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (12559, '0639d6b768', 'Yea its a piss off that he has the answer(micro that is) and wont give it up.\r\n\r\n  I was almost tempted to send his one of my SE\'s and tell him not to put epoxy on it so I can further mod it in the future.\r\n\r\n  Not sure that would have showed anything though  :-? \r\n\r\n\r\n fuck it pisses me off and I dont even do the mod...  I can understand if everyone was out there charging an arm and a leg for this mod but its seems to be a simple mod(for people with the soldering skills) on normal ZZ\'s and bits and there are tuts all over for it.  I have this feeling its something really simple like a transistor or resistor(again not good with electronics) that is casueing the problem and when removed has no effect on anything else from the car.\r\n\r\n\r\nWell just to let you know You and CW has made me change my way about sprays and paint jobs.  I just did my first fade job and I will have pics up tomorrow(clearcoat dryin).  \r\n\r\nPete');
