it just didn\'t fit my needs.\r\nBut I\'m glad you found the cash and still want it.\r\nand I am glad I\'m helping you out.\r\nI\'ve got it all bundled up ready for shipping. I don\'t have a price yet.\r\nby noon tomorrow I will.[/quote:f07675b0c5]\r\n\r\nawww shucks, thanks man.\r\nexcellent!  let me know the final price and I\'ll whip some lemmings to get the $$$.\r\n\r\nMatt.[/quote:f07675b0c5]\r\n\r\nI\'ve been searching this AM for your shipping address.\r\ncan\'t find it, Matt.\r\n\r\nsend me it, please....as I was it to go out today.\r\n\r\n-nigel');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (12567, 'a8866bcfd5', '[quote:a8866bcfd5="crazydave"][quote:a8866bcfd5="VooDooMafia"]Yea its a piss off that he has the answer(micro that is) and wont give it up.\r\n\r\n  I was almost tempted to send his one of my SE\'s and tell him not to put epoxy on it so I can further mod it in the future.\r\n\r\n  Not sure that would have showed anything though  :-? \r\n\r\n\r\n fuck it pisses me off and I dont even do the mod...  I can understand if everyone was out there charging an arm and a leg for this mod but its seems to be a simple mod(for people with the soldering skills) on normal ZZ\'s and bits and there are tuts all over for it.  I have this feeling its something really simple like a transistor or resistor(again not good with electronics) that is casueing the problem and when removed has no effect on anything else from the car.\r\n\r\n\r\nWell just to let you know You and CW has made me change my way about sprays and paint jobs.  I just did my first fade job and I will have pics up tomorrow(clearcoat dryin).  \r\n\r\nPete[/quote:a8866bcfd5]Yeah you know, I had offered to do a mosfet mod for Payaso for free, just to be cool, and he never got back to me. Then just this evening he mentions in my SS camaro thread that his car is with micro_Amps. I just took offense to that, you know that he\'d rather pay him top dollar than get a freebie off me. That just makes me more determined to figure this stupid SE thing out. ph2t is confident we can do it, I\'m just getting confused. I don\'t know, he\'s got an EE degree, so hopefully he can figure something out.\r\n\r\ndave\r\n\r\n\r\nAnd yeah, your paint jobs have been looking good, can\'t wait to see your fade. :grin: \r\n\r\nDave[/quote:a8866bcfd5]\r\n\r\n I am not sure what micro does for a living or what qualifications he has but really it should be that hard to figure it out an I know you guys will do it.  Main problem is that ph2t doesn;t have one to work with so when he starts to brain storm its all in therey(sp?).\r\n\r\n  I bet that micro took 80 percent of what ph2t (along with others) had to say and figured it out.\r\n\r\n  As for payaso I am not sure why he would not wait as he knows it will be out soon.  Hell I bet the germans have it figured out and will post something soon enough.\r\n\r\n  Well I have al the faith in you guys and even though I have no clue what is up with the mod I make sure to check all for forums I come accross cause you never know.\r\n\r\nPete');
