INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (12832, 'b5b30d6418', '[quote:b5b30d6418="VooDooMafia"]  Thanks dude maybe I should try that I am getting shity run times and on the cars with 200mah cells I just keep putting them back on the charger like 10-15 times[/quote:b5b30d6418] That makes sense. I think all these people spending their money on 150mah to 200mah cells are wasting their money, because more mahs don\'t do nothing unless your charging longer. Besides I get 20+ min runtimes from stock 50mah Tomy cells, and it\'s a proven fact that NiCds have a lower internal resistance than NiMHs, and punch better. I prefer the Tomy batteries.\r\n\r\nThose 200mah batteries would probably take 10+ minutes to charge completely from 2 AAs. Takes my 150mah batteries about 7-8 to peak.');
