INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (12776, '7c3886b72b', '[quote:7c3886b72b="crazydave"]Yeah you know, Big Lots has a butt load of the Micro Speed cars for 7 bucks. They are compatible with Microsizer controllers, handle great, and have a pretty good motor in them. Throw some FETs in one those, and just knock a quickie flame job, and I could see that selling for a decent profit. I\'ve been thinking about that recently.\r\n\r\nMan, you guys (you &amp; Havok) are always getting me scheming on ways to make money.\r\n\r\nDave[/quote:7c3886b72b]\r\n\r\n  Well I am alwasy thining of ways to make $$ thats what I do best.  The more I think about it the more $$ I end up working.\r\n\r\n  At one point all I did was sell shit on ebay and I made way more then I do now ($700+ a week) and I didn\'t have to go out.\r\n\r\n  Now I still sell be its not like it used to be ever since 911.  Man I remember when you could sell anything on there.\r\n\r\n  Still always looking my big thing is going to the fleamarket or second hand shops and looking for things to buy cheap and resell.\r\n\r\n  Figure the more extra cash I can make the more I can spend on my hobbies.\r\n\r\n  Any progress on your se affair? bdebde said that the PBC was covered in very thick black epoxy so you could tell anything from it :(');
