INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (12904, 'e9a627dc5e', 'Yeah, it sucks about my hand.  They were the two fingers I grip the controller with.  :lol:  I’ll be driving in no time.  I was browsing Ebay last night and I found a few things.  I’ve shopped around for different things and after comparing prices, I think I came out okay on the deals.  The first thing was 2 Brand new microsizers in their boxes.  Only thing missing are the bodies, plus he threw in a tire set, 2.2 upgrade motor and a clear 350z body.  They aren’t the Pro series, but I was getting them for the chassis to mess with anyway.  I have enough extra bodies to make up for these two.  I got both for $20 shipped.  I figure the tire set is $5 if I buy it so I came out about even as if I got them at the store.  One bonehead thing I did, was not realizing they weren’t the Pro’s, but I’ll learn from the mistake.  Second thing I got was a group of 4 – Tomy  Bit Char G pullbacks (GP-01,02,03,06) for $19 shipped.  I can always use these bodies on the chassis I got from the other deal.  Third auction I won was a lot of (20)Bit Char G 3.8 motors for $18 shipped.  If they work well when I get them, I’ll hook you up with a few.  The last auction I got was a lot of (40) NiMH Bit Char G batteries rated at 150 MAH.  I got these for $30 shipped.  They come out to around .75 cents each so not too bad.  I’ll let you know how it turns out.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (12905, '54e337a7b3', 'Holy schnike....lol That\'s alotof stuff.  You\'ll be gettin stuff in like it\'s christmas. Damn I\'m jealous.   Which pullbacks did you get. I can\'e remember which is which.\r\n\r\nDid you get all that in the USA, or HK?  Did you see bdebde\'s vid of his FETed SE? That thing smokes up the track... \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n-S');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (12906, '54e337a7b3', 'Holy schnike....lol That\'s alotof stuff.  You\'ll be gettin stuff in like it\'s christmas. Damn I\'m jealous.   Which pullbacks did you get. I can\'e remember which is which.\r\n\r\nDid you get all that in the USA, or HK?  Did you see bdebde\'s vid of his FETed SE? That thing smokes up the track... \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n-S');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (12907, 'b6d44a6613', '[quote:b6d44a6613="payaso"]Holy schnike....lol That\'s alotof stuff.  You\'ll be gettin stuff in like it\'s christmas. Damn I\'m jealous.   Which pullbacks did you get. I can\'e remember which is which.\r\n\r\nDid you get all that in the USA, or HK?  Did you see bdebde\'s vid of his FETed SE? That thing smokes up the track... \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n-S[/quote:b6d44a6613]\r\n\r\nWell, I had some extra cash and I figured I could sell off any batteries or motors that I don\'t use.  Here are the 4 pullbacks that I got.  Skyline GT-R R34, Honda NSX, Skyline R32, Skyline 2000GT-R\r\n\r\nhttp://import.h8rs.com/Grunge/pullback.jpg\r\n\r\nI got the motors, batteries and microsizers from the US and the pullbacks from HK.  No one had placed a bid for the pullbacks, so I got them for the minimum bid.  With shipping they come out to be $5 each and after looking at ToyEast, it\'s a good deal.  It seems like most things on Ebay that are coming from HK are too expensive when you add in the shipping.  One Bit comes out to be 27-30 dollars.  I have a some bids on a few from HK that are 9.99 and with shipping come out to be around $20 bucks.  It looks like a reputable company, so I\'m hoping they don\'t stick me with a clone instead of a Bit Char G.   I was planning on ordering some Mosfets and talk my friend into installing them on a few of my cars.  I looked at a website that had them, but I wasn\'t sure which model number to get.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (12908, 'b6d44a6613', '[quote:b6d44a6613="payaso"]Holy schnike....lol That\'s alotof stuff.  You\'ll be gettin stuff in like it\'s christmas. Damn I\'m jealous.   Which pullbacks did you get. I can\'e remember which is which.\r\n\r\nDid you get all that in the USA, or HK?  Did you see bdebde\'s vid of his FETed SE? That thing smokes up the track... \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n-S[/quote:b6d44a6613]\r\n\r\nWell, I had some extra cash and I figured I could sell off any batteries or motors that I don\'t use.  Here are the 4 pullbacks that I got.  Skyline GT-R R34, Honda NSX, Skyline R32, Skyline 2000GT-R\r\n\r\nhttp://import.h8rs.com/Grunge/pullback.jpg\r\n\r\nI got the motors, batteries and microsizers from the US and the pullbacks from HK.  No one had placed a bid for the pullbacks, so I got them for the minimum bid.  With shipping they come out to be $5 each and after looking at ToyEast, it\'s a good deal.  It seems like most things on Ebay that are coming from HK are too expensive when you add in the shipping.  One Bit comes out to be 27-30 dollars.  I have a some bids on a few from HK that are 9.99 and with shipping come out to be around $20 bucks.  It looks like a reputable company, so I\'m hoping they don\'t stick me with a clone instead of a Bit Char G.   I was planning on ordering some Mosfets and talk my friend into installing them on a few of my cars.  I looked at a website that had them, but I wasn\'t sure which model number to get.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (12909, '37bed4f1ef', 'You\'re gonna be so pleased with those pullbacks. They rock the house. If you want to get rid of one of them, just let me know.  I wish they sold them locally like at a hobby shop. \r\n\r\n\r\nI was testing motors last night, and the 4.2 motors are JUNK.... Totally not worth the $$$$.  My 3.8 motors from Kyle (bitchar-Gmotors) smoke everything in flat out speed.\r\n\r\nLet me know when you get all that cool stuff in.. \r\n\r\n\r\n-S');
