INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (13194, 'def41e0663', 'Well I have to agree on the whole "second pbc" thing, if micro has a way of doing it without one then there has to be another solution.  \r\n\r\n  Not sure if you have tried looking at the german sites but I will search around today see if I can find anything.  As for the other fets you are going to order, are tehy different then the normal ones that are being used?  If so maybe the solution is just that and thats why micro has not said anything but who knows.\r\n\r\n  With the first fets that you tried on teh SE was it just the torque it was lacking but still had the top speed of a normal fetted car?\r\n\r\n  well I will also continue to ask micro amps questions and try and get something out of him, has not worked yet but lets see.\r\n\r\n  As for the xmod/mini z/epoch deal I know the xmod has 16 steps but that would be fine with me.   The epoch has 512 steps and I use about 4 of them lol.  I am working on a deal with a guy in hong kong to have some epochs sent over and if it works out they will be cheap and I am sure we can trade for something.  I was lucky and got mine from ebay for $50 shipped.  I never use my mini z though it is packed away but one I get an xmod I will use it for sure.\r\n\r\n  I never got into 1/10 cars only cause the price and every time I saw a good deal it was without the TX and servos and shit.  Maybe one day I will just get a used one but untill then I am more then happy with the micros and epoch.  I will say my fav car right now is my AE86 Digi Q R, I am very happy with how these handle (better then normal digi q) and there speed is nice for such a small thing.\r\n\r\nPete');
