le to get it done till late next week. I\'ve got a lot on my plate right now and it takes an hour or two to do the mod, plus post office, etc. Just want to be upfront that I have a really busy week coming up, but I\'ll do my best.[/quote:809ccd0b74]\r\n\r\n\r\n  Dude you should know that its all good :)\r\n\r\n I know it will got out sometime lol, I know what its like being bogged down sometimes.  I am free most the time now but whne the perental leave is up and I have to "work" again I will be busy as shit seeing as some dumb ass has been running my department for the last 8 months lol.\r\n\r\n  When ever you get the time dude, get the important stuff done first then sent it.  I am in no hurry :)');
