INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (14037, 'f5b165a080', 'I finally got around to ordering a new batch of FETs, and I\'m getting ready to start my work on the SE back up. I could use your extra PCB, because I like to keep one car working, so I have a reference point should something go wrong.\r\n\r\nThe offers still on if you want a FET modded Thunder charger PCB, that\'s no prob for me. I could even paint you a body if that appeals to you. Just let me know.\r\n\r\nAnyways, the address, for whenever you\'re ready to send it, is:\r\nDavid Harrington\r\n6751 W Indian School Rd. Apt 1150\r\nPhoenix, AZ 85033\r\n\r\nThanks,\r\ndave');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (14038, '49f90fb703', '[quote:49f90fb703="Maxximum Attack"]This thing is fast as rasshole  :-D [size=24:49f90fb703][/size:49f90fb703][/quote:49f90fb703] :???: Not sure what a rasshole is, but them thing must be fast, \'cause I\'ve never seen one. :lol: \r\n\r\nYep, FETs do make them cars go quick, but you notice that it doesn\'t seem to add speed as much as power. It seems like fast motors like the TinyRC R-spec, and Perfection 4.2s are drawing too much power, and FETs are just give these motors the power they need to hit their rated speed.\r\n\r\nDave');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (14039, 'f5b165a080', 'I finally got around to ordering a new batch of FETs, and I\'m getting ready to start my work on the SE back up. I could use your extra PCB, because I like to keep one car working, so I have a reference point should something go wrong.\r\n\r\nThe offers still on if you want a FET modded Thunder charger PCB, that\'s no prob for me. I could even paint you a body if that appeals to you. Just let me know.\r\n\r\nAnyways, the address, for whenever you\'re ready to send it, is:\r\nDavid Harrington\r\n6751 W Indian School Rd. Apt 1150\r\nPhoenix, AZ 85033\r\n\r\nThanks,\r\ndave');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (14040, '5df364975a', 'You get anymore up on ebay yet?  Its the xmas season and people wanna spend there cash lol.\r\n\r\n  But anyway just checking to see how things are going, I know here they are busy as shit and dont have time to drop in asmuch as I should.\r\n\r\n  With Xmas and having to prepare to go back to work in just avoer a month its killin me.\r\n\r\n  Congrats on your 3rd place but IMO that car should have takin it but I hear they had some crazy system for judging so who knows.\r\n\r\n  Hows the se mods going and the xmods?\r\n\r\nPete');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (14041, 'b3b957a25f', 'you just need the pcb or the whole car? one of the little transistors or something came off the board but for the most part its intact. ya a trade for a fetted tcharger or one of your paint jobs would work well. i just payed rent today so i cant afford shit til probably next week.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (14042, '5df364975a', 'You get anymore up on ebay yet?  Its the xmas season and people wanna spend there cash lol.\r\n\r\n  But anyway just checking to see how things are going, I know here they are busy as shit and dont have time to drop in asmuch as I should.\r\n\r\n  With Xmas and having to prepare to go back to work in just avoer a month its killin me.\r\n\r\n  Congrats on your 3rd place but IMO that car should have takin it but I hear they had some crazy system for judging so who knows.\r\n\r\n  Hows the se mods going and the xmods?\r\n\r\nPete');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (14043, 'c97a003472', '[quote:c97a003472="VooDooMafia"]You get anymore up on ebay yet?  Its the xmas season and people wanna spend there cash lol.\r\n\r\n  But anyway just checking to see how things are going, I know here they are busy as shit and dont have time to drop in asmuch as I should.\r\n\r\n  With Xmas and having to prepare to go back to work in just avoer a month its killin me.\r\n\r\n  Congrats on your 3rd place but IMO that car should have takin it but I hear they had some crazy system for judging so who knows.\r\n\r\n  Hows the se mods going and the xmods?\r\n\r\nPete[/quote:c97a003472]To basically answer all your questions, I just ordered my FETs, as soon as they get here, everything will resume. I also came across some 10 dolla Bit Char-Gs, so I got a batch of those to modify.\r\n\r\nA Lancer, that I will FET mod, paint, put a 4.2 in it, then put right back in the box, and definately sell on ebay.\r\n\r\nA Calsonic Skyline. It comes with a 2.6, and a race themed body, so I\'m just gonna FET mod it, but it\'s not going right back in the box. I gonna play with it for a week, and think about keeping it, but it will probably end up back in the box, as I already have a 35mhz Skyline, but I\'d kinda like to keep that 2.6, because it\'s the only Tomy motor I don\'t have.\r\n\r\nA silver S2000 that I will be keeping for the 57mhz frequency\r\n\r\nA Wild Char-G (I can\'t believe I got that for 10 bucks too! last one at that! :eek: ) That I don\'t know what I\'m gonna do with. I\'m gonna FEt mod it, and it better be cool, or I\'m gonna put that sucker on ebay too.\r\n\r\nThen there\'s that stretched Micro Speed. I paint the camaro body, and give that one a second chance.\r\n\r\n\r\nOn the Ausmicro contest, I didn\'t mind taking 3rd place, but I honestly didn\'t agree with 1st and second. There was several cars that could have, should have placed above mine, but they didn\'t like just say, \'I put in FETs, and a 3.8 in it\', because the reality is, even though you and me know I have FETs in my cars, the judges didn\'t really know that as a fact. Considering all they can do is look at a picture, I feel looks should have played the largest contributing factor.\r\n\r\nI\'d like to bitch, but I took 3rd, so I gotta just smile and wave.  :-) Thanks guys, thank you so much, wow, just thanks, you know whatever. :roll: \r\n\r\nSo yeah, just waiting for stuff to come in, then I placed in that ausmicro thing. That\'s about it. :lol: \r\n\r\ndave');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (14044, 'b3b957a25f', 'you just need the pcb or the whole car? one of the little transistors or something came off the board but for the most part its intact. ya a trade for a fetted tcharger or one of your paint jobs would work well. i just payed rent today so i cant afford shit til probably next week.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (14045, '83af92636f', '[quote:83af92636f="hogjowlz"]you just need the pcb or the whole car? one of the little transistors or something came off the board but for the most part its intact. ya a trade for a fetted tcharger or one of your paint jobs would work well. i just payed rent today so i cant afford shit til probably next week.[/quote:83af92636f]Yeah just the PCB. I ripped the tab that a capacitor solders to off mine, so as long as the tabs are still there, I can always pull the part off my dead PCB to replace it.\r\n\r\nCool, I\'ll hook ya up.\r\n\r\nI understand about the rent thing. In the same boat myself. :lol: \r\n\r\nDave');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (14046, 'c97a003472', '[quote:c97a003472="VooDooMafia"]You get anymore up on ebay yet?  Its the xmas season and people wanna spend there cash lol.\r\n\r\n  But anyway just checking to see how things are going, I know here they are busy as shit and dont have time to drop in asmuch as I should.\r\n\r\n  With Xmas and having to prepare to go back to work in just avoer a month its killin me.\r\n\r\n  Congrats on your 3rd place but IMO that car should have takin it but I hear they had some crazy system for judging so who knows.\r\n\r\n  Hows the se mods going and the xmods?\r\n\r\nPete[/quote:c97a003472]To basically answer all your questions, I just ordered my FETs, as soon as they get here, everything will resume. I also came across some 10 dolla Bit Char-Gs, so I got a batch of those to modify.\r\n\r\nA Lancer, that I will FET mod, paint, put a 4.2 in it, then put right back in the box, and definately sell on ebay.\r\n\r\nA Calsonic Skyline. It comes with a 2.6, and a race themed body, so I\'m just gonna FET mod it, but it\'s not going right back in the box. I gonna play with it for a week, and think about keeping it, but it will probably end up back in the box, as I already have a 35mhz Skyline, but I\'d kinda like to keep that 2.6, because it\'s the only Tomy motor I don\'t have.\r\n\r\nA silver S2000 that I will be keeping for the 57mhz frequency\r\n\r\nA Wild Char-G (I can\'t believe I got that for 10 bucks too! last one at that! :eek: ) That I don\'t know what I\'m gonna do with. I\'m gonna FEt mod it, and it better be cool, or I\'m gonna put that sucker on ebay too.\r\n\r\nThen there\'s that stretched Micro Speed. I paint the camaro body, and give that one a second chance.\r\n\r\n\r\nOn the Ausmicro contest, I didn\'t mind taking 3rd place, but I honestly didn\'t agree with 1st and second. There was several cars that could have, should have placed above mine, but they didn\'t like just say, \'I put in FETs, and a 3.8 in it\', because the reality is, even though you and me know I have FETs in my cars, the judges didn\'t really know that as a fact. Considering all they can do is look at a picture, I feel looks should have played the largest contributing factor.\r\n\r\nI\'d like to bitch, but I took 3rd, so I gotta just smile and wave.  :-) Thanks guys, thank you so much, wow, just thanks, you know whatever. :roll: \r\n\r\nSo yeah, just waiting for stuff to come in, then I placed in that ausmicro thing. That\'s about it. :lol: \r\n\r\ndave');
