INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (18603, 'a0d90b3f73', 'OK, here\'s the method I would like to do:\r\n\r\n1st round, everyone rank each car in order. Betty.k suggested the following:\r\n\r\nAward a maximum of 20 points to each of the 5 categories specified; \r\noriginality \r\npaint job \r\npresentation \r\nfunctionality \r\npimpitude! \r\n\r\nso the best a car can achieve is 100 points. \r\n\r\nThese points will only be for your own purposes in ranking the entries, as using actual numbers from different judges could skew things.\r\n\r\nSo, ultimately I would like each judge to send me a list of all of the entries in order, in the following format:\r\n\r\n1. CaboWabo - Midnight Jota\r\n2. Dark Tari - 360 Modena\r\netc.\r\n\r\nI will then tabulate the top 5 entries, and then we will have a run-off between just those 5 for the places. We have 5 prizes (Cars from hue35, betty.k, CJ and SuperFly, and a BIFF from ph2t) and the poster from sessiz for everyone (right?).\r\n\r\nLet me know if you have any questions, otherwise send me your ballots by Tuesday if you can.\r\n\r\nThanks!\r\n\r\nSuperFly');
