INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (14939, '7a36221111', 'ph2t, now i have one more thing to add to the good side. I have confirmed with him that he has paid. (see conversation below, and PM him to double check it ) His mom is expecting a new CC soon (same, see convo below, and PM him to double check it.)\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nMcLaren F1 T3: ok, let me get this straight\r\nMcLaren F1 T3: i need two q\'s answered\r\nMcLaren F1 T3: its that alright?\r\nk          77652: yup\r\nMcLaren F1 T3: Have you sent my 49mhz MS Single Speed chassis yet?\r\nk          77652: yes\r\nMcLaren F1 T3: Ok, thats good\r\nMcLaren F1 T3: and also\r\nMcLaren F1 T3: Have you sent the payment (if your mom got a new CC) And if your mom got a new CC when will you be paying for it, (give me a exact date if can)\r\nk          77652: no i havent paidyet. i have tried tho. when she gets her new cc i wil pay\r\nMcLaren F1 T3: Any word when she is getting her new CC?\r\nk          77652: no\r\nMcLaren F1 T3: expecting it soon though right?\r\nk          77652: yea\r\nMcLaren F1 T3: OK\r\n\r\n\r\nThat is the conversation me and micro had, as obviously, im Mclaren F1 T3 and he is K77652.           Thanks for still hanging on dood. -Mike');
