INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (14864, '331a9b0df0', 'Wassup homie? How was your Christmas?   I\'m still having issues with ICQ, but I have MSN running. \r\n\r\n My addy over there is alxdav420@hotmail.com\r\n\r\nIf you got MSN, hit me up on it when you get some free time.\r\n\r\nHave a good New Year dood.\r\n\r\n\r\n-Steve');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (14865, '3950246dcf', 'What\'s up dood... How was your Christmas?  I gots a chassis I\'m sending your way to be pimped even more for the PHAT contest prize.  \r\n\r\nThe car is finished, so should I send you everything, or just the chassis?  I\'m cool either way.\r\n\r\nI need your addy so I can send it . I\'m burnin the midnight oil.\r\n\r\nLet me know homie.. Have a great New Year.\r\n\r\n\r\nIf my sentences are a little bland, it\'s because I\'m burnt...lol\r\n\r\n-Steve');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (14851, 'd1a078d31f', '[quote:d1a078d31f="DarkTari"]Didn\'t want to comment on the post since ph2t is in the click but that was a hard loss for me.  I appreciate your opinion and support.  I put 9 fuckin cars in that contest, from my first Custom painted cars to everything new I\'ve done since then and them muthafuckers chose a goddamn 4 trailer truck ?????\r\n\r\nIt was a mechanical wonder I have to admit but I can\'t understand how ph2t placed 2nd, especially since he donated the prize.  I\'m not hatin on him at all, I have a good repore with him but the judging in that contest was fucked up.  It took them over a month and this is what they came up with?  I\'ll never enter shit in anything they put on again.  I know I sound like a sore looser but hey fuck it!  All I could do was congratulate the winners (on BitPimps) but I didn\'t say shit on their forum.  I guess if you don\'t have anything good to say.........\r\n\r\nI know I would\'ve come off real bad had I responded to the winners at the announcement of them so I did the best thing.\r\n\r\nThe Pimps did turn dat mutha out and everybody, on every forum, all over the world knows the BitPimps are a force to be recond with.  You should\'ve gotten first I think!  When you came out with that bug,  I freaked and I think I let you know that as did everybody else.\r\n\r\nMan I been holdin dat shit in for so long, now let me go hit the EggNOG!\r\n\r\nPeace On Earth ????[/quote:d1a078d31f]Hey, help me out here, so can ph2t see the mod forum? (I\'m a mod now ya know?  8-) ) \r\nCause I don\'t want to diss him, he\'s a big time pimp. \r\n\r\nI may have got carried away, but I\'ve been holding that in too, and since I thought just mods would see that, I figured it was safe to let it all out.\r\n\r\nAnyways, I would have been proud to take third behind you, but as it turned out, I was like WTF. An interior light beat out all my craftsmanship, ok, whatever, I didn\'t think he was eligible since he put up the prize, but ok. I hate lights anyways. Extra weight fucks with the handling, and when it comes down to it every single one of my cars is set up to race.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nOh and you think I\'m done, I\'m not even done, check this out... :mad:\r\n\r\nI commented my usual comments on clear coats, and then this ol\' pompous ass oldtamiyaphile starts to insinuate that my stuff is inferior to his Tamiya stuff. I\'ve used the tamiya stuff, good stuff, for model paint, but it is model paint. Anyways after debateing with them for a bit, I decided it wasn\'t worth my time, and told them something about how you used the paints I use, and they accused you of photoshopping your car to get that glare, but if they\'d just listen to me for a sec, they\'d realized that is the real deal. \r\n\r\nWho\'d want to go photoshopping glare anyways?\r\n\r\nSo that was the last post I made over there, and I want to keep it that way. I keep thinking I should back and thank them for my prize, but I\'m afraid if I do, I\'ll check out that thread, and go off on them.\r\n\r\nSo sorry about the semi-rant, but I had some shit I had to get out.\r\n\r\ndave');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (14852, 'a81a805348', 'I wasn\'t aware you were a moderator Pimp!  Welcome to Pimpotium!\r\nCongratulations! I must\'ve missed the anouncement.\r\n I didn\'t even check what forum I was reading from, just accessed from email,  I thought it was the Gangsta Trick Click forum.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (14853, '2858a3ca54', 'Here\'s something else I know I shouldn\'t be bitching about, but I just can\'t help but to feel like, WTF?\r\n\r\nSo you know that Panic Toys (BitHed) was putting up special prizes for all the winners? Well here was my special prize:\r\n\r\n[img:2858a3ca54]http://s2k-kidz.com/crazycars/prize.jpg[/img:2858a3ca54]\r\n\r\nNotice it says: "Not For Sale" on it, so it was a promotional item that he probably got stacks of for free.\r\n\r\nI kinda cool, cause I bet alot of people in the states don\'t have one, but it\'s in \'engrish\', kinda gay, and I\'ll never use it on my cars.\r\n\r\nThe main thing about it, is that it just has \'cheap ass\' written all over it.  Makes me wonder why they didn\'t just say I was getting a little decal sheet, instead of saying a \'special prize package\' and get my hopes all up.\r\n\r\nSorry, more petty whining I just had to get out of the way.\r\n\r\nDave');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (14854, '9a42d128e4', 'So [b:9a42d128e4]THAT [/b:9a42d128e4]was 3rd prize?  Them cheap muthafuckas! To be honest 1st prize was the [b:9a42d128e4]ONLY[/b:9a42d128e4] one I wanted.  I got 2 light kits now that I never used and may offer them up in a BitPimp Trivia contest.  Who\'s runnin the show over at Aus anyways!\r\n\r\nI\'ll continue to Pimp our contests but as far a posting, I not too interrested.\r\n\r\nI gotta pimp da hood so I\'m always in another hood scopin!\r\n\r\nPeace Out and again Welcome To Da Moderators Click !!!!');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (14855, 'a81a805348', 'I wasn\'t aware you were a moderator Pimp!  Welcome to Pimpotium!\r\nCongratulations! I must\'ve missed the anouncement.\r\n I didn\'t even check what forum I was reading from, just accessed from email,  I thought it was the Gangsta Trick Click forum.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (14856, '9a42d128e4', 'So [b:9a42d128e4]THAT [/b:9a42d128e4]was 3rd prize?  Them cheap muthafuckas! To be honest 1st prize was the [b:9a42d128e4]ONLY[/b:9a42d128e4] one I wanted.  I got 2 light kits now that I never used and may offer them up in a BitPimp Trivia contest.  Who\'s runnin the show over at Aus anyways!\r\n\r\nI\'ll continue to Pimp our contests but as far a posting, I not too interrested.\r\n\r\nI gotta pimp da hood so I\'m always in another hood scopin!\r\n\r\nPeace Out and again Welcome To Da Moderators Click !!!!');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (14863, '6fcd9ef525', 'Okay then, That\'s pretty cool!\r\n\r\nI guess he was, I never saw and anouncement so I think no one else knew either but I\'m quite sure we\'re all in agreement with his decision.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (14858, 'f2262d8193', 'hey mate, alloys have been sent out, expect to see them in 7-10 working days.  hopefully there won\'t be too much of a holdup with xmas/new years mail.\r\n\r\ncheers,\r\n\r\nmatt.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (14859, '96e5087756', '[quote:96e5087756="DarkTari"]So [b:96e5087756]THAT [/b:96e5087756]was 3rd prize?  Them cheap muthafuckas! To be honest 1st prize was the [b:96e5087756]ONLY[/b:96e5087756] one I wanted.  I got 2 light kits now that I never used and may offer them up in a BitPimp Trivia contest.  Who\'s runnin the show over at Aus anyways!\r\n\r\nI\'ll continue to Pimp our contests but as far a posting, I not too interrested.\r\n\r\nI gotta pimp da hood so I\'m always in another hood scopin!\r\n\r\nPeace Out and again Welcome To Da Moderators Click !!!![/quote:96e5087756]Oh no, it\'s not that bad. I got a track barrier set, and gear set. \r\n\r\nIt\'s just that Panic Toys stepped up to offer a "special prize package" to all the winners, and that was the "special prize". I just think that was awful cheap for the all the advertising he got out of sponsering the contest.\r\n\r\nYa know?\r\n\r\n...and thanks for the welcome.  :-) \r\n\r\nSo is cabo the only one that realizes I\'m a mod now?  :lol: \r\n\r\ndave');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (14860, '6fcd9ef525', 'Okay then, That\'s pretty cool!\r\n\r\nI guess he was, I never saw and anouncement so I think no one else knew either but I\'m quite sure we\'re all in agreement with his decision.');
