INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (14929, 'de46258ba3', '[quote:de46258ba3="PimpIke"]i think he freakin jacked me dood... i, and he fuckin said he  gave him my microsizer 49mhz sport chassispaid the bills. what a loser man.., and on top of that, he was saying that he shipped them TOGETHER... great, another 15 dollars fuckin down the drain, what a b*tch dood... its aight ph2t. -mike[/quote:de46258ba3]\r\n\r\nso to get this straight \'cause it\'s a bit tricky to understand what you just wrote.\r\n\r\nyou sent him some $ and your 49mspro chassis, he was gonna send that and HIS chassis (45mhz one, bcg single speed) to me along with $12 in paypal to cover both of you.\r\n\r\nwhat has happened:\r\n\r\nI\'ve got only the $6 via paypal, micro confirmed he wants this for himself.  he also has sent only a single chassis, the 45mhz one which I have.  He has also told me his mum is having trouble with her CC that\'s why they can\'t send the other $6 yet.   \r\n\r\nThis is the info I have at the moment.  If you know him personally I suggest you go over and see him and make this issue visible to his mum, the owner of the CC.\r\n\r\nI will agree that it does sound dodgy, but at the moment I can only assume he IS having CC issues.\r\n\r\nlet me know how you go mate,\r\n\r\nmatt.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (14932, '77a79d3583', 'I just finished talking to him on AIM, and it seems like, his mom had CC problems, somebody took her digits... So i can believe that, as well as everything else.  I\'m kinda sorry for bad mouthing, but now i can believe it. Its all good ph2t, he said he will take care of everything by the end of jan \'04, and thats when i should finnaly have my car back.    -mike');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (19138, 'c139fb9179', '[quote:c139fb9179="PimpIke"]Hey Cabo. I am very sick of hogjowlz and all his mouth that is full of shit. Editing my posts into very sick things saying that im gay Like rocking charlies rectum. He also said that I am a fucking moron. This is probably the last of what you will hear of me, because no matter what forum, moderators shouldn\'t have the ability to go make fun of people. Its certainly not funny when your getting made fun of, especiall when you have been here for a [b:c139fb9179][u:c139fb9179]LONG[/u:c139fb9179][/b:c139fb9179] time.\r\n\r\nGood luck keeping members.\r\n\r\nMike[/quote:c139fb9179]you know you\'re not totally innocent here right?\r\nif you think you are, then you have more growing up to do.\r\n\r\nI understand your frustrations and concerns, but I saw your posts about charlie....\r\nwhat makes you think you have the right to do that shit?\r\nwhat makes you think we don\'t have the right to do it right back to you?\r\nwhat makes you think I give 2 shits if you\'re here or not?\r\nyou\'re not a regular member, you barely come here anymore and all you do is cry like a baby lately when you do come here.\r\n\r\nGood luck finding a forum where you don\'t rub other members the wrong way.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (14934, '537b034608', '[quote:537b034608="PimpIke"]I just finished talking to him on AIM, and it seems like, his mom had CC problems, somebody took her digits... So i can believe that, as well as everything else.  I\'m kinda sorry for bad mouthing, but now i can believe it. Its all good ph2t, he said he will take care of everything by the end of jan \'04, and thats when i should finnaly have my car back.    -mike[/quote:537b034608]\r\n\r\ndon\'t worry about the badmouthing man, frustration does this and I understand totally.  let me know though if he does screw you, I have the ears of a few mods and enough street cred to make his online microrc life hell, lol...   I got rid of charliebrown/songoku within hours of him joining ausmicro.com , my home turf  :smile: \r\n\r\ncheers mate\r\n\r\nmatt.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (14935, 'cde3cb2e0b', 'Also, no I did not send him money, as he said this would be a christmas gift to me ( you can confirm that ) and also that i do live a half a hour away, but will not be making the trip due to bad weather, and being very busy. -mike');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (14937, 'a3eb11c453', 'i want 1 set of\r\nWT 06 \r\nBBS 5-loch \r\nØ 8.3 mm \r\n\r\nbut i want to send you cash cuz i dont know how the paypal thing works and plus im only 14 and have a b day comin up on march 3rd so i can send the money to you before my bday but dont make any orders un til i am sure i can buy some cuz i dont want you stuck with a set of rims and no money to pay for them or the word to get out and for meto have a bad rep torwards trading and buying things because i couldnt live to my part of the deal\r\n\r\nTHANKS');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (15488, '178f247edb', 'Man You Got Madd Skilz Pimp!\r\n\r\nI\'m diggin dat Goat!\r\n\r\nI just saw today where Geisem posted a finished GTO.  Did he get it from you?  That goat could have a chance  :???: \r\n\r\nNice work Pimp  :cool:');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (15490, '192b754b93', '[quote:192b754b93="ph2t"][quote:192b754b93="crazydave"][quote:192b754b93="ph2t"]hey dude, love the pics of the 1/10 stuff.  cool as mate!\r\n\r\nI had a favour to ask ( yeah another one I know!).  Do yu have any ZZ chassis lying around? I just need the chassis. This would include the steering assembly and rear motor mount as well. I don\'t need the pcb, rear axle or motor(but id you can spare the axle and intermediate gear cog that would be sweet). I wanna do a tri cell monster and I hear you can fit 3 1/3AAA batteries in a zip chassis quite easily. \r\n\r\nIf you have it I\'ll happily pay you via paysluts or if that ain\'t an option I\'m sure we can figure something out!\r\n\r\ncheers mate,\r\n\r\nMatt.[/quote:192b754b93]Well I don\'t have any extra chassis, but I have a couple extra complete Zip Zaps. I might be willing to sell one, as I want to get a Jeep, but don\'t want another Zip Zap, you know what I mean?\r\n\r\ndave[/quote:192b754b93]\r\n\r\nname your price brother.... payment via paypal acceptable?  my past experiece with USPS shows shipping to be approx $5 - $8USD.\r\n\r\ncheers and thanks man.\r\n\r\nmatt.[/quote:192b754b93]Ohh no, you said, "name your price". :roll:\r\n\r\nI\'m terrible with that stuff, so I\'ll just set it up for you.\r\n\r\nIt\'s basically a brand new car, only run twice. The only mod I\'ve done is the paint job. I really hate to ask you for the full 20 it cost, for a slightly used car, but I\'d hate to let it go for too little, since I have put a little work into it, you know what I mean?\r\n\r\nHere it is:\r\n[img:192b754b93]http://s2k-kidz.com/crazycars/zz350.jpg[/img:192b754b93]\r\n\r\nMake an offer, and we\'ll go from there.\r\n\r\nBTW, a tri-cell Zip Zap is totally insane, but I think my dual cell FET modded cars are almost as fast. I\'ve yet to see what would happen with tri-cells, and FETs. Should be fun.  :lol: \r\n\r\nDave');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (14940, 'aab39c13d7', '[quote:aab39c13d7="PimpIke"]ph2t, now i have one more thing to add to the good side. I have confirmed with him that he has paid. (see conversation below, and PM him to double check it ) His mom is expecting a new CC soon (same, see convo below, and PM him to double check it.)\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nMcLaren F1 T3: ok, let me get this straight\r\nMcLaren F1 T3: i need two q\'s answered\r\nMcLaren F1 T3: its that alright?\r\nk          77652: yup\r\nMcLaren F1 T3: Have you sent my 49mhz MS Single Speed chassis yet?\r\nk          77652: yes\r\nMcLaren F1 T3: Ok, thats good\r\nMcLaren F1 T3: and also\r\nMcLaren F1 T3: Have you sent the payment (if your mom got a new CC) And if your mom got a new CC when will you be paying for it, (give me a exact date if can)\r\nk          77652: no i havent paidyet. i have tried tho. when she gets her new cc i wil pay\r\nMcLaren F1 T3: Any word when she is getting her new CC?\r\nk          77652: no\r\nMcLaren F1 T3: expecting it soon though right?\r\nk          77652: yea\r\nMcLaren F1 T3: OK\r\n\r\n\r\nThat is the conversation me and micro had, as obviously, im Mclaren F1 T3 and he is K77652.           Thanks for still hanging on dood. -Mike[/quote:aab39c13d7]\r\n\r\nthat\'s exellent info, hang on to that if you can. try and find out what date he sent your chassis on?  I\'ve had a fair bit of experience now in shipping stuff to/from the US so from the date I should be able to tell you when it could arrive.\r\n\r\ncheers');
