INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (15009, 'e7937368b8', '[quote:e7937368b8="DarkTari"]All the other goodies are your Pimp!  Just to show my appreciation for the favor!  Just send back the chassis if you want the sport body, if not just send that back too.  We take care of our own  8-)[/quote:e7937368b8]Cool, thanks man.  :-) \r\n\r\nI just checked out that motor labeled Perfection 3.0. When did you get that? I\'m asking because I had a perfection 3.0, and it had a white endbell. It was about as fast as the one you sent, but had no torque at all. I ordered that one in May \r\n\r\nI thought the one you sent looked just like a Thunder Charger motor, so I tried a Thunder Charger one first, then when I put the Perfection 3.0 in. It was maybe a tad faster than the Thunder Charger motor, but had a lot more torque. \r\n\r\nDave');
