INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (15981, 'fcaf942f46', 'If you don\'t mind a quick rant, I wanted to go off about some bs that went down at my wife\'s website, to someone that would understand.\r\n\r\n\r\nSo anyways, some bs I could give a shit about went down last week, some chick got all suicidal, and people got all controversial about it, whatever, anyways, my wife is bogged down with phone callls, and IMs, so she tells every she\'s stepping back, and taking a break as administartor for a while, which for my wife, she\'d be lucky if she went a day. Then this stupid bitch, who wasn\'t even a mod, my wife just let her have mod privs to upload some stuff for her, so she decides she\'s gonna take over in my wife\'s abscense. Not only does she start adding, removing, and rearranging the forums, but she changes my wife\'s password. THEN when my wife asked her for the new password, she said, "Why? You said you were quitting." So my wife pulled her password out of the PHP code. Changed everything back, and took that bitches mod priveledges back. That stupid bitch was too ignorant to realize that wife knows every damn line of that freakin\' message board. Which bring me to the point of my rant, who the hell do these people think they are (the other mods were in on it too) trying to take over the website that my wife put so many damn hours into just for them. \r\n\r\nIngrateful bastards...I took it personal, I\'ve made sacrifices for them and their stupid website too. I told my wife, ban her, ban her, ban her. Ban her now, or I\'ll fucking do it for you, but she doesn\'t want to look like the bad guy. I think she needs to set an example, so no one thinks they can walk in and just take what my wife\'s done.\r\n\r\nWhat do you think? (or just smile and nod if ya don\'t think;) )\r\n\r\nDave');
