INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (15065, 'f415d895d2', 'C-Dub,\r\n\r\nHow long are we gonna wait for Hog &amp; KwikbB to vote?\r\n\r\nIs Kwik still participating as an IC Pimp?\r\n\r\nHave you heard from Hog?\r\n\r\nI know he said he would be incommunicado for a bit, probably hangin with\r\nthe BitChick he met recently.  \r\nI see you made the announcement about the prizes, does that mean they\'re ready to go?\r\n\r\nHere\'s the Talley so Far with 5 votes in:\r\n\r\nMiva - 5, 1st place votes\r\nHiroto RX7 - 3, 2nd place votes\r\nSupFly - 3, 3rd place votes\r\nHiroto Sky - 1, 3rd place vote\r\nYagbols - 1, 2nd place vote\r\nHue - 1, 2nd place vote\r\n\r\nWaiting for reply from Cavey &amp; Silla to complete this round');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (15030, '4d62f4ec16', 'here is a little wish list i had going on toyeast... let me know what you have\r\n\r\nis ur collection from toyeast aswell? if so are u including the gifts they gave with each set? motors and such?\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nthe list with item numbers from toyeast and toyeast price listing:\r\n\r\nANC803 - red/black modena set - $7\r\nANC802 - JGTC ZENT Supra w/ white supra - $8.50\r\nANC804 - Blue Calsonic &amp; silver Modena - $7.30\r\nANC1101 - Enzo Ferrari - $20\r\nANM034 - NSX-R - $21.50\r\npullbacks - nsx, sprinter, porsche, z, gtr, murc - $3.50-4.50\r\n\r\n\r\nthey seem quite cheap from toyeast and that is why i was about to order them... I do understand shipping is expensive from them so u cant give them away to me lol\r\n\r\nalso do u have any mods or wheels for sale?');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (15032, 'd9785a3d6d', '[quote:d9785a3d6d="soren"]here is a little wish list i had going on toyeast... let me know what you have\r\n\r\nis ur collection from toyeast aswell? if so are u including the gifts they gave with each set? motors and such?\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nthe list with item numbers from toyeast and toyeast price listing:\r\n\r\nANC803 - red/black modena set - $7\r\nANC802 - JGTC ZENT Supra w/ white supra - $8.50\r\nANC804 - Blue Calsonic &amp; silver Modena - $7.30\r\nANC1101 - Enzo Ferrari - $20\r\nANM034 - NSX-R - $21.50\r\npullbacks - nsx, sprinter, porsche, z, gtr, murc - $3.50-4.50\r\n\r\n\r\nthey seem quite cheap from toyeast and that is why i was about to order them... I do understand shipping is expensive from them so u cant give them away to me lol\r\n\r\nalso do u have any mods or wheels for sale?[/quote:d9785a3d6d]\r\n\r\n\r\nSome of my collection is from toyeast. I ordered from them a while back when these sets first came out. I just needed the pics for reference to see if i have them. I wasnt able to find a few of them some of them at their retail site but later found them at their wholesale site. Do you order from them through wholesale? \r\n\r\nOk, well I\'ll get back to you tomorrow to let you know if I have any of the sets you requested.\r\n\r\nI have some tire sets, gear sets, stabilizer sets etc... if thats what your asking and also some 200mah batteries. Theyre all still new in packaging. I dont have alot of time to mess with these as I used to. Theyre still fun to collect though lol.\r\n\r\nYeah toyeast does charge alot for shipping. Oh yeah forgot to ask where are you located? Shipping shouldnt be too much if youre in the US or Canada. It would be way cheaper than Toyeasts shipping though. Let me know if theres something else you need.\r\n\r\nThanks!');
