INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (15034, 'b60c4e228f', '[quote:b60c4e228f="soren"]sorry about the prices in the last message... i was just informed that i was looking at toyeast.net which are prices in bulk orders. and that toyeast.com is what i should be looking at\r\n\r\nagain sorry[/quote:b60c4e228f]\r\n\r\nHey no problem, I just pmed you when sent me this. I was a little confused but its no biggie. But I will check for you and let you know tomorrow what I have. \r\n\r\nI most likely have all the pullbacks that you listed. I just need to check on the sets.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (19588, 'c2f8244471', '[quote:c2f8244471="crazydave"][quote:c2f8244471="CaboWabo"]I dunno, I sway back and forth so much on what types of music I listen to. I hear ya on the TKK, it\'s not bad at all - maybe I just needed to get baked lol[/quote:c2f8244471]Oh I gotta be baked to listen to music, but then I just gotta be baked. :lol: \r\n\r\n[quote:c2f8244471]I\'m like that with the Frogs set 1, I love the horns and all the shit that seems to be fitting together when it totally shouldn\'t lol[/quote:c2f8244471]I got that DL\'d. Still gotta listen to it. Got side tracked by that Beastie Boys. :lol: \r\n\r\nHey, can\'t find Ministry right now. You into Steve Albini at all? I just ripped Big Black - Songs About Fucking, for hue, I could upload that.\r\n\r\nDave[/quote:c2f8244471]lmao yea upload it, I\'d like to check it out');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (19582, 'a1c719f351', 'not sure if you got my other PM... \r\n\r\nHi, Thanks for your interest. \r\n\r\nI have all six colors of the VW Bus bodies... $3each \r\n\r\nHere\'s my list of stuff for sale: (oh and everything is brand new in box/packaging) \r\n\r\nTomy BCG - 27mhz Black Toyota bB, White Skyline, and Yellow Mitsubishi Lancer. Price is $20ea. \r\n35mhz - skyline history set $25 \r\n35mhz - black celica $20 \r\n45mhz - blue subaru wrx, silver celica $20ea. \r\n57mhz - white subaru wrx, silver s2000 $20ea. \r\n\r\nSBCG Blue Rx7 $25 \r\nRare set- AE86 Trueno Tuneup set $65 \r\n\r\nOK for bodies: They are all $3each \r\n\r\nPerfection VW beetle bodies (in 9 different colors) \r\n\r\nPerfection Ferrari BB512(in different colors) \r\nPerfection Lamborghini LP500S (in different colors) \r\n\r\nPerfection JGTC Bodies - Jomo Skyline, CDMA One Supra, Zent Supra, Esso Ultraflo Supra, Denso Supra. \r\n\r\nCalsonic Skyline bodies (black, white, or blue) \r\nFerrari 360 Modena ( red, yellow, silver, or black) \r\n\r\nI also got a bunch of microsizers body 2-packs - vw beetle, supra, skyline, celica, rx7 etc.... \r\n\r\nPerfection color tire sets $3ea. \r\n\r\nPerfection 3.8 motors $5ea. \r\nPerfection 200mah batteries $3ea. \r\n\r\nI think i have more stuff but this all i could think of at the moment... Feel free to email me at Tinn446158@aol.com for pics etc.... \r\n\r\nOh yeah and free shipping in the USA.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (19541, 'cbe28955c9', 'Hi Matt\r\n\r\nThanks for your reply. I\'m fine with this trade. I\'ve forgotten to mention that the charger from the car isn\'t working. It\'s one of those separate gas station chargers from TE. I usually charge the car in other remotes and it works just fine. Do you want me to send the charger as well? You might try to fix it. I certainly don\'t have the knowledge to do it.\r\nLet me know if you have any problem with this ok? I guess you have some other bit remotes where you can charge the car, so I\'ll guess there will be no problem, but let me know ok? I don\'t want to fool you.\r\n\r\nJust to confirm your address:\r\n\r\nMatt Evink\r\n25085 cr388 \r\ngobles MI 49055\r\nUSA\r\n\r\n\r\nIs it correct? Mine is:\r\n\r\nJose Azevedo\r\nRua Paco 77 cv esq\r\n4405-584 Valadares\r\nVila Nova Gaia\r\nPORTUGAL\r\n\r\n\r\nTomorrow is Portugal Day, our national holiday, so I won\'t be able to ship the items, but I\'ll do it next friday. I\'ll let you know then.\r\nSorry for the long text.\r\n\r\nThanks once again for your help\r\n\r\nJose Azevedo');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (15038, '16107c89fe', '[quote:16107c89fe="crazydave"][quote:16107c89fe="ph2t"]hey man, happy new year!  hope you\'re well and that everything is working out well for you.   even if you do have idiots in your hood shooting rounds into the air!\r\n\r\ncheers,\r\n\r\nmatt.[/quote:16107c89fe]Thanks man. It was kind of a miserable holiday, besides the guns. Me and the wife had to work, but this weekend we\'ll have our own celebration.  :grin: \r\n\r\nYou know, it\'s funny, talking to people around here about the gun fire, and they are completely unfazed, it\'s like it\'s just to be expected. It\'s kinda refreshing to hear from the Aussies, and Canucks, where this would seem out of place. Makes me want to get on up out of here.\r\n\r\nDave[/quote:16107c89fe]\r\n\r\njust be safe man and enjoy that tetrahydracannibanol!\r\n\r\ncheers,\r\n\r\nmatt.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (15039, '16107c89fe', '[quote:16107c89fe="crazydave"][quote:16107c89fe="ph2t"]hey man, happy new year!  hope you\'re well and that everything is working out well for you.   even if you do have idiots in your hood shooting rounds into the air!\r\n\r\ncheers,\r\n\r\nmatt.[/quote:16107c89fe]Thanks man. It was kind of a miserable holiday, besides the guns. Me and the wife had to work, but this weekend we\'ll have our own celebration.  :grin: \r\n\r\nYou know, it\'s funny, talking to people around here about the gun fire, and they are completely unfazed, it\'s like it\'s just to be expected. It\'s kinda refreshing to hear from the Aussies, and Canucks, where this would seem out of place. Makes me want to get on up out of here.\r\n\r\nDave[/quote:16107c89fe]\r\n\r\njust be safe man and enjoy that tetrahydracannibanol!\r\n\r\ncheers,\r\n\r\nmatt.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (15041, 'acba3ff34f', 'First off, I have to tell you, after FETing a few peoples cars, I\'ve seen some of their handy work. Your masking and detailing is by far the crispest, most precise I\'ve seen, including mine\r\n\r\nOk anyways, busy day.\r\n\r\nFirst thing, I noticed the back tab had been cracked and repaired. Well as soon as I put that 4.2 in there it cracked again. I figured, ok I\'ll fix that later, I just need to get the FETs in right now. Then the motor clip tried to rip it right off. So I shaved the motor bay until it no longer spread the tab apart, then I did my little fix it with glueing a thin piece of plastic to the bottom, and shaving the top. \r\n\r\nIt was fixed and it worked fine, but I had put a super glue thumbptint on the side of the chassis. So I sanded it, and painted the chassis, like I do on all my \'customs\', to give the extra touch, and hide my handy work. \r\n\r\nI FET\'ed it, and got it working. It was all finished, and I was ready to take a pic and PM you when that tab broke a again. \r\n\r\nSo this I bent the motor clip back a little so it wouldn\'t press so hard against the tab. Redid it with more glue, thicker plastic, and longer drying time, just to make sure this stuff aint happening to the winner. Gave it some touch up paint...aaand I\'m done.\r\n\r\nThe charcoal didn\'t come out as dark as I would have liked on the wheels, but it gave the spokes a little contrast at least.\r\n\r\n[img:acba3ff34f]http://s2k-kidz.com/crazycars/prizebd.jpg[/img:acba3ff34f]\r\n[img:acba3ff34f]http://s2k-kidz.com/crazycars/prizech.jpg[/img:acba3ff34f]\r\n\r\n\r\nI also have to tell you about that motor. I was agreeing with you that the 4.2 was probably no faster than a 3.8, and it\'s number rating is probably exagerated, but I thought you were beinga little harsh on the Perfection motors. \r\n\r\nWell I totally understand your point of view now. That motor was total dog. That\'s nothing like either my 4.2, or 4.2 Pro. Ironically, dark tari just sent me a Perfection 3.0 that is faster than that motor. I was telling DT about it, and he said he\'s gotton good and bad 4.2s. You got to try this chassis with one of your fast motors, to get a better idea of what the FETs are doing.\r\n\r\nThe car drives great with no body, but with the body on the front wheels kinda hang up on the body. Some pullbacks tires, and this car will be perfect. VDM was supposed to send me some, wonder what happend with that... :???: \r\n\r\nAnyways, all set to go, I\'ll get it back out to you first thing tomorrow.\r\n\r\ndave');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (15042, '85420cf79f', 'Thanks for the kudos man. I\'m a jeweler by trade, and a perfectionist by nature..lol\r\n\r\nIt\'s the big things that get me. :???: \r\n\r\nCar looks great, and the charcoal looks perfect.  The weird thing is all the 4.2s, and the 4.2 pros that I have are like that\r\n\r\nI ran out of pullback tires, that why I had to resort to the stock ones.\r\n\r\nI apologize for all the extra you had to do.  That tab had to be fixed three times here too.lol\r\n\r\nIt was brand new till I put the motor in the bay.\r\n\r\nThanks for everything Dave.  If you need anything, just let me know.\r\n\r\n\r\n-S');
