INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (15811, 'ed055543a5', 'g,day man! ausmicro is back up, post something re your visit. any excuse to get together is a good excuse!\r\n\r\nhttp://www.ausmicro.com/default.asp\r\n\r\nnot a lot of places that i know of, one place that may is called hobby place, in lonsdale st melbourne. there\'s a great electronics shop called jaycar electronics you should visit in abecket st. my local toyshop (i\'m in a suburb of melbourne called camberwell) had 3 compact char g\'s (aus bcg\'s) for $40 aus each, and they had about 20 shen qi wei for $20.\r\n\r\nkeep in touch, trent');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (15262, '0150ec8873', 'dude, I got a great little present in the mail today!   what can I say but FUCKEN WOW!   I love that wrx shell dude, it\'s fucken awesome!!!  :-D \r\n\r\nI\'m hesitant to touch it, it just sits there and I look at it.   My wife walked into the room and said "what the hell are you doing?"  and I said "there\'s this huge-as motherfucka in the states that\'s built like a brick shithouse and he mods these cars as well and this is a custom work of his for trade on some of my electronics work"  and my wife said "you\'re both dickheads......"\r\n\r\nSo there you have it man.  some chick you\'ve never even met who lives on the other side of the world thinks you\'re a dickhead! lol......I guess we\'re in it for the love of everything 1/64 scale RC.\r\n\r\nNow, I\'d also like to thankyou dude for all the other bits and pieces in the pkg, I really do appreciate that!\r\n\r\nThis weekend I\'m going into the city to pickup more fets, my supply just ran out the other day and I\'ve been quite lazy (to tell the truth) to replace them.   \r\n\r\nWhat I\'d like to do to your chassis is several things if I may.  mosfet (obviously!), spring suspension &amp; guitar string antenna.   Let me know if that is OK with you mate.\r\n\r\nCheers,\r\n\r\nMatt (ph2t)');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (15482, '41f2076aa4', '[quote:41f2076aa4="crazydave"][quote:41f2076aa4="ph2t"]hey dude, love the pics of the 1/10 stuff.  cool as mate!\r\n\r\nI had a favour to ask ( yeah another one I know!).  Do yu have any ZZ chassis lying around? I just need the chassis. This would include the steering assembly and rear motor mount as well. I don\'t need the pcb, rear axle or motor(but id you can spare the axle and intermediate gear cog that would be sweet). I wanna do a tri cell monster and I hear you can fit 3 1/3AAA batteries in a zip chassis quite easily. \r\n\r\nIf you have it I\'ll happily pay you via paysluts or if that ain\'t an option I\'m sure we can figure something out!\r\n\r\ncheers mate,\r\n\r\nMatt.[/quote:41f2076aa4]Well I don\'t have any extra chassis, but I have a couple extra complete Zip Zaps. I might be willing to sell one, as I want to get a Jeep, but don\'t want another Zip Zap, you know what I mean?\r\n\r\ndave[/quote:41f2076aa4]\r\n\r\nname your price brother.... payment via paypal acceptable?  my past experiece with USPS shows shipping to be approx $5 - $8USD.\r\n\r\ncheers and thanks man.\r\n\r\nmatt.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (15480, '3aa0de4232', '[quote:3aa0de4232="ph2t"]hey dude, love the pics of the 1/10 stuff.  cool as mate!\r\n\r\nI had a favour to ask ( yeah another one I know!).  Do yu have any ZZ chassis lying around? I just need the chassis. This would include the steering assembly and rear motor mount as well. I don\'t need the pcb, rear axle or motor(but id you can spare the axle and intermediate gear cog that would be sweet). I wanna do a tri cell monster and I hear you can fit 3 1/3AAA batteries in a zip chassis quite easily. \r\n\r\nIf you have it I\'ll happily pay you via paysluts or if that ain\'t an option I\'m sure we can figure something out!\r\n\r\ncheers mate,\r\n\r\nMatt.[/quote:3aa0de4232]Well I don\'t have any extra chassis, but I have a couple extra complete Zip Zaps. I might be willing to sell one, as I want to get a Jeep, but don\'t want another Zip Zap, you know what I mean?\r\n\r\ndave');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (15266, '66d3d3f7e8', 'Cool Man, glad you got the package, I was gonna contact you today to see if you did.  I threw in a few goodies to show my appreciation for the favor. Yeah I was wanting to keep that one myself as with the 3rd place prize in the last contest but I can always make another.  I did try out a new technique with the ground effects to make them look more a part of the car than the others I\'ve done. It came out supurb as you will see when you paint &amp; detail it.  By the way the body is a Mitsubishi Lancer  8-)  ( I make that mistake [b:66d3d3f7e8]everytime[/b:66d3d3f7e8])\r\n\r\nThe other mods you want to add is cool with me except the guitar string, it\'s gotta fit in a case and I don\'t think the guitar string has much flexibility, but if it is, then go 4 it. The spring suspension is cool, I was gonna do that anyways so this will save me a step.  Haven\'t decided what body is going on it but whatever it is, it will be befitting of that badass chassis that\'s for sure.  I thought you would like that Thunder Charger body so you can build a Rally chassis to go with it so I threw it in. You\'re the first down under to have one  :D \r\n\r\nI wanna see one of them in the next where ever it may take place.  Put some nice wheels, slammin paintjob, and one of your patented lighted chassis and it can\'t be beat !  :bowdown: \r\n\r\n[i:66d3d3f7e8]Don\'t take offense to this next comment, it\'s all in fun......[/i:66d3d3f7e8]\r\n\r\nNow about the comment the Wif made, tell her I got her DickHead :screwed:  [b:66d3d3f7e8]LMAO[/b:66d3d3f7e8]\r\n\r\nThanx Again Pimp!');
