INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (15395, '014e527c13', '[quote:014e527c13="DarkTari"]PS,\r\n\r\nI called the Wif at work today to tell her what your Wif said and she cracked up.  I thought the remark was funny as shit too. We both cracked up on the phone.   :eek:  I like a good laugh myself!  My Wif doesn\'t complain at all though, as long as my resposibilities are met, no problem!\r\n\r\nNow stop readin this shit and get your ass into town for more FET\'s   :driving:[/quote:014e527c13]\r\n\r\nI\'ve been good , done the dishes and the washing.  now to play with cars, yeah! (sad)\r\n\r\nand got fets too, yeah baby! (more sad)\r\n\r\nMatt.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (15396, 'e3f7c04435', '[quote:e3f7c04435="DarkTari"]Cool Man, glad you got the package, I was gonna contact you today to see if you did.  I threw in a few goodies to show my appreciation for the favor. Yeah I was wanting to keep that one myself as with the 3rd place prize in the last contest but I can always make another.  I did try out a new technique with the ground effects to make them look more a part of the car than the others I\'ve done. It came out supurb as you will see when you paint &amp; detail it.  By the way the body is a Mitsubishi Lancer  8-)  ( I make that mistake [b:e3f7c04435]everytime[/b:e3f7c04435])\r\n\r\nThe other mods you want to add is cool with me except the guitar string, it\'s gotta fit in a case and I don\'t think the guitar string has much flexibility, but if it is, then go 4 it. The spring suspension is cool, I was gonna do that anyways so this will save me a step.  Haven\'t decided what body is going on it but whatever it is, it will be befitting of that badass chassis that\'s for sure.  I thought you would like that Thunder Charger body so you can build a Rally chassis to go with it so I threw it in. You\'re the first down under to have one  :D \r\n\r\nI wanna see one of them in the next where ever it may take place.  Put some nice wheels, slammin paintjob, and one of your patented lighted chassis and it can\'t be beat !  :bowdown: \r\n\r\n[i:e3f7c04435]Don\'t take offense to this next comment, it\'s all in fun......[/i:e3f7c04435]\r\n\r\nNow about the comment the Wif made, tell her I got her DickHead :screwed:  [b:e3f7c04435]LMAO[/b:e3f7c04435]\r\n\r\nThanx Again Pimp![/quote:e3f7c04435]\r\n\r\nlol, cool dude!  well I\'ll do the fet chassis and spring suspension and I\'ll see what else I can do.  I\'m on a tight schedule and next week I\'m gonna be way busy so I gots to get it all done this week.....\r\n\r\nsorry it\'s taken a while to respond but I\'ve just started a new job and I\'m busy as.   Will endeavour to get the chassis back out to you by the end of the week.\r\n\r\ncheers man.  oh and btw you can\'t offend me, I\'m an Australian!  We give our pets (crocs) our babies for dinner!\r\n\r\ncheers mate,\r\n\r\nMatt.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (15494, '40c4752aba', '[quote:40c4752aba="ph2t"][quote:40c4752aba="crazydave"][quote:40c4752aba="ph2t"][quote:40c4752aba="crazydave"][quote:40c4752aba="ph2t"]hey dude, love the pics of the 1/10 stuff.  cool as mate!\r\n\r\nI had a favour to ask ( yeah another one I know!).  Do yu have any ZZ chassis lying around? I just need the chassis. This would include the steering assembly and rear motor mount as well. I don\'t need the pcb, rear axle or motor(but id you can spare the axle and intermediate gear cog that would be sweet). I wanna do a tri cell monster and I hear you can fit 3 1/3AAA batteries in a zip chassis quite easily. \r\n\r\nIf you have it I\'ll happily pay you via paysluts or if that ain\'t an option I\'m sure we can figure something out!\r\n\r\ncheers mate,\r\n\r\nMatt.[/quote:40c4752aba]Well I don\'t have any extra chassis, but I have a couple extra complete Zip Zaps. I might be willing to sell one, as I want to get a Jeep, but don\'t want another Zip Zap, you know what I mean?\r\n\r\ndave[/quote:40c4752aba]\r\n\r\nname your price brother.... payment via paypal acceptable?  my past experiece with USPS shows shipping to be approx $5 - $8USD.\r\n\r\ncheers and thanks man.\r\n\r\nmatt.[/quote:40c4752aba]Ohh no, you said, "name your price". :roll:\r\n\r\nI\'m terrible with that stuff, so I\'ll just set it up for you.\r\n\r\nIt\'s basically a brand new car, only run twice. The only mod I\'ve done is the paint job. I really hate to ask you for the full 20 it cost, for a slightly used car, but I\'d hate to let it go for too little, since I have put a little work into it, you know what I mean?\r\n\r\nHere it is:\r\n[img:40c4752aba]http://s2k-kidz.com/crazycars/zz350.jpg[/img:40c4752aba]\r\n\r\nMake an offer, and we\'ll go from there.\r\n\r\nBTW, a tri-cell Zip Zap is totally insane, but I think my dual cell FET modded cars are almost as fast. I\'ve yet to see what would happen with tri-cells, and FETs. Should be fun.  :lol: \r\n\r\nDave[/quote:40c4752aba]\r\n\r\n$25 USD shipped.  How does that sound?   You can keep the shell if you want and just send me a regular shell.  How does that sound dude?\r\nI like the shell, don\'t get me wrong.  I hope I\'m not sounding disrespectfull.\r\n\r\nI want to doa tricell witha booster pcb.  hence the want for a longer chassis.\r\n\r\nlet me know if this price is OK with you man.\r\n\r\nthanks again brother,\r\n\r\nmatt.[/quote:40c4752aba]25 bucks shipped sounds like a deal. You can paypal me at davesmoejoe@yahoo.com. Friday and Saturady are busy days at work, so it will go out first thing Monday morning. Just get me the address before then.\r\n\r\nI want to keep the body, because honestly I wouldn\'t want you to judge the quality of my work by this paint job, it\'s not my best work.\r\n\r\nThese are the only 2 that are not cracked, or being currently used, so take your pick. I\'ll also throw in some muscle car hubcaps, because I have a bunch.\r\n\r\n[img:40c4752aba]http://s2k-kidz.com/crazycars/zzbodies.jpg[/img:40c4752aba]\r\n\r\nCool?\r\n\r\n**Edit: Oh yeah, it has the stock 12:1 gears in it, and the Zip Zap 2.8 motor\r\nDave');
