INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (15439, '14850b6c0a', 'Well CB can be a bit over the top sometimes, I remember when I started posting in the ZZ forum at MRCC he did seem a bit of pain but he told me he didn\'t mean to and he has turned out to be quite a cool guy, not to mention he\'s one of the founders of wegotu.\r\n\r\nThere are several reasons for us leaving MRCC, of course the ip banns kind of pushed out  :-D .  OTP was told to leave because MK thought he would be a distraction to the forum because OTP still likes epochs,  CB called MK an ass in the BA forum where MK\'s rules says there are no rules, not to mention MK was being an ass.  Todd was banned for not working a deal with MK\'s estore, kamen was banned for talking about OTP being banned, cheese stepped down and was later banned, gfunk was told to leave because his opinions did not match MK\'s about OTP being banned, meandmelude was banned for pointing out how MK was altering all the posts to make himself look good, and I was banned because I posted wegotu in my final message and I did that because I was demodded without warning and he never replied to my emails. The same thing happened to steelwoolghandi.\r\n\r\nAlot of people have been ip banned but not deactivated for being members at wegotu, that way people think they just dont come there anymore.\r\n\r\nWe started a yahoo group when we started getting banned, we think MK was running a key logger and got into our yahoo group, which would explain why me and SWG were demodded without notice.\r\n\r\nWell that seems long but its actually the short version :eek: \r\n\r\n\r\nas far as the wegotu ads, shhhhh thats secret.\r\n\r\nI figure if MK is going to tell us that our contributions mean nothing to the forum and then ip bann us but keep our work on display then he\'ll advertise for me, and if he doesn\'t like it he can delete em.\r\n\r\nAs you can tell we dont have much of a bit section, and arn\'t really planning one unless traffic gets out of control, so if any of your bit pimps want to discuss bigger rc\'s or just post links back to bit pimp images or vice versa there more than welcome.\r\n\r\nlater man');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (15975, 'baab38747e', '[quote:baab38747e="TMP"]hey man, i read in the new flossin in da city thread that you have some bodies? how much do you wanna pawn off a bunch of em for? thanks[/quote:baab38747e]\r\n\r\ndude, check out my current for sale thread here:\r\n\r\nhttp://www.ausmicro.com/topic.asp?TOPIC_ID=1738&amp;FORUM_ID=4&amp;CAT_ID=2&amp;Topic_Title=Shells+and+Gearsets+sale%2E%2E%2E%2E%21&amp;Forum_Title=BCG+%2D+For+Sale+%7C+Wanted+%7C+Trading\r\n\r\nsee what you like and we could make a deal....payment would be via paypal only, unless you could trade a 49mhz MS pro booster for a shitload of shells/parts...\r\n\r\ncheers,\r\n\r\nph2t.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (15441, 'b8f9482404', 'Hey Pimp,  \r\n\r\nWhat kinda springs are you using?  I got some from RCMod a while back but they need to be cut.  I heard the Tyco HO slotcar springs can be used also. Do the one\'s you use fit with no modifications or do you have to cut them?  Can you front me a few pairs if you have them to spare  :-? \r\n\r\nIf not them get yo azz back to town and pick me up some, I\'ll send the $$$\r\n\r\nThanx Pimp!');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (16050, 'f8a5bfaf88', '[quote:f8a5bfaf88="cj"][quote:f8a5bfaf88="ph2t"][quote:f8a5bfaf88="cj"]Can you do a fet mod to a ZipZap Se?  The reason I ask is I\'d like to put a prize in a New Starsky &amp; Hutch Zip Zap SE Toreno and if you could fet mod it and add alternateing lights to to like the real car that could be 1 bad pirze.  What you think?[/quote:f8a5bfaf88]\r\n\r\nhey cj, yes mate I can fet mod a zz se.  not the way microamps reportedly does it but the way listed in the wierd sciec=nce thread that bares it\'s name.  There is still a performance increase, yes.\r\n\r\nwhat do you mean by alternating lights? flashing ones? yes I can do that? what colour would they be dude?\r\n\r\ncheers,\r\nph2t.[/quote:f8a5bfaf88]\r\n\r\nLike this.\r\n[img:f8a5bfaf88]http://starskytorino.com/gohome.gif[/img:f8a5bfaf88]\r\n\r\nSo if you think you can do it I\'ll need your address to send you a car as the prize for the new contest.[/quote:f8a5bfaf88]\r\n\r\nI\'m happy to do it man but a few things....\r\n\r\nHave you spoken to superfly about this?  Fly, hue and myslef are organising a current set of prizes as well, you might wanna touch base with him man..\r\n\r\nSo to confirm, it is one flashing red light on top, two yellow flashing lights in the front grill?\r\n\r\ncheers dude,\r\n\r\nph2t.');
