INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (15967, 'd2acaab3ab', 'What\'s up Matt..... Long time no race...lol  How\'s it going ?\r\n\r\nThis weather is killing me over here.   Still interested in coming by, and racing a bit?\r\n\r\nThat\'d be really cool man. I still have that Beetle body for you.    You can call me, or PM me and let me know.. 727-906-3343\r\n\r\nI think I\'m off till Fri.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n-Steve');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (15968, '039a3d4c0c', 'Ok dude, you gots a pile cars on the way.\r\n\r\nThere are 8 cars total. I believe them all to be FET modded, except the Nakamichi. The Thunder Charger has some alloys mounted. I still got the Zip Zap and Micro Speed that I need to put alloys on.\r\n\r\nSo ya better be getting that track ready.  :lol: \r\n\r\ndave');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (15503, 'e316f39e19', '[quote:e316f39e19="crazydave"][quote:e316f39e19="ph2t"][quote:e316f39e19="crazydave"][quote:e316f39e19="ph2t"][quote:e316f39e19="crazydave"][quote:e316f39e19="ph2t"]hey dude, love the pics of the 1/10 stuff.  cool as mate!\r\n\r\nI had a favour to ask ( yeah another one I know!).  Do yu have any ZZ chassis lying around? I just need the chassis. This would include the steering assembly and rear motor mount as well. I don\'t need the pcb, rear axle or motor(but id you can spare the axle and intermediate gear cog that would be sweet). I wanna do a tri cell monster and I hear you can fit 3 1/3AAA batteries in a zip chassis quite easily. \r\n\r\nIf you have it I\'ll happily pay you via paysluts or if that ain\'t an option I\'m sure we can figure something out!\r\n\r\ncheers mate,\r\n\r\nMatt.[/quote:e316f39e19]Well I don\'t have any extra chassis, but I have a couple extra complete Zip Zaps. I might be willing to sell one, as I want to get a Jeep, but don\'t want another Zip Zap, you know what I mean?\r\n\r\ndave[/quote:e316f39e19]\r\n\r\nname your price brother.... payment via paypal acceptable?  my past experiece with USPS shows shipping to be approx $5 - $8USD.\r\n\r\ncheers and thanks man.\r\n\r\nmatt.[/quote:e316f39e19]Ohh no, you said, "name your price". :roll:\r\n\r\nI\'m terrible with that stuff, so I\'ll just set it up for you.\r\n\r\nIt\'s basically a brand new car, only run twice. The only mod I\'ve done is the paint job. I really hate to ask you for the full 20 it cost, for a slightly used car, but I\'d hate to let it go for too little, since I have put a little work into it, you know what I mean?\r\n\r\nHere it is:\r\n[img:e316f39e19]http://s2k-kidz.com/crazycars/zz350.jpg[/img:e316f39e19]\r\n\r\nMake an offer, and we\'ll go from there.\r\n\r\nBTW, a tri-cell Zip Zap is totally insane, but I think my dual cell FET modded cars are almost as fast. I\'ve yet to see what would happen with tri-cells, and FETs. Should be fun.  :lol: \r\n\r\nDave[/quote:e316f39e19]\r\n\r\n$25 USD shipped.  How does that sound?   You can keep the shell if you want and just send me a regular shell.  How does that sound dude?\r\nI like the shell, don\'t get me wrong.  I hope I\'m not sounding disrespectfull.\r\n\r\nI want to doa tricell witha booster pcb.  hence the want for a longer chassis.\r\n\r\nlet me know if this price is OK with you man.\r\n\r\nthanks again brother,\r\n\r\nmatt.[/quote:e316f39e19]25 bucks shipped sounds like a deal. You can paypal me at davesmoejoe@yahoo.com. Friday and Saturady are busy days at work, so it will go out first thing Monday morning. Just get me the address before then.\r\n\r\nI want to keep the body, because honestly I wouldn\'t want you to judge the quality of my work by this paint job, it\'s not my best work.\r\n\r\nThese are the only 2 that are not cracked, or being currently used, so take your pick. I\'ll also throw in some muscle car hubcaps, because I have a bunch.\r\n\r\n[img:e316f39e19]http://s2k-kidz.com/crazycars/zzbodies.jpg[/img:e316f39e19]\r\n\r\nCool?\r\n\r\n**Edit: Oh yeah, it has the stock 12:1 gears in it, and the Zip Zap 2.8 motor\r\nDave[/quote:e316f39e19]\r\n\r\nCool man.  I \'ll take the purple shell.   HEre\'s my addy:\r\n\r\nMatt Marcos\r\n17 Adrian Street\r\nBENTLEIGH EAST   VIC   3165\r\nAUSTRALIA\r\n\r\nI\'ll paypal you whenI get home from work tonight.\r\n\r\nCheers mate, it\'s a pleasure doing business with you.   And your shell, well hell homie that shell is great and my best work isn\'t an ink near yours yet.  Also, thanks for taking photos.  It\'s that level of professionalism that set the pimps apart from the pukes!\r\n\r\nMatt');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (15504, 'a90004a881', 'Cool, sounds like we\'re all set to go.\r\n\r\nI\'ll tell you why I don\'t like that paint job. I laid the silver too heavy, and it left a lip. Usually I might rub it down really good, or sand lightly, but I brain farted, and just bitched about it instead. Then when I clear coated it gave it more of a 3d effect. I like my paint jobs to be perfectly smooth and level, so if you ever see one of my jobs in person, that\'s the way I want you to see it, not this. ;)\r\n\r\nDave');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (15505, '8021926ff6', 'Nah , he didn\'t get it from me .  Is that the body that you want ?/');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (15506, 'a379f63c23', 'That\'ll work !\r\n\r\nThanx Pimp!');
