INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (16850, 'f9dc650bbb', 'Hey whats up man, I just thought I\'d give you the heads up.  I just purchased a Domain and some hosting and it came with a forum, so are you ready for a new forum.  :smile:.  Wegotu is nice and all but its not what I was expecting but I wont go there or bore you with the details.\r\n\r\nI just want you to know there will be a new forum, at the moment I am trying to get the founders of wegotu on board with the idea, no response yet.  I\'d like to be an affliate of theres or at least stay friends.  They seem to want to run off newbs and just keep a small core audience, I figure my site will handle the newbs and whoever else.\r\n\r\nWell I just wanted to let you know it\'s coming and I\'m going to do everything I can to avoid a forum war, but of course bitpimps are welcome and I would like to include a link to the bitpimps in my 1/64th areas if that is okay with you all.  All I ask is if you get any people asking about epochs or z\'s send them my way.  I figure my 1/64th area will handle any of the newb questions and they can swing over here and take a look at what the pros are doing.\r\n\r\nYou all can wait and see how my forum turns out before you go and make any decisions, but links back to bitpimps or your galleries are okay with me.\r\n\r\nI\'ll shoot you a link when it is up.\r\n\r\nLater\r\nripper7777777');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (15943, 'dc32695f85', 'i do have a bunch of Precious clones, sealed and completly unused, hot off the factory, so whats the deal.. what would you give me for one of those? you can have your choice of what kind of car if you like, i seem to have everything except the S2000 and the Bb. but really hows this work, i send you something, and then when you recieve it you send me something?');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (15944, '0ac5a368b3', 'This is how we can do it. We send items at same time and we have to trust each other. I have done this with some other trades and everything worked out fine.\r\n\r\nCan you get me two of those clones? If you can get me the accord wagon and also the nissan gloria I would be really happy.\r\n\r\n[img:0ac5a368b3]http://www.eit.ihk-edu.dk/2788/biler/35blasolv.jpg[/img:0ac5a368b3]\r\n\r\n[img:0ac5a368b3]http://www.eit.ihk-edu.dk/2788/biler/57hvidgron.jpg[/img:0ac5a368b3]\r\n\r\nI can send you the following items for those two clones:\r\n\r\nclear skyline r34\r\nclear skyline r34 (like the pullback version)\r\nclear celica\r\nclear beetle\r\nclear supra\r\nrx-7 AM blue\r\nnsx-r (complete pullback)\r\n\r\nDo you agree this way? Let me know ok?\r\n\r\n\r\nCheers\r\n\r\nmekinhux');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (15629, 'a6178b759d', 'I got a weird Q for ya...   \r\n\r\nSince you know about the green scene in Holland.  What\'s an average price per gram of some dank herb?\r\n\r\nI\'d like to shut my know it all neighbor up.\r\n\r\nHe\'s the "Cliff Claven" type that just bullshits about everything..\r\n\r\nHe\'s telling me he can get the best for $3 a gram, and my friends that live there can\'t even get it that cheap.\r\n\r\nAnd he doesn\'t buy bulk.\r\n\r\nI don\'t even think he\'s ever been there.  I hate liars....\r\n\r\n\r\nthanks man.. Sorry for the weirdness....lol\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n-Steve');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (15630, '85816d7b7b', 'Actually he isn\'t all that off...  It\'s more like $5 for approx 3 joints (sorry they use metric so that\'s the best I could translate it for ya)  And we are talking about average shiat there.  It is cheap kina, but the government taxes the hell outta it like we do Ciggs.  Hope that helps.\r\nJesse');
