INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (15891, '77a42f3315', 'try this again, I sent you a PM, but it didn\'t seem to go through...\r\n\r\n[quote:77a42f3315="DarkTari"]Cabo,\r\nExplain or give syntax for saving the old FTP pics into the new form.\r\n\r\nThanx![/quote:77a42f3315]sure thing man...\r\ngo here:\r\nhttp://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/index.php\r\n\r\nlogin with your username and password, once you do - next to the "Logout [DarkTari]" link at the top will be a "Upload picture" link - click that.\r\n\r\nyou be presented with an upload screen to upload your image into your own Album. Once you upload your image - it will be in the "bitPimps Crew Galleries" as crazydave\'s and mine are.\r\n\r\nnow that the image is in your gallery, right click it and choose "Properties" - this will give you the URL to the image you just uploaded.\r\n\r\nUse that URL in place of your old image URLs.\r\nOnce you replace your old image URLs with the new URL from your Album, you can delete your old image (keeping the new you just uploaded in your album)\r\n\r\ndoes that make sense?');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (15672, '6253ee1681', '[quote:6253ee1681="CaboWabo"]dude, I don\'t know why or how, but it slipped my mind before and it just entered my mind today...\r\n\r\nI forgot I told you I would cover your shipping costs for doing the mod on the contest prize.\r\n\r\ndude - I\'m totally sorry - I swear I just completely forgot, I\'d be happy to pay you for what you\'ve done - you\'ve done alot now and in the past and I know there\'s more to come from you.\r\nI don\'t want to take advantage of our good members - just please know I just forgot about it man - I didn\'t stiff ya.\r\n\r\nlet me know how much you want - I don\'t care if round it up or whatever, just let me know what you want.\r\n\r\nalso... since I was such a shit and forgot what I owed you - what you rightly deserved.... what do you want more - 1st gen zz or 1st gen tomy (poss. off freq.)?\r\nand what body/ies? want zz or bit bodies more?\r\nand send me your shipping address again - I think the last one I mailed to I sent to your old address[/quote:6253ee1681]You forgot the shipping?!! :eek: \r\n\r\nThat\'s it, I get your first born, and your pinkie.  :lol: \r\n\r\nActually, here\'s the story from my point of view. I had seen in the moderator\'s forum where DT told you guys, don\'t worry about it he\'s got me covered, and I thought, well if he\'s covering me for both his and the contests mods, then it must be something pretty cool. I was all excited to get his package, what I got was a Beetle body set, a cracked bB body, the Celica with the messed up paint job I had to fix, a Perfection 3.0, a Tomy 3.0, and 3 bucks to cover shipping. I was disappointed at first, but then the motors are pretty fast with FETs, and I had a lot of fun modding the bodies. So I figured that\'s cool for a couple FETmods I suppose.\r\n\r\nSo anyways, I thought I was covered...but if you think I deserve more I could use another chassis. :???: \r\n\r\nI have to figure out what I need more...I sold a Zip Zap to ph2t, with the intention of taking the money to RS and getting me one of them Wranglers, but I bought a sack with the money instead. I\'m like that sometimes, it was easier. :lol: \r\n\r\nThen on the hand I only have 3 spare ZZ bodies left, cause those things crack too damn easy, and I have piles of unused bit bodies. \r\n\r\nI don\'t know, I\'m not too worried about it, I\'ll get back to you, or you can decide.\r\n\r\n\r\nHey, about my domain. I was using a lame wannabe who-is, my wife informed me that I was supposed to go to truewho-is.com. At any rate, crazybydesign.com wasn\'t actually available, so I\'m crazybydesign.net...I\'m kinda disapointed, something about that .net that seems kinda second rate, I don\'t know.\r\n\r\nSo anyways, that\'s no big deal, it\'s just with me and my wife working opposite schedules lately, it\'s hard to communicate, and I don\'t even know where the hell to find my c-panel right now, but I am going to set you up an ftp account, so I\'ll let you know when I get that going.\r\n\r\nDave');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (15930, 'e6040a52f6', 'trade huh? what are you looking for, or what type of stuff?');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (15931, 'd4b46cedf7', 'Hi. I am interested in all sort of stuff, as long as their all brand new (motors, batteries, tires, even a really cheap clone...). It\'s up to you. Let me know what you think and what you are willing to trade and maybe we can make a deal. If have something for trade that is worth more than my 5 bodies I can add more two bodies (nsx-r black &amp; yellow and rx-7 automodellista blue). All bodies are new. No scratchs, nothing broken...\r\n\r\nI only suggested a trade, because this way you pay shipping costs to me and I pay shipping costs to you and no money is involved. Let me know what you think ok?\r\n\r\nmekinhux');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (15932, 'a60aa89075', '[quote:a60aa89075="crazydave"][quote:a60aa89075="CaboWabo"]cool - he\'s a good source of killer images, I appreciate all your help and responses man :-)[/quote:a60aa89075]No prob. I think the Gallery is a cool thing, and I appreciate you taking the time to set it up.\r\n\r\nDT said he\'s just been really busy, but he\'d try to get to it this weekend.\r\n\r\nCome to think of it, I seem to recall him posting around the boards how busy he\'s been.\r\n\r\ndave[/quote:a60aa89075]yea I\'m sure alot of the pimps are busy - I\'m just an impatient prick sometimes lol');
