INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (15934, 'fdbc2c6df7', '[quote:fdbc2c6df7="filelicker"]hello, i was wondering how you deal with the steering wires on a lengthened chassis.\r\nany help is appreciated \r\n :???:[/quote:fdbc2c6df7]Every chassis I\'ve stretched has been a Thunder Charger chassis, which for some odd reason have incredibly long leads on the steering coils. I actually end up cutting them down, so there not some much tangle...So it never even occured to me there would be an issue lengthening steering wire on some chassis.\r\n\r\ndave');
