INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (16324, '6df0d4e0c0', '[quote:6df0d4e0c0="CaboWabo"]to be perfectly honest - you have every right in the world to post whatever you want about your SE fet mod.\r\n\r\nit\'s like anything with these little cars - most all of it has been done at one time or another - there\'s nothing wrong with writing something up yourself.[/quote:6df0d4e0c0]Yeah see, either he gives permission, and gets credit for his mod, or he says no, and don\'t get credit.\r\n\r\nHe\'s a smart guy, and played along.\r\n\r\nNow he gets credit for the mod, and micro_amps gets credit for doing something but no one know what. See how that works. ;)\r\n\r\nI love it when a plan comes together.  :lol: \r\n\r\n[quote:6df0d4e0c0]many times people write how they talk to themselves, which is hard for others to understand...\r\nI\'ve seen at least 5 different tutorials on dual cells, each has their own pro\'s and con\'s in the writing.... get where I\'m coming from?[/quote:6df0d4e0c0]Is that the way it works? I thought those guys that wrote tutorials I didn\'t understand were dumbasses.  :???: \r\n\r\nI guess I\'m gonna have to rethink that point of view.  :lol: \r\n\r\ndave');
