INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (16682, 'c88aacd031', '[quote:c88aacd031="Havok"]yup, I\'m back on the night gig with more pay and full benefits...lovin\' it....no :smoking: during the day shift...too many nosey assholes...I\'m glad to be back....and workin on my track :grin:........unfortunately, and maybe fortunately...my marriage is failing and I\'m probably moving out soon......its a mutual, amicable break-up, so I guess thats cool....but hey, at least now I\'ll be able to take off and visit the STL whenever I want :cool:\r\nI think we should both go to phoenix and see cwazey davey soon too...I got the ride and gas....you just bring some grass  8-) \r\n\r\n[b:c88aacd031]Say Word![/b:c88aacd031][/quote:c88aacd031]dude, sorry to hear about you and the wife.\r\ntouchy subject sometimes for people so I don\'t wanna say much about it other than I wish you all the best - for real.\r\n\r\nthe job part sounds kick ass, you just keep getting raises and better work environments - bastard! lol\r\n\r\ngoin to see davey would be the shit man.\r\nwe gotta get some of the pimps together and hook up somewhere.\r\nbetween us, it\'d be party like rock stars time lol');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (15876, '7a5f1c80fd', 'g\'day kent! :-)  ok, whatever car you send is cool. send the hummer chassis if you want and i\'ll have a go at it. i\'ve actually got a new one here that i don\'t use if you\'re interested. so just to confirm:\r\n\r\nfull rear suspension mod,\r\noffroad wheelset,\r\ndual cell installation    $35 us shipped.\r\n\r\ni forgot if you wanted front springs. if so i have to buy them off ph2t, so add $3 us.\r\n\r\nus cash in the box is cool with me, i don\'t have paypal. send it using some sort of registered post so if it gets lost/damaged in transit we can find out where. my address is\r\n\r\nbetty.k\r\n39 currajong avenue\r\ncamberwell, victoria\r\n3124\r\nAUSTRALIA\r\n\r\nlemme know when you post it so i can keep an eye out for it. here\'s my email:\r\n\r\nbetty.k@telstra.com\r\n\r\ntalk soon, trent :-)');
