INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (15818, '4616b33ba0', 'I\'ve been eyeing your suspension mod for the last week or so.  Great work.  If I ever get off my duff I may just have to give it a go.  \r\n\r\nI\'m still new to the whole online bit thing, but managed to find this in my travels http://members.surfeu.de/cyberjunky/buggy.html  \r\nSeen it before?  I\'m digging that front suspension. \r\n\r\nWe do alot of racing but unfortunately because some of the guys are not that skilled we keep things pretty stock.  There are a small number of us looking to break out of this stock racing rut and run something a little more modified.   \r\n\r\nThe closest thing to a \'mod\' we allow is the gears I\'ve been resin casting.  It was easier (and cheaper) for me to cast gears for use on some of our bits than it was to have everyone go out and buy up Tomy gear sets.  I\'ve found them handy when I want to build up rear axles as well. :o)   I\'m currently working on a few resin bodies as well as replacement steering knuckles (resin body with stainless steel pins).  \r\n\r\nNot quite the performance mod\'s I\'ve seen online (fets, etc) but cool nonetheless.');
