INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (15834, '6552eac268', '[quote:6552eac268="CaboWabo"][quote:6552eac268="crazydave"]Well my wife is incapable of giving a simple answer, so to the best of my understanding it is crazybydesign.net/bitbimps for now, until the sub-domain resolves in a couple days then it will be bitpimps.crazybydesign.net.\r\n\r\nDon\'t know if we can use PHP yet, my wife has just done basic html stuff with her free account, and I haven\'t had a chance to try yet, so I guess check it out and let us know.  :lol: \r\n\r\nDave[/quote:6552eac268]your wife too? lol\r\n\r\nI wonder which package you got? Home?\r\nhttp://order.1and1.com/xml/order/HostingChart;jsessionid=71D0EB05B261B7372F1D85E5F7ABF8BC.TC61a?__frame=_top[/quote:6552eac268]Yep that appears to be the package I have. Dammit I\'m kinda annoyed, No SQL database support. \r\n\r\nOne of the major huge reasons why I was excited to get my own domain, is because I\'ve been wanting to play with some of the message board software and other PHP things to catch up on what my wife\'s been learning over the last couple years.\r\n\r\nNow i guess I\'ll just store pictures on it. :roll:');
