INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (15908, 'e32944a09c', '[quote:e32944a09c="SuperFly"]I was talking to hue35 about seeing if you might be willing to put up exactly that as a prize. Thanks for asking. Hiroto originally said he\'d do something, but I haven\'t seen him for a while.\r\n\r\nI was planning on doing a mosfetted, tab-lowered chassis under a custom-painted Supra body, maybe throw in a Perfection 3.8 motor. I think hue35 was going to do something similar with a 350Z body.\r\n\r\nSo, yeah, can you put up a prize? I think one of your light sets would be pretty cool, but I think they are worthy of being a stand-alone prize rather than adding them to one of the other prizes. I\'ve got shitloads of extra bodies of just about every kind. Maybe hue and I could use your springs in our lowered chassis, and I could put one of your light sets in a custom-painted shell and that would be a prize in itself.\r\n\r\nI\'m totally open to other ideas though, any thoughts?[/quote:e32944a09c]\r\n\r\nThat sounds pretty cool man.  What I could do is make a light kit that has front headlights (white) and also rear lights (red).  I will leave some slack in the wires so it\'s easily adaptable for any shell.   I can make some spring sets as well and possibly a guitar string antenna or two?  they realy help on getting the most range out of your bit....\r\n\r\nlet me know dude and I\'ll start making them this week and ship off to you the week after......\r\n\r\nare either yourself or hue on msn?\r\n\r\ncheers,\r\n\r\nmatt.');
