INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (15882, 'da8736bcea', '[quote:da8736bcea="crazydave"]Hmmm, well that could be, but if everyone would just get their galleries together, that section could be the major draw of the gallery. \r\n\r\nIt could also be making time for it. I\'ve been meaning to put together a couple galleries, but hadn\'t got to it until now. \r\n\r\nAnd you know also it takes a bit longer to upload the pics one by one. I\'m used to dragging the whole big chunk over in the FTP, but I think once they\'ve gotton all settled in, it should be convenient enough when just uploading a couple pics of the current ride.\r\n\r\nDave[/quote:da8736bcea]I hear ya man, that\'s why I was kinda on the pimps to get their galleries going, I really thought it could be a big draw, but after what seemed like dis-interest, I just didn\'t know.\r\n\r\nand then when you put up your galleries, it occurred to me that maybe they\'d prefer their pics in the custom modifications gallery... I just didn\'t know...\r\n\r\nbut I think you\'re right about putting pics in one by one, I was hoping if I offered to help (I could upload and input their in one swoop) - but I guess either they\'ll get to it, or ask, or not lol\r\n\r\nwish I woulda got that in place from the get go - ah well');
