INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (15850, 'cac5fcbb2c', '[quote:cac5fcbb2c="CaboWabo"][quote:cac5fcbb2c="crazydave"]Yep that appears to be the package I have. Dammit I\'m kinda annoyed, No SQL database support. \r\n\r\nOne of the major huge reasons why I was excited to get my own domain, is because I\'ve been wanting to play with some of the message board software and other PHP things to catch up on what my wife\'s been learning over the last couple years.\r\n\r\nNow i guess I\'ll just store pictures on it. :roll:[/quote:cac5fcbb2c]I know what you mean, I\'ve done the same thing in the past...\r\ndon\'t let it bother you too much, you\'ll still get a lot of use out of it and there\'s other things to play around with.\r\nor you know, you did just get it, you could upgrade your package if you were really that disappointed.[/quote:cac5fcbb2c]Yeah, i think i am going to upgrade my package...I hate having second rate shit.  :lol: \r\n\r\n[quote:cac5fcbb2c]thanks for the hook up bro :-) [/quote:cac5fcbb2c]No prob, like I said, I doubt I\'ll ever use that much space on my own.\r\n\r\n\r\n[quote:cac5fcbb2c]oh by the way, your package is ready to ship off, my wife was supposed to take it with her today and ship it for me but she forgot, I\'ll get it out tomorrow or monday at the latest.[/quote:cac5fcbb2c]That\'s cool, thanks man.  :-) \r\n\r\nFunny, my wife always forgets to take my stuff with her to ship too. :???: \r\n\r\ndave');
