INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (16308, '22b86b46ff', 'No worries man, my address...\r\n\r\nMat Mathey\r\n3104 SE 39th Avenue\r\nPortland, OR  97202\r\n\r\nThat\'s cool on the comp... that kind of thing should just happen when it happens. I was gonna dupe a couple of Sham69 comps I have, but didn\'t get the time... I\'ll send those eventually, if your interested. I like the idea of an ongoing disc exchange... every now and then a new disc pops up in the mail... sweet!\r\n\r\n[quote:22b86b46ff="crazydave"]Double BTW, I\'ve been meaning to ask you...are you a that Borg, Hue, that brought down the Borg collective by having a unique opinion? I been wondering about that for a while?[/quote:22b86b46ff]\r\n\r\nNope... I didn\'t know about that Hue. I dig Star Trek, but I couldn\'t tell you a lick of trivia.\r\n\r\nThe hue35 name is a hodge podge of stuff... as a teen, I used to sign up for things, like the record club or Petitions, under the name Hugh Jorgan (Huge Organ). Occasionally, I would rope someone in to be my brother, Lar Jorgan (Large Organ) for double the fun. Anyway, when SuperFly and I used to go to the arcade,  10-11 years ago, my screen name was \'hue\', based on Hugh Jorgan... I liked the \'hue\' spelling and meaning in the video game context better. My dad raced Vettes when I was a kid, and his number was 35... so that\'s that. (more than you wanted to know!)');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (16309, '1b215d1b12', '[quote:1b215d1b12="crazydave"][quote:1b215d1b12="CaboWabo"][quote:1b215d1b12="crazydave"]Whatever, it works good enough, I\'m just curious if this the same mod micro_amps does.\r\n\r\nDave[/quote:1b215d1b12]payaso can tell us, he\'s got a fet se from MA[/quote:1b215d1b12]Alright, bring Payaso on. You tell him, if he ever wants to come on down here, I will have his SE pink slip.  :lol: \r\n\r\nAfter further experimenting, I have determined, this is it, CZ has definately cracked this nut.\r\n\r\nIt\'s funny because we know he didn\'t have the mod nailed when ph2t called hime out for selling it, and he seemed like a pompous ass when he first showed up here. Then he turned out to be the pimp that shared his info with us. So now I appreciate him, but I still think he\'s a pompous ass. \r\n\r\nI really believe between ph2t calling him out, and this post from hue...\r\n[quote:1b215d1b12]Hell, dude... sounds like you got it nailed from all directions. How about doin\' it for reals, then postin\' up a tutorial with pictures and diagrams. That way idiots like me can make an SE worth having, and you get to be an actual, true-to-life smarty pants and get mad respect from da hood. \r\n\r\nOr, you can just keep throwing out your hypotheses (which I barely understand a word of) and "taunt the halfwits" with your brilliance and stuff. \r\n\r\nPersonally, I think you should do the tutorial. [/quote:1b215d1b12]...that we sent him on a mission to prove himself, which is what I think is funny.\r\n\r\nThough it is true he posted his info at TRC, and just rubbed in hs vids over here. I wouldn\'t make a tut on his mod without his permission, but I don\'t see any reason I can\'t take pic of what I\'ve done to my PCB. ;)\r\n\r\nMaybe since this seems to be an ego issue with him, he might be honored if we offered to host up a tut, giving him all the credit and accolades. ;)\r\n\r\nAnyways, this made my weekend, but I suddenly need a bunch of money, gotta restock on FETs, gotta gotta, absolutely have got to get that SE Chevelle... :-D \r\n\r\nDave\r\n\r\n\r\nEDIT: I just wanted to add that I appreciate CZ approach to this, because micro_amps straight out said my FET mod was wrong and his was right, stripping me of the honor of having the first FET modded SE, but CZ refers to his mod as a separate "CZT voltage bypass mod", becaus it really is a separate mod. You could do this mod to a non FETed SE and see a gain in perfomance. Which make me feel like, I was the first with a FET modded SE, and the CZT mod just takes full advantage of it. ;)[/quote:1b215d1b12]I think you nailed it all right on the head...\r\nyou\'re handling this perfectly.\r\n\r\nI too think we should offer a "tutorial spot" to CZ, but if he stays the pompous ass he seemed to be, screw him.\r\n\r\nto be perfectly honest - you have every right in the world to post whatever you want about your SE fet mod.\r\n\r\nit\'s like anything with these little cars - most all of it has been done at one time or another - there\'s nothing wrong with writing something up yourself.\r\n\r\nmany times people write how they talk to themselves, which is hard for others to understand...\r\nI\'ve seen at least 5 different tutorials on dual cells, each has their own pro\'s and con\'s in the writing.... get where I\'m coming from?');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (15983, '875d927262', '[quote:875d927262="crazydave"]If you don\'t mind a quick rant, I wanted to go off about some bs that went down at my wife\'s website, to someone that would understand.\r\n\r\n\r\nSo anyways, some bs I could give a shit about went down last week, some chick got all suicidal, and people got all controversial about it, whatever, anyways, my wife is bogged down with phone callls, and IMs, so she tells every she\'s stepping back, and taking a break as administartor for a while, which for my wife, she\'d be lucky if she went a day. Then this stupid bitch, who wasn\'t even a mod, my wife just let her have mod privs to upload some stuff for her, so she decides she\'s gonna take over in my wife\'s abscense. Not only does she start adding, removing, and rearranging the forums, but she changes my wife\'s password. THEN when my wife asked her for the new password, she said, "Why? You said you were quitting." So my wife pulled her password out of the PHP code. Changed everything back, and took that bitches mod priveledges back. That stupid bitch was too ignorant to realize that wife knows every damn line of that freakin\' message board. Which bring me to the point of my rant, who the hell do these people think they are (the other mods were in on it too) trying to take over the website that my wife put so many damn hours into just for them. \r\n\r\nIngrateful bastards...I took it personal, I\'ve made sacrifices for them and their stupid website too. I told my wife, ban her, ban her, ban her. Ban her now, or I\'ll fucking do it for you, but she doesn\'t want to look like the bad guy. I think she needs to set an example, so no one thinks they can walk in and just take what my wife\'s done.\r\n\r\nWhat do you think? (or just smile and nod if ya don\'t think;) )\r\n\r\nDave[/quote:875d927262]touchy subject man...\r\nI think we think similar so you\'ll probably understand where I\'m getting ready to come from...\r\n\r\n1st off - yes I\'d be extremely fucking pissed.\r\nyes I\'d ban her ass.\r\nI\'d make the most public example of her I could.\r\nI\'d reduce her miniscule mind to a soft lump of shit.\r\nI\'d make her cry at home, alone, sitting in front of her computer with only the glow of her lonely monitor to keep her company.\r\n\r\nharsh sounding right? maybe even a tad overboard?\r\nprobably true.\r\n\r\nbut...\r\nwhat about what that bitch did?\r\nwas it harsh? yes.\r\nwas it more than a tad overboard? yes.\r\n\r\nafter I did all that and knew I drove her to commit suicide - I might feel bad - but that would probably pass rather quickly. Afterall, if she\'s that fragile - there\'s a lot more wrong and weighing her down than just my actions.\r\n\r\noverall - here\'s the way I see it from the information that you have given me.\r\nyour wife and whomever have worked hard, have made something to be proud of - something that others enjoy and find beneficial.\r\n\r\ndo you realize how many billions of people would kill to be able to be in that position? to have come up with the idea? to be a part of something like that?\r\nbillions and billions.\r\n\r\nthis bitch got a foot in the door and saw a chance - she\'s probably the same type of imbissle that you see on those reality shows where some dumb bitch marries someone for a million dollars only to be the brunt of the worlds laughs.\r\nthose people get what they deserve right?\r\nI mean - they beg for it - they jump at it - blinded by their wants and desires and never taking the time to think about their actions.\r\n\r\nwell guess what?\r\nit\'s time for the smart people (like your wife) to stop feeling responsible for all the other morons out there.\r\nshe\'s done her part and continues to do so.\r\nif she was jesus christ herself - she\'d still have someone pissed off at her.\r\nthat\'s what happens when you reach larger audiences.\r\n\r\nbottom line, this bitch crossed the line.\r\n\r\nYou see - you can make it very clear who runs things, who owns them, etc. without coming across as "ruling with an iron fist".\r\nit\'s a very hard act to juggle, but it can be done.\r\n\r\nyour wife needs to find "good" moderators - not just ones that have no life and are online at all times.\r\nafter that - she should be able to safely delegate tasks.\r\nshe has to find the right moderators though or she\'ll end up with more problems - maybe not the same, but problems none the less.\r\n\r\nI don\'t pretend to have all the answers, and quite often I do the wrong things myself - so take these words as you must - I hope they helped.');
