INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (18936, '5547212f26', 'I don\'t think he\'s like, "gonna get one" interested... I think today\'s post was out of sympathy for that dude, a little bit. Payaso &amp; Hog (especially Hog with his edits) went off on that dude, and neither of us could figure out exactly why. I think I missed something before it got edited... \r\n\r\nI think it\'s too expensive for what it is, but SF and I both like the idea of a track that\'s portable and really nice quality/performance. And I think we\'d go in on one, if it were the right thing... that one isn\'t. \r\n\r\nWe just never get around to building a track, but we will, eventually.');
