INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (16180, 'd32fb6fe77', '[quote:d32fb6fe77="crazydave"]Well shit, that was pretty quick. I was actually probably gonna pay you some time this weekend. So did you want that by paypal or money order?\r\n\r\nWhen you mentioned the Big Boys doing that Live At Raul\'s split single with the Dicks, I remembered reading about that single in the liner notes for the Dicks album I used to have, it was just called Dicks 1980-1984 and was on the Alternative Tentacles label. That was a legendary single. \r\n\r\nI should make you a CD of some the crazy stuff I\'m into... :???: \r\n\r\nDave[/quote:d32fb6fe77]\r\n\r\nA personal check is fine (no need to pay extra for a MO)... I don\'t know if I\'m set up to do the paypal thing. I just have a basic account that I\'ve only used for paying people... mat@mcbru.com is the email address for my account... if that works, cool.\r\n\r\nI\'ve got that Dicks disc... I dig it. Yeah man, I\'m always into new shit... well, usually I\'m into old shit, but "new to me" is what I meant.\r\n\r\nLet me know when you get the package.\r\n\r\n-hue35');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (16181, '6e05d19bea', 'Hey man, the UPS man came a knockin\' today. \r\n\r\nThanks man, I dig the car, but I\'m confused, I thought you said it was a first generation ones. I don\'t know if you realized it, but this is one of the later ones with the good PCB. Or did you mean first generation as in, not an SE? \r\n\r\nAfter playing with it for a bit I realized there was something bunk going on with the reception, so I did a quicky fix, and swapped a Thunder Charger PCB in. I had already planned to, since I thought it was gonna have a slow PCB at first, so it was no biggie.\r\n\r\nWas it just the reception you didn\'t like about this one, or do you just really hate Zip Zaps? Cause it handles good.\r\n\r\nAnd thanks for the body, I never seen a white WRX before. It\'s kinda classy lookin\'. Gonna be a shame to paint over it.  :lol: \r\n\r\nAnd I can\'t forget that sheet of kick ass bubble wrap you sent. No really, I\'m serious. I have a bubble wrap fetish. Can\'t stop popping the stuff, and that was the funnest piece of bubble wrap I\'ve come across in a long time.\r\n\r\n\r\nAnyways, for some reason Zip Zaps get me all happy, and I feel like I owe you something now. Hue scored a deal on some Thunder Chargers for 3.50 apiece, and I\'m getting a few of them. So whenever those get here (they\'re on the way) I\'m gonna stick a set of FETs in one of those to send to you.\r\n\r\nDave');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (16182, 'abdbd66d5f', 'Hey Pimp,\r\n\r\nI received them on Wednesday, they look great!    :eek: \r\n Man U got Madd Skilz Pimp!  I don\'t know what to say except THANX for the generousity  :grin:');
