INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (16193, 'a904a22bd1', '[quote:a904a22bd1="crazydave"]I think it\'s funny how you and Payaso just don\'t get off on Zip Zaps. It\'s funny too because I don\'t like Zip Zaps the same as bits, it\'s a totally different like. It weird because aside from the length, and wheels there really is no difference. \r\n\r\nHere\'s my Zip Zap set up, I got 3 cars with dual cells, PCB swaps, and FETs, in 27, 45, and 49mhz. So I got 3 cars to race whenever/if I have company, but the one time I did, the dual cell cars were more that the beginners could handle, so I got a 27, and 49mhz ZZ, and kept them stock, but then no one ever showed up, so they rarely got used, and I sold one. \r\n\r\nSo now I got my collection back in order, but I feel a little funny having 5 Zip Zaps while you just got the one. So be expecting that Thunder Charger. I\'ll get your address when I\'m ready to send it.\r\n\r\nDave[/quote:a904a22bd1]lol I don\'t know what it is - I think it\'s just the fact that I started with the bits and I looked at zz as the copycat. I do dig the slightly smaller size as well, but yea you\'re right - there\'s not really much difference in them.\r\nI will say though - back in the day when these first started coming out - the Tomy\'s were just built so much better and more precise, I feel in love right away.\r\nI just get stuck in my ruts where I feel comfy lol\r\n\r\nI still gots an SE as well - so really I got 2 zz\'s - stock and SE. :)\r\n\r\nit\'s easy for cars to be too fast on my track - specially for the beginners. I can\'t even get my dual cell around it that well - just too damn fast for the little space.\r\nbut ya know, I really dig dual cells.\r\none day soon, I\'m dual celling a fetted car. I think I\'m going for the internal dual cell too since I\'ve only done external.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (16194, 'c994ac38a0', '[quote:c994ac38a0="CaboWabo"]it\'s easy for cars to be too fast on my track - specially for the beginners. I can\'t even get my dual cell around it that well - just too damn fast for the little space.[/quote:c994ac38a0]I hear ya there, and you gots a pretty big track, imagine trying to keep a dual cell on my little 4x4 track. Really I was more into Zip Zaps for dual celling, and all out speed on my kitchen floor, but once I built a track, I needed non-dual celled cars to stay on the track, then when I got into FETs, a single cell FET modded bit became [i:c994ac38a0]the[/i:c994ac38a0] set up for racing on the track. \r\n\r\nNow when I read people opinions on cars I can totally tell if they\'re a \'wide open space\' racer, or if they\'re a track person.\r\n\r\nBut I personally think if everyone just built a track, there would be a lot less people worried about dual cells, and what nots.\r\n\r\n[quote:c994ac38a0]but ya know, I really dig dual cells.\r\none day soon, I\'m dual celling a fetted car. I think I\'m going for the internal dual cell too since I\'ve only done external.[/quote:c994ac38a0] :???: Well maybe that TC I\'m gonna send you just might have an internal cell in it already. ;)\r\n\r\nDave');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (16195, 'abdbd66d5f', 'Hey Pimp,\r\n\r\nI received them on Wednesday, they look great!    :eek: \r\n Man U got Madd Skilz Pimp!  I don\'t know what to say except THANX for the generousity  :grin:');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (16592, 'c88aacd031', '[quote:c88aacd031="Havok"]yup, I\'m back on the night gig with more pay and full benefits...lovin\' it....no :smoking: during the day shift...too many nosey assholes...I\'m glad to be back....and workin on my track :grin:........unfortunately, and maybe fortunately...my marriage is failing and I\'m probably moving out soon......its a mutual, amicable break-up, so I guess thats cool....but hey, at least now I\'ll be able to take off and visit the STL whenever I want :cool:\r\nI think we should both go to phoenix and see cwazey davey soon too...I got the ride and gas....you just bring some grass  8-) \r\n\r\n[b:c88aacd031]Say Word![/b:c88aacd031][/quote:c88aacd031]dude, sorry to hear about you and the wife.\r\ntouchy subject sometimes for people so I don\'t wanna say much about it other than I wish you all the best - for real.\r\n\r\nthe job part sounds kick ass, you just keep getting raises and better work environments - bastard! lol\r\n\r\ngoin to see davey would be the shit man.\r\nwe gotta get some of the pimps together and hook up somewhere.\r\nbetween us, it\'d be party like rock stars time lol');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (16197, 'c994ac38a0', '[quote:c994ac38a0="CaboWabo"]it\'s easy for cars to be too fast on my track - specially for the beginners. I can\'t even get my dual cell around it that well - just too damn fast for the little space.[/quote:c994ac38a0]I hear ya there, and you gots a pretty big track, imagine trying to keep a dual cell on my little 4x4 track. Really I was more into Zip Zaps for dual celling, and all out speed on my kitchen floor, but once I built a track, I needed non-dual celled cars to stay on the track, then when I got into FETs, a single cell FET modded bit became [i:c994ac38a0]the[/i:c994ac38a0] set up for racing on the track. \r\n\r\nNow when I read people opinions on cars I can totally tell if they\'re a \'wide open space\' racer, or if they\'re a track person.\r\n\r\nBut I personally think if everyone just built a track, there would be a lot less people worried about dual cells, and what nots.\r\n\r\n[quote:c994ac38a0]but ya know, I really dig dual cells.\r\none day soon, I\'m dual celling a fetted car. I think I\'m going for the internal dual cell too since I\'ve only done external.[/quote:c994ac38a0] :???: Well maybe that TC I\'m gonna send you just might have an internal cell in it already. ;)\r\n\r\nDave');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (16199, 'b40a059849', '[quote:b40a059849="crazydave"]\r\nNow when I read people opinions on cars I can totally tell if they\'re a \'wide open space\' racer, or if they\'re a track person.[/quote:b40a059849]\r\ndude that\'s so funny you say that - I\'m the same way.\r\nI was talking to payaso sometime ago about hue and superfly and they way they talked, to me - it sounded like they just raced in a rather large oval, and come to find out - they do.\r\n\r\nI hear ya, you really can tell the basic driving technique they\'re using by just reading what they type.\r\n\r\nI really like to do 2 basic styles - track and then outdoor just rough racing / driving. so I really do use a pretty wide variety of setups, but like you say - certain setups are just the way to go in some situations.\r\nlike my track, I usually do the fet as well with a 2.6 until I\'m feeling confident and then I go for 3.0.\r\npayaso actually got me interested in 1.0, 2.2 again if you can believe it.\r\nat first I tried it with a booster chassis, it was killer for really technical driving.\r\nI don\'t know if you remember that video from awhile back where they were using digi q\'s I think to parallel park?\r\nit\'s that type of driving but with the bits, that\'s when I started doing the "episode" videos - made for nice moving shots.\r\n\r\noutdoors, depending on what I\'m doing, I\'ll go as low as 2.6 and on up to whatever.\r\n\r\n[quote:b40a059849="crazydave"]:???: Well maybe that TC I\'m gonna send you just might have an internal cell in it already. ;)[/quote:b40a059849] :eek: you dog - shit man you\'re getting me all exciting like a little kid and shit. lol');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (16200, 'b73e562814', '[quote:b73e562814="CaboWabo"][quote:b73e562814="crazydave"]:???: Well maybe that TC I\'m gonna send you just might have an internal cell in it already. ;)[/quote:b73e562814] :eek: you dog - shit man you\'re getting me all exciting like a little kid and shit. lol[/quote:b73e562814]Think that\'s exciting? I just tried CyborgZero\'s FET mod on the SE, and it worked. \r\n\r\nIt still not as exciting as a dual cell FET modded bit can be, but it is very cool, and I have a feeling you\'re gonna wanna be sending me that SE of yours, but not until I order more P-channels FETs. ;)\r\n\r\nI let you know when I\'m set to go with that.\r\n\r\nDave');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (16202, '0f3c83411d', 'I got them today, and as far as I saw everything is cool....but the bastards put a hole in the box....I took pics of it, but I did it with my cell phone...so I\'ll have to send it to you from sprint....I don\'t remember your e-mail address....I have it on my webtv @ home, but I\'m at work....give it to me again and watch for an e-mail from sprint pcs......I think its davesmojoe@msn.com   but since I\'m not sure............\r\n\r\nand there was another thing......in with one of the cars...you\'ll see......I\'ll send pics of that too.....  :lol:');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (16203, '1fcd919333', '[quote:1fcd919333="Havok"]I got them today, and as far as I saw everything is cool....but the bastards put a hole in the box....I took pics of it, but I did it with my cell phone...so I\'ll have to send it to you from sprint....I don\'t remember your e-mail address....I have it on my webtv @ home, but I\'m at work....give it to me again and watch for an e-mail from sprint pcs......I think its davesmojoe@msn.com   but since I\'m not sure............[/quote:1fcd919333]I can\'t believe those bastards put a hole in the box. I hope that didn\'t effect anything. \r\n\r\nMy email is davesmoejoe@yahoo.com, I also have the davesmoejoe@hotmail.com for the MSN messenger.\r\n\r\n[quote:1fcd919333]and there was another thing......in with one of the cars...you\'ll see......I\'ll send pics of that too.....  :lol:[/quote:1fcd919333]Shit dude, I can already guess.\r\n\r\nWe\'ve been battling roaches in our kitchen, and that drove them into the rest of the apartment. After I shipped off your package I realized with those cars sitting in one spot for so long, I should\'ve have gone through and checked. I have a feeling you\'re about to confirm my worst fear.\r\n\r\nIf so, I\'m sorry dude, that\'s embarrassing as hell, but if you ever live in an apartment, you know how it is. :roll:\r\n\r\n\r\nWell shit dude, I glad your stuff at least made it there, and I hope everything is ok. There should\'ve been 8 cars in there.\r\n\r\nThe Nakamichi\r\nClone with orange Subaru body.\r\nClone, no body\r\nYellow mini\r\nbit char-g, no body, no tires\r\nThunder charger with alloys\r\nMicrosizer with WRX body\r\n\r\n...and there was one more, can\'t remember what it was, but I counted 8 bags I put in the box.\r\n\r\nI don\'t know if you realized it when you were away, but everyone wanted FETs in their SE. I was the first to actually get FETs in my SE working, but the improvement wasn\'t as drastic as a FETed car should be. micro_amps figured it out, but refused to share his info, for his own self proclaimed reason of profit. That pissed a bunch of people off, and they all were suddenly looking to me and ph2t to figure it for them. Basically we ended up giving up. \r\n\r\nNow cyborgzero has just cracked the issue with the SE, so I\'m kinda excited about that.  :-D \r\n\r\n\r\nso yeah, anyways let me know if everything is there and ok, and let\'s see them pics, though I\'m kinda dreading it.\r\n\r\nDave');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (16508, 'e785917823', 'I just wanted to thank you again.\r\n\r\nI had bought my kid a Thunder Charger a while back, and took it back. I didn\'t think he\'d notice, but he sure did notice. So anyways, when he saw the pile of Thunder Chargers, he said, "I want one". I thought, well if I\'m ever gonna let him have one, it doesn\'t get any cheaper than this! So I told him to pick one.\r\n\r\nSorry about the irrelevant story, but I thought it was funny at the time.\r\n\r\nThe cars all seem to be in order, but one was missing the motor. No biggie, I have spare TC motors, just thought I\'d mention it.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nI fuckin\' love the Big Boys CDs!! That is great stuff. I think I got more excited about the CDs than the cars.  :lol: \r\n\r\nSeems to be a bit of MC5 influence going on. I bet you\'re into the Minutemen too, cause it also reminded me alot of them.\r\n\r\nBut what\'s up with the black CDs? My CD player don\'t like \'em. I gotta play them on my computer or DVD player.\r\n\r\nAlso the covers look really nice, but they make me feel guilty, because I wont be able to print covers for the CDs I send you. My printer sucks ink too fast, and my wife bitches whenever I "waste all her ink". :roll:\r\n\r\nOn the CDs I was gonna put together I was just gonna put 4 or 5 songs by each band, to give you an idea of the variety I\'m into. Let you know when I get one together.\r\n\r\nDave');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (16205, '1fcd919333', '[quote:1fcd919333="Havok"]I got them today, and as far as I saw everything is cool....but the bastards put a hole in the box....I took pics of it, but I did it with my cell phone...so I\'ll have to send it to you from sprint....I don\'t remember your e-mail address....I have it on my webtv @ home, but I\'m at work....give it to me again and watch for an e-mail from sprint pcs......I think its davesmojoe@msn.com   but since I\'m not sure............[/quote:1fcd919333]I can\'t believe those bastards put a hole in the box. I hope that didn\'t effect anything. \r\n\r\nMy email is davesmoejoe@yahoo.com, I also have the davesmoejoe@hotmail.com for the MSN messenger.\r\n\r\n[quote:1fcd919333]and there was another thing......in with one of the cars...you\'ll see......I\'ll send pics of that too.....  :lol:[/quote:1fcd919333]Shit dude, I can already guess.\r\n\r\nWe\'ve been battling roaches in our kitchen, and that drove them into the rest of the apartment. After I shipped off your package I realized with those cars sitting in one spot for so long, I should\'ve have gone through and checked. I have a feeling you\'re about to confirm my worst fear.\r\n\r\nIf so, I\'m sorry dude, that\'s embarrassing as hell, but if you ever live in an apartment, you know how it is. :roll:\r\n\r\n\r\nWell shit dude, I glad your stuff at least made it there, and I hope everything is ok. There should\'ve been 8 cars in there.\r\n\r\nThe Nakamichi\r\nClone with orange Subaru body.\r\nClone, no body\r\nYellow mini\r\nbit char-g, no body, no tires\r\nThunder charger with alloys\r\nMicrosizer with WRX body\r\n\r\n...and there was one more, can\'t remember what it was, but I counted 8 bags I put in the box.\r\n\r\nI don\'t know if you realized it when you were away, but everyone wanted FETs in their SE. I was the first to actually get FETs in my SE working, but the improvement wasn\'t as drastic as a FETed car should be. micro_amps figured it out, but refused to share his info, for his own self proclaimed reason of profit. That pissed a bunch of people off, and they all were suddenly looking to me and ph2t to figure it for them. Basically we ended up giving up. \r\n\r\nNow cyborgzero has just cracked the issue with the SE, so I\'m kinda excited about that.  :-D \r\n\r\n\r\nso yeah, anyways let me know if everything is there and ok, and let\'s see them pics, though I\'m kinda dreading it.\r\n\r\nDave');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (16289, 'd7ca958c39', '[quote:d7ca958c39="CaboWabo"][quote:d7ca958c39="crazydave"]Whatever, it works good enough, I\'m just curious if this the same mod micro_amps does.\r\n\r\nDave[/quote:d7ca958c39]payaso can tell us, he\'s got a fet se from MA[/quote:d7ca958c39]Alright, bring Payaso on. You tell him, if he ever wants to come on down here, I will have his SE pink slip.  :lol: \r\n\r\nAfter further experimenting, I have determined, this is it, CZ has definately cracked this nut.\r\n\r\nIt\'s funny because we know he didn\'t have the mod nailed when ph2t called hime out for selling it, and he seemed like a pompous ass when he first showed up here. Then he turned out to be the pimp that shared his info with us. So now I appreciate him, but I still think he\'s a pompous ass. \r\n\r\nI really believe between ph2t calling him out, and this post from hue...\r\n[quote:d7ca958c39]Hell, dude... sounds like you got it nailed from all directions. How about doin\' it for reals, then postin\' up a tutorial with pictures and diagrams. That way idiots like me can make an SE worth having, and you get to be an actual, true-to-life smarty pants and get mad respect from da hood. \r\n\r\nOr, you can just keep throwing out your hypotheses (which I barely understand a word of) and "taunt the halfwits" with your brilliance and stuff. \r\n\r\nPersonally, I think you should do the tutorial. [/quote:d7ca958c39]...that we sent him on a mission to prove himself, which is what I think is funny.\r\n\r\nThough it is true he posted his info at TRC, and just rubbed in hs vids over here. I wouldn\'t make a tut on his mod without his permission, but I don\'t see any reason I can\'t take pic of what I\'ve done to my PCB. ;)\r\n\r\nMaybe since this seems to be an ego issue with him, he might be honored if we offered to host up a tut, giving him all the credit and accolades. ;)\r\n\r\nAnyways, this made my weekend, but I suddenly need a bunch of money, gotta restock on FETs, gotta gotta, absolutely have got to get that SE Chevelle... :-D \r\n\r\nDave\r\n\r\n\r\nEDIT: I just wanted to add that I appreciate CZ approach to this, because micro_amps straight out said my FET mod was wrong and his was right, stripping me of the honor of having the first FET modded SE, but CZ refers to his mod as a separate "CZT voltage bypass mod", becaus it really is a separate mod. You could do this mod to a non FETed SE and see a gain in perfomance. Which make me feel like, I was the first with a FET modded SE, and the CZT mod just takes full advantage of it. ;)');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (16290, '1b215d1b12', '[quote:1b215d1b12="crazydave"][quote:1b215d1b12="CaboWabo"][quote:1b215d1b12="crazydave"]Whatever, it works good enough, I\'m just curious if this the same mod micro_amps does.\r\n\r\nDave[/quote:1b215d1b12]payaso can tell us, he\'s got a fet se from MA[/quote:1b215d1b12]Alright, bring Payaso on. You tell him, if he ever wants to come on down here, I will have his SE pink slip.  :lol: \r\n\r\nAfter further experimenting, I have determined, this is it, CZ has definately cracked this nut.\r\n\r\nIt\'s funny because we know he didn\'t have the mod nailed when ph2t called hime out for selling it, and he seemed like a pompous ass when he first showed up here. Then he turned out to be the pimp that shared his info with us. So now I appreciate him, but I still think he\'s a pompous ass. \r\n\r\nI really believe between ph2t calling him out, and this post from hue...\r\n[quote:1b215d1b12]Hell, dude... sounds like you got it nailed from all directions. How about doin\' it for reals, then postin\' up a tutorial with pictures and diagrams. That way idiots like me can make an SE worth having, and you get to be an actual, true-to-life smarty pants and get mad respect from da hood. \r\n\r\nOr, you can just keep throwing out your hypotheses (which I barely understand a word of) and "taunt the halfwits" with your brilliance and stuff. \r\n\r\nPersonally, I think you should do the tutorial. [/quote:1b215d1b12]...that we sent him on a mission to prove himself, which is what I think is funny.\r\n\r\nThough it is true he posted his info at TRC, and just rubbed in hs vids over here. I wouldn\'t make a tut on his mod without his permission, but I don\'t see any reason I can\'t take pic of what I\'ve done to my PCB. ;)\r\n\r\nMaybe since this seems to be an ego issue with him, he might be honored if we offered to host up a tut, giving him all the credit and accolades. ;)\r\n\r\nAnyways, this made my weekend, but I suddenly need a bunch of money, gotta restock on FETs, gotta gotta, absolutely have got to get that SE Chevelle... :-D \r\n\r\nDave\r\n\r\n\r\nEDIT: I just wanted to add that I appreciate CZ approach to this, because micro_amps straight out said my FET mod was wrong and his was right, stripping me of the honor of having the first FET modded SE, but CZ refers to his mod as a separate "CZT voltage bypass mod", becaus it really is a separate mod. You could do this mod to a non FETed SE and see a gain in perfomance. Which make me feel like, I was the first with a FET modded SE, and the CZT mod just takes full advantage of it. ;)[/quote:1b215d1b12]I think you nailed it all right on the head...\r\nyou\'re handling this perfectly.\r\n\r\nI too think we should offer a "tutorial spot" to CZ, but if he stays the pompous ass he seemed to be, screw him.\r\n\r\nto be perfectly honest - you have every right in the world to post whatever you want about your SE fet mod.\r\n\r\nit\'s like anything with these little cars - most all of it has been done at one time or another - there\'s nothing wrong with writing something up yourself.\r\n\r\nmany times people write how they talk to themselves, which is hard for others to understand...\r\nI\'ve seen at least 5 different tutorials on dual cells, each has their own pro\'s and con\'s in the writing.... get where I\'m coming from?');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (16207, 'e32a2ff82e', '[quote:e32a2ff82e="crazydave"][quote:e32a2ff82e="Havok"]I got them today, and as far as I saw everything is cool....but the bastards put a hole in the box....I took pics of it, but I did it with my cell phone...so I\'ll have to send it to you from sprint....I don\'t remember your e-mail address....I have it on my webtv @ home, but I\'m at work....give it to me again and watch for an e-mail from sprint pcs......I think its davesmojoe@msn.com   but since I\'m not sure............[/quote:e32a2ff82e]I can\'t believe those bastards put a hole in the box. I hope that didn\'t effect anything. \r\n\r\nMy email is davesmoejoe@yahoo.com, I also have the davesmoejoe@hotmail.com for the MSN messenger.\r\n\r\n[quote:e32a2ff82e]and there was another thing......in with one of the cars...you\'ll see......I\'ll send pics of that too.....  :lol:[/quote:e32a2ff82e]Shit dude, I can already guess.\r\n\r\nWe\'ve been battling roaches in our kitchen, and that drove them into the rest of the apartment. After I shipped off your package I realized with those cars sitting in one spot for so long, I should\'ve have gone through and checked. I have a feeling you\'re about to confirm my worst fear.\r\n\r\nIf so, I\'m sorry dude, that\'s embarrassing as hell, but if you ever live in an apartment, you know how it is. :roll:\r\n\r\n\r\nWell shit dude, I glad your stuff at least made it there, and I hope everything is ok. There should\'ve been 8 cars in there.\r\n\r\nThe Nakamichi\r\nClone with orange Subaru body.\r\nClone, no body\r\nYellow mini\r\nbit char-g, no body, no tires\r\nThunder charger with alloys\r\nMicrosizer with WRX body\r\n\r\n...and there was one more, can\'t remember what it was, but I counted 8 bags I put in the box.\r\n\r\nI don\'t know if you realized it when you were away, but everyone wanted FETs in their SE. I was the first to actually get FETs in my SE working, but the improvement wasn\'t as drastic as a FETed car should be. micro_amps figured it out, but refused to share his info, for his own self proclaimed reason of profit. That pissed a bunch of people off, and they all were suddenly looking to me and ph2t to figure it for them. Basically we ended up giving up. \r\n\r\nNow cyborgzero has just cracked the issue with the SE, so I\'m kinda excited about that.  :-D \r\n\r\n\r\nso yeah, anyways let me know if everything is there and ok, and let\'s see them pics, though I\'m kinda dreading it.\r\n\r\nDave[/quote:e32a2ff82e]\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nnow that is some funny shit.....and yes I\'ve lived in some pretty bad places, so I do understand........nope no roaches....I think its too young for that yet.....lmao....I just sent the pics to your yahoo e-mail........I\'m thinking of getting an Initial D SE soon...so that will be cool if you guys can figure it out......\r\n\r\nI haven\'t looked at the cars yet.....or counted them.....I\'ll see in the morning when I get off of work....I\'m sure they\'re fine....stupid postal idiots!!!!  :lol:');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (16208, '927ac37ff4', '[quote:927ac37ff4="Havok"]nope no roaches....I think its too young for that yet.....lmao....I just sent the pics to your yahoo e-mail......[/quote:927ac37ff4]Hmmm :???: \r\nIf it\'s \'too young\' to be a roach...must be a seed! I haven\'t got the email yet, you might want to resend it.\r\nIf that is it, then that\'s just funny and odd, but ya know I am baking out when working my cars. ;)\r\n Good thing it was you and not someone else.  :rockon:\r\n\r\nWhich reminds me, now that there\'s more kids around BitPimps, there\'s not as many of the cool smokers around. You really should catch up, and post more. ;) :)\r\n\r\n[quote:927ac37ff4]..I\'m thinking of getting an Initial D SE soon...so that will be cool if you guys can figure it out......[/quote:927ac37ff4]Well cyborgzero\'s fix works pretty good, so whenever you get your SE, you\'re gonna want that done.\r\n\r\nWell I\'ll keep an eye out for that email, oh and BTW check out Cabo\'s new gallery. It\'s pretty cool.\r\nhttp://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/index.php\r\n\r\nDave');
