INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (16288, '22b86b46ff', 'No worries man, my address...\r\n\r\nMat Mathey\r\n3104 SE 39th Avenue\r\nPortland, OR  97202\r\n\r\nThat\'s cool on the comp... that kind of thing should just happen when it happens. I was gonna dupe a couple of Sham69 comps I have, but didn\'t get the time... I\'ll send those eventually, if your interested. I like the idea of an ongoing disc exchange... every now and then a new disc pops up in the mail... sweet!\r\n\r\n[quote:22b86b46ff="crazydave"]Double BTW, I\'ve been meaning to ask you...are you a that Borg, Hue, that brought down the Borg collective by having a unique opinion? I been wondering about that for a while?[/quote:22b86b46ff]\r\n\r\nNope... I didn\'t know about that Hue. I dig Star Trek, but I couldn\'t tell you a lick of trivia.\r\n\r\nThe hue35 name is a hodge podge of stuff... as a teen, I used to sign up for things, like the record club or Petitions, under the name Hugh Jorgan (Huge Organ). Occasionally, I would rope someone in to be my brother, Lar Jorgan (Large Organ) for double the fun. Anyway, when SuperFly and I used to go to the arcade,  10-11 years ago, my screen name was \'hue\', based on Hugh Jorgan... I liked the \'hue\' spelling and meaning in the video game context better. My dad raced Vettes when I was a kid, and his number was 35... so that\'s that. (more than you wanted to know!)');
