INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (16509, '664c62bcbe', 'Great story... the boy is hooked. I remember you saying that your wife didn\'t like little cars, but it sounds like she\'s outnumbered... you\'re officially a little car family.   :) \r\n\r\nI\'m glad everything arrived... don\'t know what\'s up with the missing motor. All I can think is that once they were out of the package, I must have mixed one of my TCs in there... was it one of the yellow cars?\r\n\r\nGlad you dig the Big Boys cds... yeah, the Minutemen and Firehose are one of my all time faves. Mike Watt is one of my biggest bass infuences. \r\n\r\nI\'ve never met a cd player that didn\'t play the black cds... does that player play other CD-Rs? I transfer a lot of vinyl to cd, so that\'s when I developed the look of the cds I make for folks... the goal was to make them look like little records, so the black discs were perfect. I won\'t send you the black discs in the future.\r\n\r\nA sampler disc sounds perfect, man. No worries on how it looks, I\'m just interested in the tunes. I may not always do \'em up full-on because it takes a lot of time, but sometimes I just need to.  :grin: \r\n\r\nlater Dave,\r\n\r\nMat');
