INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (16546, 'c6c34afe69', '[quote:c6c34afe69="Havok"]hello from the land of corn my desert dwelling friend,or was that fiend?\r\n\r\nI have completed a short kitchen floor test with all of the vehicles and I am happy to report that all is well in the land of vroooom  8-) \r\n\r\njust thought I\'d let you know \r\n\r\npeace from the east........ time to choke on a bone  &lt;::::# ~~~ :smoking:\r\n\r\ndamn I love my job :grin:[/quote:c6c34afe69]hey ya know we gots corn here too.  :-) \r\n\r\nIt\'s one of AZ\'s five Cs. Copper, Cattle, Citrus, Cotton, and Corn. That\'s whats we gots.\r\n\r\n...and i can be a friend or a fiend, depending on my mood, ya know how that is.\r\n\r\n\r\nGood to hear the cars are still working good. It puts me at ease to know people are satisfied with my work.\r\n\r\nSo are you still gonna hack that camaro body to go with the Alloys? That\'s gonna be pretty cool.\r\n\r\nHey, have you seen the new Zip Zap SEs? There\'s an SS Chevelle, and a the Starsky and hutch Torino. They look sweet, i can\'t wait to get me the Chevelle.  :-D \r\n\r\nWell good to hear you\'re happy with your job again. Too bad I hate mine, and I\'m getting ready to leave for work right now. :roll:\r\n\r\n...but after today I got the next 2 days off.  :-D \r\n\r\nDave');
