INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (16777, 'd882052e9e', '[quote:d882052e9e="ph2t"][quote:d882052e9e="SuperFly"]Hey man-\r\n\r\nI was wondering if you might be able to get me a verbal description of your prize offering by this weekend. I want to put up a post outlining the contest rules, criteria, timeline and prizes. We can add pictures later (unless you have them now...), but i wanted to get it kicked off with the details. \r\n\r\nThe prizes so far are:\r\n\r\nSuperfly = lowered Shen chassis, QFM spring suspension, LXX wheels, mosfetted Thunder Charger PCB, custom painted and decaled Microsizer Supra body, custom painted TX. \r\n\r\nhue35 = mosfetted and lowered Thundercharger chassis with a custom painted 350z body and TX. \r\n\r\nbetty.k = lxx chassis with full suspension conversion, custom offroad lego wheelset with 12:1 gears, modded red hummer shell with stikfas decals \r\nstock lxx single speed 27mhz tx/rx, dual 150 mah nicad, reinforced heatsink clip, perfection heatsink with shock mount, perfection 2.2. \r\n\r\ncj = New Starsky &amp; Hutch ZZ SE \r\n\r\nsessiz = original, limited edition bitPimps poster(s) \r\n\r\nph2t = light set and .....[/quote:d882052e9e]\r\n\r\nfuck man what a prize list!!!  :eek: \r\n\r\nGive me a couple of days, I\'ll let you know.\r\n\r\ncheers dude,\r\n\r\nph2t.[/quote:d882052e9e]\r\n\r\nYeah, it\'s easily the best prize list of any contest I\'ve seen. Given the number of moderators and the number of prizes, they will almost be guaranteed a prize just for entering!\r\n\r\nJudges for the contest will be you, me, hue35, betty.k, cj, sessiz, and micromatch. I\'m thinking of having up to 3 entries per person andpushing the deadline to the end of April. \r\n\r\nI know you have project management credentials, so let me know if you have any other input on the contest, prizes and judging. I still need to work out a judging process....\r\n\r\nThanks!\r\nSuperFly');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (19014, '1cc7f70af7', '[quote:1cc7f70af7="crazydave"]Ok, check this out:\r\nhttp://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewtopic.php?t=2140&amp;start=135\r\n\r\nSomeone put together a FET mod tut for the SE, it\'s got some new info about some resistors, I try it, and it works. \r\n\r\nSo I\'m happy, been playing with my cars all morning. It\'s really cool, even though it was Gokou that turned me on to it.\r\n\r\nThen I realize, wait a minute, the guy gives credit to ph2t, cyborgzero, and some other guy, but I\'m the one who got the FETs in there first place, and told everyone that there was something else going on, all ph2t added was using pchannels, for a very slight theoretical increase in performance, and also 90% of the info needed for the mod is in that thread.\r\n\r\n\r\nSo that pissed me off, and I decided it\'s time I write my own tutorial. I\'m giving credit to ph2t and cyborgzero, since they worked with me, but credit for anything else will be given to "...and others"\r\n\r\nThe tutorial gokou linked to has a mistake in it, and is confusing, so just to have my own take on it, I\'m calling mine, "FET modding the SE in layman\'s terms."\r\n\r\n\r\nDude, now that you\'re gonna have 2 SEs I really need to get some FETs so I can do up your car too. You\'ve seen Payaso\'s car in action, so you could probably tell if we\'ve gotton it, but I think we have, this resistor mod was just the thing to put the SE over the edge.\r\n\r\nDave[/quote:1cc7f70af7]dude yea that\'s awesome.\r\nI\'ll put your tutorial up in our Articles section as well - we\'ll make you the man for FET\'ed SEs no doubt. screw the others.\r\n\r\nkeep me posted, let me know when I should send ya something. I\'ll toss in some extras for the favor - I was gonna be sending you some bodies anyways.\r\n\r\noh, and let me know when you got the tutorial done so I can put it in our Articles section.\r\n\r\n\r\nlet me know if that stuffs cool or not or if you have other ideas or whatever.');
