INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (18927, 'a34f963f38', '[quote:a34f963f38="hue35"]wow dude, thanks a million. That\'ll be awesome.. I know I\'m gonna love that stuff. Another band I\'ve been meaning to ask you if you dig, is Gun Club.. you ever get into those dudes? And the one I think you\'d really dig, is The Lazy Cowgirls...  you know them? D D Weekday is one of my favorite guitar players.\r\n\r\nThanks again, dude\r\n\r\nMat[/quote:a34f963f38]The Gun Club is one of those groups I always heard about that I knew I should be listening too, but never quite got around to it. Don\'t think I ever heard of the lazy cowgirls.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nOk then that\'s settled. I\'ll start burning those for ya right now.\r\n\r\nDave');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (16814, 'f73cc5003a', 'Hey, I got a favor to ask of you...\r\n\r\nYa know they got that contest for the moderators? Well I wants to win it, I like winning.  :-D \r\n\r\nOne of the cars I\'m planning is a funny car. I\'ve got a couple of the SEs 2.4v batteries (I\'ve killed a couple SEs trying to figure the FETs in those things). I can easily cram those in a Zip Zap chassis for a 4.8v monster. If I can rig a charger in time, I may even take it up to a 6-cell 7.2v beast. I\'m probably gonna putty up a Camaro body, but I haven\'t decided if I\'d go old or new school with the Camaro body.\r\n\r\nHere\'s what I\'m asking from you, ya know that fourth set of mismatched alloys missing the photo etched hubcaps, and a couple tires, that you sent me? Think I can get those off you? \r\n\r\nI figure just a plain set of alloys would look like a set of Centerlines on a funny car. I want to narrow  the fronts so that bit tires fit on, and I may drill 5 holes in each so the look like the newer Centerlines, but I guess that depends on which Camaro body I go with.\r\n\r\nSo, what do ya think?\r\n\r\ndave');
