INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (16948, '9f3199e883', '[quote:9f3199e883="Bird"]Not yet, sorry. I\'m waitin on my tax return so\'s I can just go to the shack and get everything all at once. That way I wont be goin\' back like the next day for awd, etc...\r\nThat sounds like a good idea, though, your x mod site. When I do get mine, you can count on seeing me there.\r\nI was following your posts yesterday, why you quittin\' bits? You can get Homies outta gumball machines, at Spencers, hell, I found some at Uni Mart the other day. Besides, they are small lookin\' next to x mods... people always put them next to bits, but I\'ve found that they work best with 1/43. They look perfect standing next to my SuperSlick.\r\nGood luck on your site...\r\n"If you build it, they will come" - Field of Dreams[/quote:9f3199e883]\r\n\r\nWell If You join my site, (You join by giving me Your email address and I send You back a invitation) I know for a fact that You would be on my site because You can put Your pictures of Your cars (Bits Xmods whatever You want to put on there) The mods You wish to get or do what mods You have done, we can talk about different Mods available or what ever, You can post whatever You like on the website, to a certain extent of course and we can trade or sell or what ever on the website too just like on this website, It would be easier to talk to everybody else because there are less people and You can make Your own page on my website about Your cars and pics and mods or what ever. I am kind of getting out of Bits because Xmods are faster and easier to mods and easier to fix, however BIT\'s in a way are really cool due to the size of them and mods and other stuff.-I still have three Bit\'s there pics are on the site too. If You would like to join just reply giving me Your Email address and then I\'ll hook You up on my website. ight, thanks, :cool:');
