INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (17046, '86aa31841b', '[quote:86aa31841b="NF08oldskool"]Do You have Xmods? I was just wondering because I am starting a page for Xmods where You can post pics and Mods and everybody can talk about X mods and stuff, it would be cool if I could get more people to join, If You would like to join i need Your Email address s I can send You a invitation. Need more members, and I am trying to figure out how to make the site public to the web, right now it is private and I need managers and other people. thanks :cool:[/quote:86aa31841b]\r\n\r\nI have one Honda Civic (Black), and right now I have the following upgrades installed on it:\r\n\r\nStage 2 yellow motor with heatsink\r\nSoft rubber slick tires\r\nIC-3 batteries\r\n\r\nThat\'s all. I have yet to get the Suspension and steering, All-Wheel Drive, Metal Bearings, Team Orion Elite Stock 180 motor (with 10-15 turns taken off each leg), and FET upgrades.\r\n\r\nMy email address is amitojbatra@yahoo.com, I am interested. But, I\'m already registered at xmods.cjb.net (In the beginner questions section, I\'m a mod there, which explains why people stay away from there :wink:) and xmodworld.com, so I don\'t know how this site will be any better.....\r\n\r\nAnyways, I\'m interested, Good luck.');
