INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (19191, '05f1599ed4', '[quote:05f1599ed4="DarkTari"]C-Dub,\r\n\r\nI can cop you a couple of Precious to mod if you want.  I sent Cavey Dave\'s yesterday.\r\n\r\nHe\'s doin 3, I\'m doin 3-4, I can get you 2 and that makes 8-9.  That\'s 2 months of auction material with just us 3.  Now if you throw in Hog &amp; Silla we may be able to stretch this out thru da summer.\r\n\r\nI want to get my alter ego "Da Big Kahuna" to post this auction. Can I just register again with the same email or do I have to use a different one?\r\n\r\nI\'m feelin pump\'d about this, I\'ll take the lead on it which give you and the others time to moderate.\r\n\r\nAlso I still wanna do a [b:05f1599ed4]Pimp My Ride[/b:05f1599ed4] thang this summer!  I wanna make this summer even better than the last  :eek:   I\'ll bring it to the IC once we get the auction off the ground.[/quote:05f1599ed4]damn dude - I can\'t tell you how glad I am you\'re part of "us".\r\nI\'m in awe of your attitudes and how willing you are to share, etc., etc.\r\nyou\'re a real fucking man - man lol\r\n*end gay props*\r\n\r\nI\'ve got some ideas for this summer too, I\'m pretty psyched. we need to keep giving the community a shot in the veins to keep em hooked.\r\n\r\nI have to admit, I feel bad accepting those cars from you man. you already do so much in that area. I\'ve got a few cars here I\'m probably going to part with (just been takin my time talking myself into it lol) so in all honesty - I probably don\'t [i:05f1599ed4]need[/i:05f1599ed4] the cars - it might help us more if they went to payaso or hog or nox or something, or even if you kept em and did "joint" ventures with them.\r\nbut I don\'t want to be offensive either so if you have your heart set on it, fine by me - send em my way, I\'ll get em cherry and get on the auction block.\r\n\r\nas far as your alter ego, you need to use a new email address (you could use a freebie at yahoo to make it easy on you).\r\nby the way - in case you haven\'t already - you should change your profile (DarkTari) email address to your own (not darktari@lixlink.com - as it doesn\'t exist anymore, along with the pimps email addys)\r\n\r\nlet\'s make this communities collective jaws drop again. :cool:');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (17374, '7a46da75ae', '[quote:7a46da75ae="Havok"]wow man...that is sooooo tight....I never knew what they were called, but that is where I got my inspiration for the drag car I posted in my first contest here. It was a white skyline with ridiculously large tires...lifted off of some crazy beetle 3 times the size of a bit.\r\n\r\nhttp://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/displayimage.php?pos=-251[/quote:7a46da75ae]Oh yeah, I forgot about that Skyline. Where did you get he little Hot Rod decals. I still need to find decals like that.\r\n\r\n\r\n[quote:7a46da75ae]That is awesome man...I am very impressed....don\'t worry...I\'m also tight lipped about such things....[/quote:7a46da75ae]Thanks man, that\'s what i wanted to hear. I aim to impress.\r\n\r\n[quote:7a46da75ae]your camaros are in the mail as of monday afternoon...I sent it from my house, so hopefully you\'ll get it by friday :grin:[/quote:7a46da75ae]Cool, I\'m still debating if I\'m going with the \'68 SS, or the \'69 Yenko.\r\n\r\n[quote:7a46da75ae]The track is on hold....I think I told you that me &amp; the wife are callin it quits..well, I will be moving the 1st or 2nd week of April....and I have alot of detail to still put into the track....so I\'m waiting till after I move..I have friends that are getting interested in the bits too...its gonna be great having 4-6 cars to race against.....[/quote:7a46da75ae]No, I don\'t think you told me, I would have remembered something like that. I\'m sorry to hear that.\r\n\r\nYou know, honestly, me and the wife don\'t get along the way we used to. We don\'t fight, and we get along fine, but sometimes it just seems like we\'re just friends, and I get frustrated, and feel like she doen\'t get care for me anymore, or get paranoid, and think she\'s cheating, but I just keep telling myself that it\'s just because we\'ve been together 10 years, and thing are different now that we have a kid around, but still I can\'t help to feel something\'s wrong. Really I think she\'s sick of me making very little money, and spending it on weed, but I can\'t help who I am, and I always hoped I could be appreciated for my strengths, instead of my weaknesses.\r\n\r\nAnyways, whenever I hear of people, like you or Hog, splitting, it bothers me, and makes me concerned for my future.\r\n\r\n[quote:7a46da75ae]I will keep you posted on my works in progress....let me know when you get the camaros....\r\n\r\npeace from the east.... :cool:[/quote:7a46da75ae]For shure man. We\'ll be touch.  :-) \r\n\r\ndave');
