INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (17466, 'e2430456e0', 'Yo EZ!\r\n\r\nIt\'s been a lot goin on in Da Hood!\r\n\r\nDa Pimps are holdin a moderators Contest, they are puttin up da prizes and they are off da hook!\r\n\r\nLemme know what you have left!  I\'m just using the 1st set of alloys I got from you on my [b:e2430456e0]sure fire win![/b:e2430456e0].\r\n\r\nThe MiniLites I\'m lookin for:\r\n[img:e2430456e0]http://www.scala43.com/scala43/rad/rad-fotosk/rad-wt67.jpg[/img:e2430456e0][img:e2430456e0]http://www.scala43.com/scala43/rad/rad-fotosk/rad-wt47a.jpg[/img:e2430456e0][img:e2430456e0]http://217.160.105.72/microsizers/upload/rims_bbs_rwII.gif[/img:e2430456e0]\r\n\r\nPlanning to do one of these:\r\n[img:e2430456e0]http://www.zeemax.com/Images/MINI/7Mini18.jpg[/img:e2430456e0]\r\n\r\nMakes sure you check out my Gallery:\r\nhttp://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/index.php?cat=10005 \r\n[img:e2430456e0]http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/albums/userpics/10001/wallpapers/normal_darktari01.jpg[/img:e2430456e0]\r\n\r\nAnd the rest:\r\nhttp://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/index.php');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (17354, 'b28791d461', 'Got a start on my project for the mod contest this weekend. It\'s coming out killer, so I couldn\'t wait to show it off, but it\'s still under wraps so, shhhh. \r\n\r\n\r\nI was originally thinking funny car, but Ripper777 has already done one of those, so I wanted to do something a little more original. When I was a kid, my favorite class was always Pro Stock, because they were door slammers so they looked more like street cars, bad ass street cars that were the fastest class besides the funny cars.\r\n\r\nSo anyways, started with a pan car style chassis. lighter and stiffer than stock, and plenty of room for my Zip Zap SE batteries.\r\n[img:b28791d461]http://crazybydesign.net/crazycars/prstkcam1.jpg[/img:b28791d461]\r\n\r\nI\'m proud of it, because it it\'s nice and straight, and fits the ZZ chassis perfect.\r\n[img:b28791d461]http://crazybydesign.net/crazycars/prstkcam2.jpg[/img:b28791d461]\r\n\r\nI made the front wheels from some Hot Wheels wheels. Had to dremel off the black "tire" part of the plastic, and I sanded back the fronts, by almost half, until they were narrow enough for bit tires. Then I carved in a bevel on the front with my exacto knife. Painted the edge silver, and I think it nails the magnesium \'Mag\' wheel look. Used Motorworks tires to get that old scool tall profile.\r\n\r\nThe rears are of coarse yours, thanks man.  :-)  \r\nI added a some dots to simulate bolts, and I think they\'re perfect. Used some tires left over from my alloys, because they have a taller profile.\r\n[img:b28791d461]http://crazybydesign.net/crazycars/prstkca3.jpg[/img:b28791d461]\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n...and since I\'m so excited about this, I\'m probably gonna clue cabo in too, but, since he\'s competition right now, here\'s the pic he wont see...\r\n[img:b28791d461]http://crazybydesign.net/crazycars/prstktps.jpg[/img:b28791d461]\r\n...here it is with 5-6v sitting in it all ready to go.\r\n\r\nI just need to wire it up, FET it, paint and detail the body, and I think it\'s gonna be pretty kick ass. I\'m excited.\r\n\r\nHow\'s your track coming.  :-) \r\n\r\nDave');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (17355, '9f9875afbc', 'Could you please send me the font that you use in your backrounds?\r\nThe font where you signed your name?\r\nOr, could you please tell me the name of it?\r\nSo that I could find it myself?\r\nthx!');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (17356, '6cb383094c', 'Hey, I\'m trying to keep my project for the mod contest under wraps, but I\'m getting excited, and have to share with someone. Havok donated the wheels so I\'ve been sharing with him, but he might not be around for a few days, so I\'m gonna clue you in, but since you are competition right now, I am gonna save the big surprise. ;)\r\n\r\nI was originally thinking funny car, but Ripper777 has already done one of those, so I wanted to do something a little more original. When I was a kid, my favorite class was always Pro Stock, because they were door slammers so they looked more like street cars, bad ass street cars that were the fastest class besides the funny cars.\r\n\r\nSo anyways, started with a pan car style chassis. Lighter and stiffer than stock. Made it from a Thunder Charger chassis, and Zip Zap packageing, so see, it is part Zip Zap, umm... by-product.\r\n[img:6cb383094c]http://www.s2k-kidz.com/crazycars/prstkca1.jpg[/img:6cb383094c]\r\n\r\nI\'m proud of it, because it is nice and straight, and fits the ZZ chassis perfect.\r\n[img:6cb383094c]http://www.s2k-kidz.com/crazycars/prstkca2.jpg[/img:6cb383094c]\r\n\r\nI made the front wheels from some Hot Wheels wheels. Had to dremel off the black "tire" part of the plastic, and I sanded back the front of the wheel, by almost half, until they were narrow enough for bit tires. Then I carved in a bevel on the front with my exacto knife. Painted the edge silver, and I think it nails the magnesium \'Mag\' wheel look. Used Motorworks tires to get that old school tall profile.\r\n\r\nThe rears are are made of some spare parts of alloys that Havok sent me when he asked me to mount his. I added a some dots to simulate bolts, and I think they\'re perfect. Used some tires left over from my alloys, because they have a taller profile.\r\n[img:6cb383094c]http://www.s2k-kidz.com/crazycars/prstkca3.jpg[/img:6cb383094c]\r\n\r\nJust gotta wire it up, and do some detailing to make it look like an authentic early 70s pro stock car, but it won\'t be until next month until I can get paint and detail stuff. I don\'t want to leave people hanging, so until it\'s done, shhh.;)\r\n\r\nI seriously can not wait until this one is done. I rarely stretch these things out beyond a weekend ya know.\r\n\r\nDave\r\n\r\n\r\n***EDIT:Hey dude, I think I got busted for using my domain to swap MP3s. I have no access to my account. I had to move these pictures so you could see them. No big deal though, it was freebie account.\r\n\r\n********Double EDIT: I forgot you\'re hanging with Payaso this week...so much for instant gratification.  :lol: \r\n\r\nThat\'s cool, havok got back to me, and he\'s diggin\' it. So I\'ll just leave this here for when you get back. :grin:');
