INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (17568, '30138fb781', 'the light kit is the one thing i forgot to get... i regretted not getting it as soon as i got home... i\'m going back to the waterfront soon to go to lowes for some home improvin\' stuff, i\'ll just grab it then. i think the shack down there just recently restocked because they had everything... and lots of it. i also picked up the hemi \'cuda/boss mustang pack for my SE the night i got all of my X-mod stuff. \r\nwhen i put everything on the counter and the guy started ringing me up and he got to the IC3\'s he was like "the x-mod batteries are only like $25", and i was like "the only reason i want to have to come back here is if you sell me a dud car" and he just goes "you ain\'t playin around then, are you?"... i just smile..."no, not at all"\r\nby the way, which car do you got? i got the blue civic 8-)');
