INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (17697, 'ada0f45243', 'Yea I have contacted him and Monouk added a script to our front page to break out of the url trap.  I told him if he is going to have links then he needs to warn people that the url is being trapped and that the pop-ups are his.  I also told him if he wants to remain friendly I suggest he ask before he does anything.  As far as the tutorials I told him that they will have to be removed and that I will notify him when I have decided what he can post, but for the moment he can either leave my work as it is or he can remove it.  What I\'m thinking is I will allow him to link to the front page and thats it, no links to the forum or the How to pages, until he moves his site to a host that does not trap urls.  This kid really pissed me off but I\'m trying to hold my temper, it just burned me the way he listed the other sites by name but refered to R7R as Our Forums, if he complies and is a good boy I will allow him to remain part of R7R.\r\n\r\n\r\nLater\r\nRipper7777777');
