INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (17943, '824d10c579', '[quote:824d10c579="hogjowlz"]you gota harness that energy a little more. lay in the jbweld. if you get it right you will get a 20-30% boost. less slop in the rear. that is a true piece of muscle tho.[/quote:824d10c579]I\'ll tell ya, I wholeheartedly agree with your use of JB Weld to eliminate slop, the only reason I haven\'t tried it, is because with my long hair, and my hair line receding in my old age, plus 2 cats. I\'m lucky if I make it through a whole run without getting a hair tangled in the gears. So I kinda need to remove the rear axle, a lot.\r\n\r\nBut, I totally agree this car needs some major taming. I\'m gonna order some slot car bushings, and try to make them slip into my chassis the way they would on a slot car, but if I don\'t work that out in time for the end of the contest, I [i:824d10c579]will[/i:824d10c579] be using some JB Weld.\r\n\r\nDave');
