INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (18353, '783b8c71a2', 'I\'m looking into making up a gallery site for myself and was wondering if you had a recomendation for a host. I\'ve been looking around but being the fuckin dumbass I\'m really not sure what to look for. Any help/advice would be apreciated bro. :-)');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (18354, '93ed3468f9', '[quote:93ed3468f9="sessiz"]I\'m looking into making up a gallery site for myself and was wondering if you had a recomendation for a host. I\'ve been looking around but being the fuckin dumbass I\'m really not sure what to look for. Any help/advice would be apreciated bro. :-)[/quote:93ed3468f9]welp... lemme go get a few links for ya (another pm).\r\nfirst off, think of what you really need / want.\r\nas in, how much space? probably quite a bit I\'d imagine, you\'re an image whore lol\r\nnow bandwidth, it costs - the more times your image is accessed, that\'s bandwidth going up / getting used up.\r\nnow features on the server - if you\'re going to have some sort automated gallery or something, you\'ll probably need access to some sort of scripting technologies (e.g. ASP, PHP, JSP, etc., etc.) as well as a database (MySQL, SQL, etc.). most servers have the basics installed automatically. servers that allow you to install your own applications are fuckin-a expensive.\r\nyou\'ll probably want some sort of server statistic software or management screens as well so you can see things like # of hits and shit.\r\n\r\nand of course the basic need of FTP access.\r\n\r\nlemme get some shit together and I\'ll pm ya back');
