INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (17995, '5cb3268f4f', '[quote:5cb3268f4f="sg219"]Hey thanks Dave.  I thought it was a great idea for a contest, but that whole moving thing screwed me up.  \r\n\r\nBut if you wanna send me some homies, THANKS.\r\n\r\nMichael Smalley Jr.\r\n3918 Inland Ave.\r\nWest Mifflin, Pa 15122[/quote:5cb3268f4f]Well I din\'t have as many spare quarters as I thought, I but I put a couple homies in the mail or you today.\r\n\r\nI should have shoved them in with Bird\'s now that I think about it, you two hang out anyways, and they cost as much to ship as the homies do.  :lol: \r\n\r\nOh well, the thought that counts.\r\n\r\nDave');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (17996, '07087583af', 'Ya, I didn\'t even think of puttin\' them in with Birds.  Well, thanks again!!\r\n\r\nHopefully I don\'t miss the next deadline for a contest.  \r\n\r\nI can\'t say it enough, you do some sweet work. Take it easy and stay on to of Mount Bottle Cap......');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (17997, '114f0d1d15', '[quote:114f0d1d15="crazydave"]You have a Palermo curse and you jinxed me. :lol:[/quote:114f0d1d15]\r\nhaha Sorry, man. I\'ve been after the elusive "godfather" Palermo for ages now, but my lady has been making me hit the Spongebob machine because we just redid our bathroom in a Spongebob theme(toilet seat, shower curtain, blue and white sponged paint to simulate water, and a bunch of stickers and Homie-sized Spongebob figures), and my collecting has been suffering. I also have a paralell collection of female Homies doubles going on for my 4 year old daughter, because she digs them.\r\n\r\nI remember what I was meaning to say to you... Remember a while back, when you were doing the baja Beetle, and you showed the Motorworks dumptruck, and I suggested making a flatbed on a zz chassis to haul your bits? That Camaro you are doing for the moderator contest would look too sweet sitting on a matched flatbed. Just somethin\' to get ya thinkin\'. Maybe a side project to keep the Camaro work from driving you nuts....\r\n\r\nJay(bird)');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (18179, '52cd5c939d', '[quote:52cd5c939d="SuperEMAXX"]I have the money now, Do you remember what i wanted?\r\n\r\n\r\nThanks,\r\nTyler[/quote:52cd5c939d]\r\n\r\nMy apologies, I\'ve been very busy with a new job lately.   Sorry for not reponding.   I\'m happy to to the headlight mod for you with the DIP switch and a 3V litium battery.   If you still want to go ahead with that then cool.  Otherwise I\'m ready to ship the other outstanding DIP switch for you with wires already soldered to it.\r\n\r\nLet me know man and if you don\'t want the headlights anymore then that\'s cool, I\'ll just ship the other DIP switch then.\r\n\r\nCheers,\r\n\r\nph2t.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (17999, '07087583af', 'Ya, I didn\'t even think of puttin\' them in with Birds.  Well, thanks again!!\r\n\r\nHopefully I don\'t miss the next deadline for a contest.  \r\n\r\nI can\'t say it enough, you do some sweet work. Take it easy and stay on to of Mount Bottle Cap......');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (18000, 'c0c9fe41d3', 'Hey Superfly, ya know what, I don\'t have any Bit Racer gears.\r\n\r\nSince I\'m PMimg you I\'m gonna give you my Kit Racer rant. When I heard that people were grabbing those up at TRU for a couple bucks, I checked mine out, they had one left, but the price tag was missing, so they tried to charge me 8.99, for a Kit Racer hop up set. I said never mind.\r\n\r\nSo yeah if you want to send me a gear set I\'ll definately throw them in this car and see what they do.\r\n\r\nBTW, help me out here, you know what a scale quarter mile is? I\'m thinking I heard somewhere 16ft., but I\'m not sure. Still that\'s a pretty good amount of room to wind those gears out. :???: \r\n\r\nAnyways, I ramble, here\'s my info,\r\nDavid Harrington\r\n6751 W Indian School rd. Apt.1150\r\nPhoenix, AZ 85033\r\n\r\nDave');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (18001, 'b9f9f71744', '[quote:b9f9f71744="Bird"]I remember what I was meaning to say to you... Remember a while back, when you were doing the baja Beetle, and you showed the Motorworks dumptruck, and I suggested making a flatbed on a zz chassis to haul your bits? That Camaro you are doing for the moderator contest would look too sweet sitting on a matched flatbed. Just somethin\' to get ya thinkin\'. Maybe a side project to keep the Camaro work from driving you nuts....\r\n\r\nJay(bird)[/quote:b9f9f71744]Aww man, that idea is just too good to pass up, now I got 2 things I need to finish this month.\r\n\r\nSeriously though, that is an excellent idea, this car is certainly not street legal, we got to get it to the track some how...and rolling up to the strip, and then rolling the car off the back up the truck, would be just too cool for my final vid. Thanks for the great idea. :-) \r\n\r\nI hope I can pull it off in time.  :lol: \r\n\r\nDave');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (18002, 'c0c9fe41d3', 'Hey Superfly, ya know what, I don\'t have any Bit Racer gears.\r\n\r\nSince I\'m PMimg you I\'m gonna give you my Kit Racer rant. When I heard that people were grabbing those up at TRU for a couple bucks, I checked mine out, they had one left, but the price tag was missing, so they tried to charge me 8.99, for a Kit Racer hop up set. I said never mind.\r\n\r\nSo yeah if you want to send me a gear set I\'ll definately throw them in this car and see what they do.\r\n\r\nBTW, help me out here, you know what a scale quarter mile is? I\'m thinking I heard somewhere 16ft., but I\'m not sure. Still that\'s a pretty good amount of room to wind those gears out. :???: \r\n\r\nAnyways, I ramble, here\'s my info,\r\nDavid Harrington\r\n6751 W Indian School rd. Apt.1150\r\nPhoenix, AZ 85033\r\n\r\nDave');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (18003, '5912d712a5', '[quote:5912d712a5="DarkTari"]TellYa What, Let\'s let the Pimps choose from the 4 weeks in the month for the Car-O-Da-Month, then let \'em pick the Car Of The Year in December.\r\n\r\nLet\'s set up the announcement, then the pole.\r\n\r\nSound Cool ?[/quote:5912d712a5]sounds good, let\'s bring up to April though - so we\'ll need to post up 2 quick - I was thinkin Yagbols\' Datsun for Feb and crazydaves black muscle car for Mar');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (18004, '6a109481ab', '[quote:6a109481ab="crazydave"]Aww man, that idea is just too good to pass up, now I got 2 things I need to finish this month.\r\n\r\nSeriously though, that is an excellent idea, this car is certainly not street legal, we got to get it to the track some how...and rolling up to the strip, and then rolling the car off the back up the truck, would be just too cool for my final vid. Thanks for the great idea. :-) \r\n\r\nI hope I can pull it off in time.  :lol: \r\n\r\nDave[/quote:6a109481ab]\r\n\r\nSorry for adding a headache to your already hectic month. But the more you showed that Camaro, the more I thought about it, and then when you put the video up, it just clicked and seemed like the natural accessory for that car. Hell, you could even do it up like a beat garage truck, all primer and rust and "crazydave racing" or "crazydave towing" or something like that on the doors and have that grass roots old school feel. I dunno. I think too much. I need to get busy on the stuff I have in mind for some of my rides instead of thinking about how to accessorize other peoples stuff..... but I\'m glad you like it. \r\n\r\nJay(bird)');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (18005, 'ab7b20b60c', 'Let\'s let the Pimps vote on that. Give \'em a time limit, and take it from there....... 8-)');
