INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (18348, '7c0a28f3da', '[quote:7c0a28f3da="Son_Gokou"][quote:7c0a28f3da="CaboWabo"][quote:7c0a28f3da="Son_Gokou"]http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewtopic.php?t=313&amp;postdays=0&amp;postorder=asc&amp;start=615\r\n\r\nUmm....they\'re joking, right? Or did I look gay/retarded in each of those pictures?[/quote:7c0a28f3da]yea - they\'re just giving you a hard time.\r\nyou can either laugh with them, against them, or blow off their comments - whichever works best for you[/quote:7c0a28f3da]\r\n\r\nMmm hmmm...\r\n\r\nhttp://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewtopic.php?t=3597\r\n\r\nAll I said was "I don\'t get how it will do this". Just that, and hog goes nuts on me and so does Finks. I don\'t get it, why are they so angry? I even made a post stating my point of view, he edited it, as you could see.....[/quote:7c0a28f3da]well I\'m going to be brutally honest with you. as you can see - not everyone is going to like you. for whatever reasons.\r\n\r\nyou\'ll just have to deal with it however you must. I can\'t monitor everyone\'s each and every posts. this takes up too much of my time as it is.');
