INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (18234, '2a2fd9292c', '[quote:2a2fd9292c="hogjowlz"]that tune is interesting. i think we come from different schools o thought but thats all good. i think that plucked thing sucks ass. youd be better off with a sample of a single note from a real guitar. my favorite synth plugin is "deamstatioin" its dxi and is very versitale.  i got a korg polysix as well(no midi) and none of the soft synths can come close even at 96khz.\r\n\r\nbut anyhow ill throw up a few zip files tonight but you will probably need version 4+ which i could put on your ftp if ya want. along with assloads of samples and plugins and crap. another cool plugin thats freeware even is called "superwave" google it.[/quote:2a2fd9292c]Heh heh, I\'m sure we do come from entirely different directions. I\'m come from a background of extreme hatred of Techno, and dance music in particular. When I first started playing with it, my intention was to make techno that sounded more organic, and less techno, but when I got into I started getting into all the sounds, and started listening to some techno. Atari Teenage Riot are the ones that got me into it, and a dude from work loaned me a stack of the Thunderdome CDs...\r\n\r\n...anyways I like to listen to techno now, because now that i have an understanding of what they\'re doing, I\'m like, "Damn, how they doing that", almost like if i was listening to Hendrix or someone.\r\n\r\nSince I was never into Techno, I\'m probably going about it all wrong, but that\'s ok, cause i like to be myself anyways, ya know?\r\n\r\n\r\nSo, yeah, I ramble, sorry, but l\'ll try to get some stuff zipped up this weekend. I\'m curious to see what you could do with my stuff, most of it is noisier than what I posted.\r\n\r\n\r\n...and I definately want that Fruity Loops 4, :-D \r\nI\'m too lazy to set up a FTP account right now, so I\'ll just give the one I set up for cabo.\r\n\r\nhost address: crazybydesign.net\r\nusername: u35707516cabowabo\r\npassword : bitpimps (I think, if it don\'t work, let me know, and I\'ll look it up)');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (18235, '57ff3dc831', 'password no worky.\r\n\r\nive been into electronic shit most of my life. i never really liked four on the floor dance beats tho like you until i started making it. ya noise rules. search for "plug" "squarepusher" and of course aphex twin. that thunderdrome shit is funny as hell.\r\n\r\nbefore i really started making electronic shit id always play with my friends\' guitar fx and just made noise. so synth shit was a natural progression i suppose. plus my uncle was always listening to devo and shit in the 80s and then he got me into skinny puppy.\r\n\r\nwhen you gime a password that works ill upload the new orb album as well. its "ambient dub" which means slow techno with raggae influence.');
