INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (18698, 'd695aeca5e', 'Ok, my brain is frazzled, I\'ve figured out enough over the last couple days, so now I\'m ready to ask for some help.\r\n\r\nSee now my new soundcard is doing the same as the old.\r\n\r\nXP reconizes it, and says it\'s working, but when I try to install the driver, it says there is no soundblaster device on thjis computer.\r\n\r\nThen I install the new one, I can\'t uninstall the old one because apprently it\'s integrated into my mother board, never realized that before\r\n\r\nAnyway start it up, it reconizes the new plug and play device, before I could respond it says your device is installed and ready to use, and is listing both sound cards in my list of available devices So I disabled it before I ran the driver, because there wasn\'t supposed to be any other drivers installed. Then when I run the new driver, it does the same as the update for the old card. says there is no sound blaster device.  and now the new sound card is not listed or being reconized, even when I turn the computer off and on.\r\n\r\nSo what\'s up? why can\'t I get a sound card driver to install with XP?\r\n\r\nAny help would be greatly apprecited, thanks.  :-) \r\n\r\nDave');
