INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (18271, 'e6419f1063', '[quote:e6419f1063="Finks"]Was thinking about the whole Pimp My Ride thread and thought WTF what a great idea for a mod contest.  So here is the idea.  Basically contestants have to take a car that they own or owned and either make a replica in bit form or a replica pimped out in bit form.  To add some substance to it, requiring a Pic of the contestant w/ the 1:1 car and then the bit bic would be hot as well.  This also prevents Gokou and other posers from claiming yeah this is my MR2, really it is!!  Would be fun all around, especially for those pimps thats rides havn\'t been made into a bit and see them crazy skills.  Just an idea.  PM me what ya think.[/quote:e6419f1063]it is a cool idea - we\'ve toyed with "themed" contests before, problem is we have to make it a pretty generic theme because the idea is - we want as many pimps to try their hand at it as possible.\r\nin the past, it seemed that if we got too specific - we cut off the majority of the potential contestants, either they discouraged themselves or we did.\r\n\r\nI love the concept, I think it can be done and done in a way that it won\'t exclude many pimps - but we\'ve gotta work out all the little details.\r\n\r\nmaybe go ahead and post this up in the suggestion box so everyone can get their input in on it?\r\nif we see enough interests, we can get more details worked out and hopefully set it up.\r\n\r\nwhat do you think?');
