INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (18437, '45016decd8', 'Hey man, when I FETed your car, and you asked what I wanted, I just asked that you mention my name when FETs come up. \r\n\r\nThen you say\r\n[quote:45016decd8]ph2t\'s the man here to ask though to be sure[/quote:45016decd8]\r\n\r\nSo what\'s up, just cause I didn\'t figure out the the SE, everyone\'s lost faith in me? Well fuck you guys.\r\n\r\nI\'ll tell you what, that PCB is identical to the Micro Speed PCB, I would shown how to actually do it, instead of spouting a bunch of technical mumbo jumbo, but ph2ts already impressed everyone with his technical BS, so never mind now.\r\n\r\nI\'m disappointed.\r\n\r\nDave');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (18438, 'e5b401475a', '[quote:e5b401475a="Son_Gokou"]Yeah, I guess so....\r\n\r\nBut, I think it\'s starting to get out of hand....I mean, what\'s up with his avatar? HE USED MY REAL RACE AS A PUSSY!! :shock:\r\n\r\nI guess I\'ll just PM him and ask him WTF he thinks he\'s doing....[/quote:e5b401475a]I just have to say - I\'m proud of you.\r\nI thought you handled today\'s episode perfectly.\r\nYou didn\'t get all bent out of shape on the boards - you got even.\r\nI commend you for how you\'ve handled this.\r\n\r\nI know you\'re taking the brunt - I know it feels like everyone is against you - but they\'re not. A few members do have it out for you, but we all have enemies so that\'s no difference. Other members probably join in because it looks like fun to them and not because they have anything personal against you.\r\n\r\nI guess all I\'m trying to say is...\r\nyou can\'t make everyone like you.\r\nsometimes there\'s people out there that are always going to give you a hard time.\r\nyou have the ability to make a choice if you are going to let these people bother you or not.\r\nyou\'re a member here just as they - so don\'t ever feel like you\'re being run off.\r\nif we want you gone, payaso or myself will tell you - and we haven\'t so that should tell you that you are welcomed here.\r\n\r\nand the "I heart wee wees" avatar was absolutely fucking brilliant! we all had a great laugh over that one - perfect response.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (18439, '534a8f9664', '[quote:534a8f9664="CaboWabo"][quote:534a8f9664="Son_Gokou"]Yeah, I guess so....\r\n\r\nBut, I think it\'s starting to get out of hand....I mean, what\'s up with his avatar? HE USED MY REAL RACE AS A PUSSY!! :shock:\r\n\r\nI guess I\'ll just PM him and ask him WTF he thinks he\'s doing....[/quote:534a8f9664]I just have to say - I\'m proud of you.\r\nI thought you handled today\'s episode perfectly.\r\nYou didn\'t get all bent out of shape on the boards - you got even.\r\nI commend you for how you\'ve handled this.\r\n\r\nI know you\'re taking the brunt - I know it feels like everyone is against you - but they\'re not. A few members do have it out for you, but we all have enemies so that\'s no difference. Other members probably join in because it looks like fun to them and not because they have anything personal against you.\r\n\r\nI guess all I\'m trying to say is...\r\nyou can\'t make everyone like you.\r\nsometimes there\'s people out there that are always going to give you a hard time.\r\nyou have the ability to make a choice if you are going to let these people bother you or not.\r\nyou\'re a member here just as they - so don\'t ever feel like you\'re being run off.\r\nif we want you gone, payaso or myself will tell you - and we haven\'t so that should tell you that you are welcomed here.\r\n\r\nand the "I heart wee wees" avatar was absolutely fucking brilliant! we all had a great laugh over that one - perfect response.[/quote:534a8f9664]\r\n\r\nThanks man....:smile:\r\n\r\nOh, and prepare to be disappointed....I myself don\'t know how "I heart wee wees" was funny...but someone gave me the idea.... :-)');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (18440, '45016decd8', 'Hey man, when I FETed your car, and you asked what I wanted, I just asked that you mention my name when FETs come up. \r\n\r\nThen you say\r\n[quote:45016decd8]ph2t\'s the man here to ask though to be sure[/quote:45016decd8]\r\n\r\nSo what\'s up, just cause I didn\'t figure out the the SE, everyone\'s lost faith in me? Well fuck you guys.\r\n\r\nI\'ll tell you what, that PCB is identical to the Micro Speed PCB, I would shown how to actually do it, instead of spouting a bunch of technical mumbo jumbo, but ph2ts already impressed everyone with his technical BS, so never mind now.\r\n\r\nI\'m disappointed.\r\n\r\nDave');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (18441, 'b1ce48d808', '[quote:b1ce48d808="crazydave"]Hey man, when I FETed your car, and you asked what I wanted, I just asked that you mention my name when FETs come up. \r\n\r\nThen you say\r\n[quote:b1ce48d808]ph2t\'s the man here to ask though to be sure[/quote:b1ce48d808]\r\n\r\nSo what\'s up, just cause I didn\'t figure out the the SE, everyone\'s lost faith in me? Well fuck you guys.\r\n\r\nI\'ll tell you what, that PCB is identical to the Micro Speed PCB, I would shown how to actually do it, instead of spouting a bunch of technical mumbo jumbo, but ph2ts already impressed everyone with his technical BS, so never mind now.\r\n\r\nI\'m disappointed.\r\n\r\nDave[/quote:b1ce48d808]wow dude - calm down.\r\nI made a mistake - sorry - you\'ve never done that?\r\nI understand you\'re upset - again I\'m sorry. Want me to go fucking erase it?\r\n\r\nI will.\r\n\r\nto be perfectly honest with you. I haven\'t gotten along with ph2t in a long time. after our discussion about pullbacks - I decided I would try and give him some props just so he\'d see that I\'m not just trying to be on his just because we haven\'t gotten along lately.\r\n\r\nyou\'re a moderator, you\'re in the b crew.\r\nph2t has none of those priviliages - why do you think that is?\r\n\r\nso now that you know my motives for what I did - you need to appoligize for the [quote:b1ce48d808]well fuck you guys[/quote:b1ce48d808]\r\n\r\nI appreciate your candor, that\'s what makes us good friends.\r\nI have all the faith in the world in you dave.\r\n\r\nI know things can get fucked up with text - hard to tell the emphasis on words and shit so hopefully we don\'t take this any other way than 2 pals talking out some shit. period.\r\n\r\nat any rate - you seem pretty pissed off - I\'m guessing more hurt than pissed. I don\'t know though - so the ball is your court.\r\n\r\nI still consider you a fucking really good friend dude, hope you\'re not so upset that it ruins other shit.\r\n\r\nsorry dave.');
