INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (18466, 'd256d7196f', 'Ok, which FET is better than the other....IRF7389, or SI4562DY? You said that the 4562 isn\'t as better than the 7389 as thought...but it\'s still better, right? I mean, someone said that while it may have less amperage capability, it has lower resistance.....And that the IRF7389 has lower amperage capability, but it can handle that current continuously....\r\n\r\nSo, which is better and why?  :-( \r\n\r\nBTW I\'m back at MRCC, you may see me there as 100mph_Xmod.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (18467, 'a371b30038', 'Sess,  What Up Pimp ?\r\n\r\nListen, I\'d like for you to do a few more Wall Papers 4 me if that\'s cool ?\r\n\r\nI\'d like dis babe:\r\n[img:a371b30038]http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/albums/userpics/10001/wallpapers/normal_sessiz13.jpg[/img:a371b30038]\r\n\r\nWith this Pimp\'n Azz Ride:\r\n[img:a371b30038]http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/albums/userpics/10005/normal_GoldenRod2.jpg[/img:a371b30038]\r\n\r\nGimme a caption [b:a371b30038]"All That Glitters Is Not Gold"   DarkTari Collection[/b:a371b30038]\r\n\r\nDis Babe:\r\n[img:a371b30038]http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/albums/userpics/10001/normal_sessiz_real.jpg[/img:a371b30038]\r\n\r\nWit my latest Ride:\r\n[img:a371b30038]http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/albums/userpics/10005/AMG%20Hammer1.jpg[/img:a371b30038]\r\n\r\nCaption: [b:a371b30038]"Chicago Breez\'n"  Team DarkTari[/b:a371b30038]\r\n\r\nCan U Pop me a copy thru email:  DarkTari@msn.com\r\n\r\nCan I email you some personal pics thru email to blend wit my rides?\r\n\r\nThanx Pimp!  \r\n\r\n[b:a371b30038]U DA Man  [/b:a371b30038]:cool:');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (19190, 'e171cfa3e3', '[quote:e171cfa3e3="crazydave"]That\'s what I dig about the Big Boys, they got songs like "Nervous" that just reach out and grab you by the balls, and don\'t let you forget them.[/quote:e171cfa3e3]\r\n\r\nyeah, the Big Boys are the shit, plain and simple. Nervous is a stand out for me as well.. one of my all time favorite Big Boys tunes is No, for some reason.. that feedback, and that guitar solo is sick. \r\n\r\nCool man, the feedback on that batch of discs will help me figure out what\'s next... I have a shitload of stuff and it\'s all over the map. Some things that come to mind are; the Nuggets box sets (vols 1 and 2), firehose, Mission of Burma, Wayne Kramer, Claw Hammer (this might be a big priority, if you\'re not familiar with these dudes), Link Wray, Captain Beefheart... you into Zappa? There\'s so much shit to listen to..lol.\r\n\r\nAnyway, we\'ll figure out the next round... in the mean time, I\'m diggin\' the hell outta the White Stripes stuff.\r\n\r\nThanks again,\r\n\r\nMat');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (18489, 'd52f7f4fce', 'yo dogg!! i came across your part map on trc. damn man you kick ass. you should transfer to a pgh radioshack. the dudes at my local are cool but they know shit about rc crap. \r\n\r\nanyhow i need some front knuckles and you graciously have the part# listed on that sheet. can i take those part#s and order knuckles for 2.50 a pop???');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (18490, '76a29c23c6', '[quote:76a29c23c6="Son_Gokou"]Ok, which FET is better than the other....IRF7389, or SI4562DY? You said that the 4562 isn\'t as better than the 7389 as thought...but it\'s still better, right? I mean, someone said that while it may have less amperage capability, it has lower resistance.....And that the IRF7389 has lower amperage capability, but it can handle that current continuously....\r\n\r\nSo, which is better and why?  :-( \r\n\r\nBTW I\'m back at MRCC, you may see me there as 100mph_Xmod.[/quote:76a29c23c6]\r\n\r\nMy testing has shown that the IRF7389 is better than the SI4562DY, period.   You get more torque from the IRF\'s than the SI\'s.   Even though people will say that the data shows the SI\'s to be better.  Real world tests show that the IRF\'s have a lesser resistance (Rds(on)) than the SI\'s.   This means that they can deliver more current to the motor.\r\n\r\nThe SI\'s can handle more current but that means squat in terms of performance.  IT\'s HOW much current the fets let though that determine performance.  Also, if you\'re stacking fets (which people do anyways) the less current handling by the IRF\'s isn\'t a problem anymore.......');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (18491, '555d20b64a', 'Pimp,\r\n\r\nIs there an issue with the RODW choices?\r\n\r\n* I pick &amp; post the RODW pics. \r\n* They are chosen on eye appeal, whether it\'s a store bought Bit with a nice paint  job, custom wheels, made from scratch, chopped body, whatever!  As long as the end result is unique and done right!\r\n*  Why would you ask how you should feel?  How do you feel? This is a title that\'s not given to any Micro!  I hand (pic) pick these Micro\'s from all over Da World  and they are very deservant of this title..  \r\n\r\nIt seems that you feel you have a Micro that should be judged or you have one that you feel is better than one or some of the chosen ones.  I am only responsible for the Micro\'s I picked and no others.  So if you feel you have one/some that needs to be considered, pop me a pm and include the pics.\r\n\r\nIf you send me anything, make damn sure you come correct !  No photo visible paint/body mistakes.  The RODW pic are as close to professional as it gets. There are modders like Crazy Dave, Cabo, Sinned, Geisem, Hue, SuperFly and myself just to name a few that deserve to have every one of their Micro\'s titled RODW.  So as I said before, if you come, come correct!\r\n[/b]');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (19173, '75b5c50f19', 'C-Dub,\r\n\r\nI can cop you a couple of Precious to mod if you want.  I sent Cavey Dave\'s yesterday.\r\n\r\nHe\'s doin 3, I\'m doin 3-4, I can get you 2 and that makes 8-9.  That\'s 2 months of auction material with just us 3.  Now if you throw in Hog &amp; Silla we may be able to stretch this out thru da summer.\r\n\r\nI want to get my alter ego "Da Big Kahuna" to post this auction. Can I just register again with the same email or do I have to use a different one?\r\n\r\nI\'m feelin pump\'d about this, I\'ll take the lead on it which give you and the others time to moderate.\r\n\r\nAlso I still wanna do a [b:75b5c50f19]Pimp My Ride[/b:75b5c50f19] thang this summer!  I wanna make this summer even better than the last  :eek:   I\'ll bring it to the IC once we get the auction off the ground.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (18493, '9d45258423', '[quote:9d45258423="crazydave"][quote:9d45258423="CaboWabo"]you can keep uploading images in the image gallery\r\ndunno if my post about the server space confused anyone, but just thought I\'d metion it just in case.[/quote:9d45258423]That\'s funny, I was about to upload the pictures last night, but then I thought, "Oh I shouldn\'t waste all his server space, he\'s running low..." :lol: \r\n\r\nAt any rate. I\'m on dial up right now, it was 11:00 at night. I\'d been working non stop on the car since 6 AM, so I probably would have just used the FTP regardless, but it is a good thing you said something, cause that was a concern of mine.\r\n\r\nDave[/quote:9d45258423]cool yea - keep using it, might as well use it up - that\'s what it\'s for.\r\nI just wanted to get as much space as possible cleared (got rid of a lot of duplicated hosted images and stuff) trying to keep the space open for bit related stuff.\r\nI don\'t know if you noticed, but I moved a few movies over to your server. might end up moving more over, that helps clear the space as well.');
