INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (18557, 'e9c108861d', 'Well I\'m running a contest at my site and wanted to let you know about it since the first installment is with a Pimpin Flavor in honor of the Bit Pimps.  Well I thought you\'d like to know and any bit pimps are more then welcomed to enter but I did not want to come off as a member stealer so I have not announced it on your open forums.\r\n\r\n[url]http://ripper7racing.com/forums/index.php?showtopic=344&amp;st=0&amp;[/url]\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nLater\r\nripper7777777');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (18558, '1d9760c8c3', '[quote:1d9760c8c3="hue35"]First of all, yer pay-fuckin-aso, dude.. you ain\'t lettin\' anyone down, and that\'s for certain. Sorry to here that you\'re stressed, and especially that you\'re depressed. I go through stretches of depression myself (big stretches... often..lol), so I know how that is. Dude, don\'t bow out... at a minimum, just keep the entries ya got. Our whole point was to give a little somethin\' back... the real entry on your part, is the bitPimps site... your daily contribution and presence. Dude, you make me laugh every day. I can\'t wait to ship the car I\'m building (almost done) to one of you guys... I\'m proud of it, and it\'ll feel good to show y\'all first hand what you\'ve inspired. Without you fuckers, I wouldn\'t have taken this hobby nearly as far as I have. You were the first dude in this hobby (over at tiny, OG bitPimp threads) that made me think, "fuck yeah, I gotta build me some fly fuckin\' rides"...yer trash talkin\' cracked me up from the start, and taunted me right into buildin\' cars that could, "take Payaso"...lol. Anyway, not to get all gay on you and shit, but dude, you rule... enter what ya got. Don\'t be a pussy...lol.\r\n\r\nLater brutha man, \r\n\r\nMat[/quote:1d9760c8c3]\r\n\r\n\r\nThanks dude for saying that... I can\'t even begin to tell how much I needed that, and it inspired me to just get super stoned, and get to work with what I had laying around. \r\n\r\nI think you\'ll be suprised when you see the finished product.  It\'s the exact same car as the one I took down. I just stripped it, and re did the whole thing top to mutha fuckin bottom. I had to con the wife outta 5 bones for paint, and went to K Mart at 7:30 and picked up some shit in the fuckin home section....lol\r\n \r\n\r\n\r\nI started masking at 8:30 my time, and just now finished it. (paint\'s drying) it\'s 11:50, and this could be the best 4 hour job for me.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nThanks again Mat...   It\'s good to know you\'re not forgotten.. :) \r\n\r\nPics in about an hour... Yup, just like "Fox Photo" biatch...lol\r\n\r\n-Steve');
