INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (18569, '5292f05e8d', 'How long have you been a shackie and where are you?\r\nI am in central tennessee and been here 10 years.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (18570, '324ef6a6b2', 'Hey CJ, yeah I have only been Shackin it up for a couple of months.   I am at the Brunswick Maine RS which is the district office up here.  It\'s hella fun, and great people, and I live for commission work.  I love the thrill of the hunt :)');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (18571, 'c9ff875e8d', 'hey you said you worked at the shack and have a bunch of broken xmods\r\ni was going to ask you if i could sell me one with a good servo i ordered one of the parts list but it got back ordered befor my order was processed\r\nif you could that would be great');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (18572, 'f64c56c46e', 'Hey man, yeah I could if ya really needed, but in all honesty, all Radio shacks have a shitload of broken X-mods out back.  Bassically RS has 3 catagories for returns, ones that can be fixed, ones that the companies will refund full credit for and finally, items that we have to "Destroy".  Literally I will take a return out back and beat the piss outta it w/ a hammer.  Well X-mods are under this catagory but intead of destroying, we keep em out back for parts when people bring em in w/ problems.  I think most shacks do this.  So ask yours, and ask around cuz as is life, some people can be lazy assholes and others can be totally cool.  Basically go to your local RS and ask "Who is the X-mod expert, cuz I have a technical question" and that should and you the right guy to talk to.   If all else fails then I can hook ya up, but please ask 1st you may be able to get the part wicked cheap or free depending on how cool they are.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (18573, 'aabe0fac00', 'Hey man, I feel for your situation, my wife recently got screwed out of a promotion at her work, and just couldn\'t take the insult. She quit in November, which really bummed our Christmas out. She got a 2 week severence pay, and hoped to get right back to work, but thanks to ol\' Dubya, the job market sucks right now. She had to take a job as a waitress at a truck stop and she\'s making money, but times are kinda tight for us now.\r\n\r\nAnyways, the reason I PMed you, if you\'re getting hard up, have a car, and reasonably clean driving record, look into pizza delivery. I know that our markets are probably different, but just to give you an idea, drivers at our place (pizza hut) get minimum wage, plus 50 cents a run, and average 3-4 runs a hour. Then on top of that they work about five or six hours a night, bring home about 50-60 dollars in tips, and around 100 on fridays and saturdays. I should also point out, my area is kinda ghetto, the guys out in rich sides of town make quite a bit more in tips.\r\n\r\nAnd the coolest thing about it, is it leaves you enough free time to fins a real job, and when you do, you can just come in on Friday night to pick up some quick party money.\r\n\r\nAnyways, I hope you\'re not insulted, I know some people think they are above pizza delivery, but I know you\'re not like that. These places are on every street corner, always looking for people, and it\'s decent money, more than I make, so I was just trying to help. I also figure your experience as a limo driver would make you a shoe in for a quick hire.\r\n\r\nDave');
