INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (19196, 'e3c7663e8f', '[quote:e3c7663e8f="hue35"]Cool man, the feedback on that batch of discs will help me figure out what\'s next... I have a shitload of stuff and it\'s all over the map. Some things that come to mind are; the Nuggets box sets (vols 1 and 2), firehose, Mission of Burma, Wayne Kramer, Claw Hammer (this might be a big priority, if you\'re not familiar with these dudes), Link Wray, Captain Beefheart... you into Zappa? There\'s so much shit to listen to..lol.[/quote:e3c7663e8f]I\'ve got 2 CDs full of Nuggets that I got off of Napster. That is one of my all time favorite CDs, I love that stuff. I\'ve got the A-Z of Link Wray, another of my favorites. firehose, Mission of Burma, Wayne Kramer, Claw Hammer is all stuff that my buddies had, and I\'ve heard, but I haven\'t sat and listened to, like you do with your own music. I like Captain Beefheart, but I\'ve only heard a couple songs by him.\r\n\r\nFrank Zappa...I\'ll tell ya about Frank Zappa. I really want to like him. I\'ve tried to like him. I\'ve tried really hard to like him. I\'ve listened to Joe\'s Garage over and over, and every time I\'m left with the same feeling, like I\'m the only one who don\'t get the joke. It\'s a shame too, because everyone else seems to be so profoundly affected.\r\n\r\nIf you\'re digging on the White Stripes, then I think I\'ll send you more garage rock, as I\'ve got piles of that stuff. Ever heard the Deviants, Urinals, Swingin\' Neckbreakers, or Detroit Cobras?\r\n\r\nI\'ve got this one chick band, Bratmobile. They really kinda suck, but I love \'em just for the line, "Don\'t write a song about it, just give me back my Cheap Trick record" :lol: \r\n\r\nDave');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (18816, '38b3937a6d', '[quote:38b3937a6d="jmays"]hi cw i am sorry for the trouble i am only wanting to be a part of the happenings, i joined in the middle of some stuff and did not have to whole picture if u know what i mean, i have been correted and again i am very sorry. i cant wait till i get a chance to enter into a contest. it will be fun i am sure, i am old enough that i want let pride get into the way, i have made a foul of my self and i slump down in my chair, i will chill and watch, when its my turn to get into the action i will be there, thanks for the great sight. i will email this to the others aswell.\r\nreguards\r\njeff[/quote:38b3937a6d]Hey dude, I\'m CD (crazydave) not CW(cabowabo).\r\n\r\nAt any rate sorry I spoke up. I just couldn\'t help myself. The moderators contest was an extremly cool thing, I never heard of any forum\'s members doing that for it\'s moderators. So I just thought it was extremly uncool to dump on our parade.\r\n\r\nWith that said,there is a contest in the works. So be cool man, hang out a little, because I can tell you complaining is gonna make you more enemies than friends.\r\n\r\nDave');
