INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (19342, '563878c50e', 'Hey, I finally ordered some FETs the other day, and they are confirmed on the way. So if you want to send me a SE, I\'ll do it up for ya.\r\n\r\n\r\nDid you get that Torino from CJ? If so I\'m not sure which car I\'d reccomend you have FETed. My Chevelle was faster out of the package than my other SEs, and has a slightly reworked PCB, but it just seems a tad bit slower after the FET mod. Then again my other SE is a car that I salvaged from the parts of 3 different SEs, and in order to get the PCB working again I had to jump the base on one of the forward FETs straight to ground, so who knows, maybe that bypass is what is making the differerence. Either way my Chevelle has tighter steering and almost no twitch. So that\'s still the prefered car.\r\n\r\nI could just FET up both your cars, but since I\'m doing up cars for the auction, I have no clue what my FET budget is like, and I want to stack the FETs on your car. (Hopefully that\'ll give you a slight advantage over Payaso ;) ) But I can get your other car on the next batch of FETs.\r\n\r\nDave');
