INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (19654, 'dd94ff97ef', '[quote:dd94ff97ef="crazydave"]Let me explain my perspective on music to you. \r\n\r\nBig major turning point came in \'79 when I was 9yo. That band was Kiss. Did I love them? Oh fuck no, and that was the problem, these guys were like super hereos. Something supernatural, completely unreal, I was expecting the most awesome, heavy ass music I ever heard, and it was lame gay shit. The only song that came close to sounding like what I expected was God Of Thunder.\r\n\r\nFrom that point on I\'ve been on a constant search, almost a mission, for real music. Raw real shit, that aint fake like Kiss. It\'s amazing the social impact music has on us, and that\'s my reason for being. I like music that shocks people.\r\n\r\nDoes that explain where I\'m coming from and why I favor the stuff I do, particularly the punk/garage stuff? :lol: \r\n\r\nDave[/quote:dd94ff97ef]yea kind of, cuz again - I\'m very similar lol\r\nbut I have to say - I go through stages now and then.\r\nback then the stages lasted longer, and now-a-days those stages last about long enough to play 3-4 songs and I\'m on to something completely different.\r\n\r\nin the past and still today, I run the gammut from classic rock, rock, metal, grunge, hip hop, rap, obscure, electronica, house, rave, blah, blah, blah, basically everthing you wanna call it except country and opera.\r\nof course there\'s varying degress of "like" in there, but for the most part - I really do go from one end of the spectrum to another.\r\nI\'ve got over 50 gigs of tunes and that\'s not including anything I have on CD that I\'ve bought in the past.\r\nI usually put about 5 gigs worth queued up in a playlist and push random and it gets me through my entire work day easily.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (19655, '451f64ad86', 'What\'s with you man?  I pmed hog and asked why he was acting like an ass towards me.  It isn\'t like I insulted him, or did I.  I pmed him to find out.  I don\'t understand why he\'s so pissed.  I post up one thing about getting li-ons cheaper and couldn\'t decide to put it in breaking news or in xmods, so I put in both.  I want to save people some money.  Is that what this is about?  I don\'t even know why you are getting involved.  I obviously stepped on his toes somehow and don\'t know where.  Have I ever insulted you?');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (19678, 'bdc5a1e65a', '[quote:bdc5a1e65a="viperdout"]Cabo:\r\n\r\nI do not know why Hog is mad at me, and he will not reply to me telling why.  Instead, he sent a copy of my pm (I\'m guessing) to betty.k and betty.k then replied with hatemail about something that did not involve him.  Hog has also been abusing his mod privilages, by editing a post of mine and turning it into insulting gibberish.  Maybe you can pm him and get something out of him, because I honestly don\'t know what I did to piss him off.  I have tried to deal with it by PMing him, he just won\'t say.  Thanks.\r\n\r\n-Max[/quote:bdc5a1e65a]yea I\'ve been somewhat informed on this whole situation.\r\nhogjowlz is riding your ass because of your posts on the forums.\r\nour moderators work hard on keeping the forums clean and organized.\r\n\r\nthere aren\'t many rules here to follow, but we do have a few - and we expect each and every one of our members to follow them. members in the past who haven\'t followed those rules got the same treatment - so don\'t think you\'re being singled out here.\r\n\r\nnow whether you know it or not - you are in the wrong. one example is your post about those batteries that were on sale.\r\ntypical forum etiquette on any forum is to NOT double post (spam), which you did. when hogjowlz called you out on it and told you not to double post the same post in 2 different forum categories - you fought him on it and said something to the effect of "yes it does belong in both places".\r\n\r\nthere\'s more, but that alone makes you completely in the wrong.\r\nthose are our rules (and rules at just about every other forum online) and a moderator asked you to follow them. your response was to argue - that\'s not smart.\r\n\r\nthe more you make extra work for our moderators and the more you clutter up the boards for other members - the more you\'re going to piss those people off and their going to let you know about it one way or another.\r\n\r\npimps that follow the rules have no problems here - so if you want it to stop, you need to do the same, and it will.');
