INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (19722, '0ebd880edd', 'aight, what if under "bitPimps Headlines" I create "Da bitPimps Back Alley Auction" and inside that, we make our post and it\'s open if pimps have questions, etc. for them to post a new top, but we make ours a sticky.\r\nwaddya think? I think that\'s a good solution.\r\n\r\nI still have yet to get on one of them cars you sent, been busy with real life shit - sucks - but I\'m gonna get on something soon.\r\n\r\nthanks again for pushin this baby out the door.\r\n\r\np.s. can\'t wait to see what you got in store - I\'m even in the dark on what\'chu gots! lol\r\n[quote:0ebd880edd="DarkTari"]I\'m Cool Wit Dat Pimp  :cool: \r\n\r\nNow for the Auction, I thought we\'d call it [b:0ebd880edd]Da BitPimps Back Alley Auction[/b:0ebd880edd], gotta nice ring to it.  Man I just took my pics today after the sun finally decided to come out.  Hadda do a lotta shit to 2 of the cars last night. Hadda change the whole chassis on one of them, wouldn\'t charge sometimes and acted fuckt up with the body on.  Hadda redo the wheelwells on the other. Didn\'t allow a tollarence for paint &amp; clearcoat.\r\nBut everything is on schedule, all cars are runnin &amp; lookin BLING  :shock: \r\nReady for Da Block  :eek: \r\nI\'ll be postin tonight, Guess I\'ll post in Contest unless you throw another forum in today sometime  :???:   didn\'t see it when I logged on, remember\r\n[b:0ebd880edd]Da BitPimps Back Alley Auction[/b:0ebd880edd] if so......[/quote:0ebd880edd]');
