INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (19886, '807dcd798a', '[quote:807dcd798a="Finks"]All right, how to start.  OK most of you out there watched "the Apprentice" right?   Remember when they were at Trump Taj and one team was raffling off a weekend rental for one of them Seabrings?  The winner wasn\'t even there cuz it was just that lame of a competition.  Well Radio shack is doing one up for us employees.  \r\n\r\nNow if you have entered a Shack in the last 6 years you have time and time again been bugged constantly to either buy or upgrade your cellphone cuz what you currently have Just Has to suck. Why?  Cuz RS relized they were making dick for cash by just selling parts and TVs/Radios.  So now they basically don\'t pay us unless we sell cellphones.\r\n\r\nWell as insentive they have this GAY ass competition that is supposed to motivate us (as if making minimum wage wasn\'t insentive).  Basically every ummm 3 phones we sell we get to go to a lame poorly designed web page and *Gasp* "SPIN 2 WIN!!".  Which reslts in some random wheel give you a lottery entry basically every time (sure you can win a DVD player, but hell I could win 1billion dollars by drinking Pepsi too).  \r\n\r\nOK now for the cause of this rant.  Guess what you win if you are supper dupper "lucky" and win the lotery?  You win....  A ONE YEAR LEASE on a fuckin H mother fuckin 2.....   WEEEEE.  Mother fucker, I work at Rat shack, I can\'t afford the full coverage insurance (cuz it\'s a lease) let alone premium gas nowerdays w/ $2.15 a gallon and 10 Miles to the gallon gas millage.  And you can\'t sell the fucker... why?  cuz it\'s a God damn lease!!!!  Basically, if I won this fucker, it would be God\'s way of taking a big ass dump on my head.  I mean, oops it got a scratch, what 3k to paint it or else I have to lease to buy???  You are forced to pay the full coverage, which for me would be ummm.... I dunno, $600 a month?  I swear, this company is just  Dumb as a fuckin brick.  When it was announced a month ago about this comp, there was laughter through out about how gay winning a LEASE is, especially on a truck/soccer mom tank like this.  \r\n\r\nSo to end this rant, if I was unfortunate to win this major shit ball of a prize, I would without hessitation turn it down in trade for a kitkat bar.  Nuff said.[/quote:807dcd798a]\r\n\r\nI have added a special group just for RS/EX-RS employees on my board at CJ\'s Hobbies.net. \r\n\r\nI know I have no interest in that contest since to win any prise you must be employed with RS for the entire contest period.\r\n\r\nBTW: like the quote in my Sig?');
