INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (20226, '38fa51e2de', 'So yeah, I need to know.  Been very interested in my favorite modders that have yet to submit stuff for the Summer comp.  Are you still into bits?  And if so are you working on an entry (i.e. VW Thing)  C\'mon you gotta let me in, my lips are sealed :grin: \r\n\r\nAlso out of curiosity, did you get around to mailing me those bodies?  Like I said in the letter if you didn\'t no biggie, but if you did cool city.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (20228, 'a1c3f1aa63', 'hi finks: i have not yet sent the bodies, actually i forgot about things for a while, i am still into the bits and am working on a car for the contest, its a scion xb! i figured that i came on to strong here with all the from start to finish progress reports, so i am just going to be cool and not make a bad rap for myself since there are hella talented ppl here that mod and i dont want to step on anyones toes, \r\n\r\nwhich bodies did you want? i will get them casted up for ya , sorry bout that, my job has just changed hands this past month and they have been keepin all of us busy on the transition, everything is cooled down now and i am getting back to normal...lol\r\n\r\n\r\nlet me know what the bodies u wanted and i will get them out and send me your addy again.\r\n\r\nthanks\r\njmays');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (20856, '19f0cc424d', 'Sorry about dat Dave, I thought about it after I had gone to bed......\r\n\r\n[b:19f0cc424d]GH Sims\r\n7815 Quill Point Drive\r\nBowie, Md. 20720[/b:19f0cc424d]\r\n\r\nAnd can you also include some flame stencils?  Never got any from your last offer.\r\n\r\nThanx Pimp !\r\n\r\nYeah Dude was moving to Virginia, just got a couple of PM\'s from him....');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (20857, '74020001da', 'OK, I\'ve got an address.\r\n\r\nROBERT G. WILSON\r\n1305 WATERFRONT DR.\r\nVIRGINIA BEACH, VA\r\n23451\r\n\r\nIt\'s close to Norfolk and Portsmith, in the lower right section on the map.  Can\'t wait to see it.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (20231, '832c12de57', 'Well what do you have?  I figured the VW and the Cit, but hell a Scion... MUHAHAHA!!!!  \r\n\r\nOh by the way, you didn\'t come on strong with the step by step, that kicked ass.  It was the expectation of instant recognition and the way it was put.  Trust me, your a mature guy and I understand why you said what you said (hell I almost said simular things about my work) I know it\'s all water under the bridge now.  So trust me, right now this site is in dire need to get off of the whole flame shit and get back to basics.  Bit Pimps is known world wide for our crazy mods, and other than DTs and CDs Auction bits, we havn\'t thrown out anything for 2 weeks.  \r\n\r\nAny how, throw me some JPGs if you don\'t want to post em public, I am hella interested.  Actually Check out my gallery and you will see one of my current projects.  It\'s actually lightly inspired by you, as in I constructed more than 50% by scratch.\r\n\r\nYeah so about the bodies, whatever you want do it bro, it\'s all good.  Personally I would be as honored to have one of your bodies as I would to have a C-Dub or Hugh rides.  It really is amazing what you do with plastic and putty.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (20838, '79c906717c', '[quote:79c906717c="Finks"]I was thinking today.  Since it seems Kwibb is eternally MIA maybe it was time to replace him as a mod.  Now I am definatly saying I don\'t want to be a mod, I like slummin it too much, but SG, Bird, Betty, ph2t, Hugh and Supperfly come to mind as worth while replacements.  Maybe to spice it up have em mod for the position.  Hell you could open it up to everyone but of course be a little bias twards those pimps :cool:   Well anyhow just an idea.  Not like we really need more mods but whatever.[/quote:79c906717c]actually, he has been replaced in a sense...\r\nNamuna (admin/mod) from TinyRC has taken his place.\r\nwe didn\'t make a mention of it and prefer not to - we don\'t care if people know, but we don\'t want to make it a "big deal", but Namuna is a moderator here now.\r\n\r\nwe have to choose very specific moderators around here, we have to know them on a "personal" level so we know if they can truely moderate here at bitPimps. we\'re not the typical forum and we can\'t have your typical moderators, therefore we get only the ones that fit with what we/the community needs.\r\n\r\nthere\'s a bunch that\'s been talked about and we like to keep just about everything a surprise. so please don\'t feel like you\'ve just gotten shot down or shouldn\'t suggest anything anymore.\r\nwe love suggestions and truth be told, lately your suggestions contain the most valid reasons for an honest response. thank you for that - it seems you\'re truely trying to help the community.\r\n\r\nanyways, yes - he has been replaced and thank you for the suggestion / comment. keep em coming, know what the "pimps" want and delivering is another thing we like to do and take pride in.\r\n\r\n- C-Dub');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (20233, '28ebbcdc1e', 'dude does hue have stock on those camaro bodies or what, i just check out the gallery section and he has seem to have takin over, he has uploaded 20 picts in the past few days...lol hue is really suckin up, just kiddin, dude i am diggin your yacht, that is going to be the coollest summer fling, sizzle wiggle , ok i give up on the bitpimps slang, the yacht is bad ass, i cant wait to see it all together. \r\n\r\ni just went back and checked out or past emails and i was going to send you one of each, the cit and bus, i just actually casted up a bus yesterday and the casting came out really nice, i will get the flashing off of it and cast a cit , bare with me i will get it together...\r\n\r\njmays');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (20235, '9b0c3652b9', 'Check it out now, just uploaded another pic that gives a better idea.  Oh and Hugh only Re-Did his gallery for orgonizational reasons.  But yeah he has done a shitload of Cameros.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (20291, 'f68bcb29b2', 'Thanks bro.  I am lovin it thus far.  Your comment on the Cabrio inspired me to from now on always put progress pics up in my gallery for those that actually give a shit about the process and not just the bling.  If it turns out hot, then I\'ll post in Custom jobs.  Either way keep an eye out for what I am up to in the gallery.  Hope that baby will be done by the 17th.  It will be hot.  Thanks again for the recognition.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (20292, '2d684933f3', 'ahh thanks very much dave, that was very helpful, i was deciding wether to pick one up or not, and your right, fets would make that thing FLY!! may have to send mine once i get it to ph2t for a biff!');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (20293, '95925c737e', 'Allright, I got almost got everything for you.  I still have to track down a Stage 2 motor set.  I got everything else.  \r\n\r\nSometime next week I\'ll get the shipping cost when I get everything together and in one box.');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (20237, '729f43bd95', 'Stay Tuned Pimp  :cool:');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (20243, 'e0b2011536', 'cool ! let me get on this and i will let you know wassup.\r\n\r\njmays');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (20239, 'c269503f73', 'Hey, I did 2 of your cars tonight. The Sport gave me a bitch, but I got \'er done. The booster car that doesn\'t have springs, it has a blue endbell motor in it, what is that? A 4.2 Pro? That thing screams.\r\n\r\nWhen I tested before the mod, I thought it seemed like the car was already FET\'ed. Then after I put Fets in it, that thing got sick.\r\n\r\nOne time when me and ph2t were having a discussion about stacked fets, and he was saying he judged power by holding the car by the back wheels, and letting it try to pull itself up. That\'s the test I\'ve been going by. A stock car will barely nudge it. A FETed car will pull it about a quarter the way, and a car with tri-stacked FEts will almost pull it over. Your car with that motor, spun all the way around, not once, but as long as you wanted, and fast too. No BS man, that is [i:c269503f73]the fastest[/i:c269503f73] motor I\'ve seen yet.\r\n\r\nSo what the hell is it?!\r\n\r\n :lol: Dave');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (20240, '4f92359c0b', '[quote:4f92359c0b]Hey, I did 2 of your cars tonight. The Sport gave me a bitch, but I got \'er done. The booster car that doesn\'t have springs, it has a blue endbell motor in it, what is that? A 4.2 Pro? That thing screams. \r\n\r\nWhen I tested before the mod, I thought it seemed like the car was already FET\'ed. Then after I put Fets in it, that thing got sick. \r\n\r\nOne time when me and ph2t were having a discussion about stacked fets, and he was saying he judged power by holding the car by the back wheels, and letting it try to pull itself up. That\'s the test I\'ve been going by. A stock car will barely nudge it. A FETed car will pull it about a quarter the way, and a car with tri-stacked FEts will almost pull it over. Your car with that motor, spun all the way around, not once, but as long as you wanted, and fast too. No BS man, that is the fastest motor I\'ve seen yet. \r\n\r\nSo what the hell is it?! [/quote:4f92359c0b]\r\n\r\nThat it is!  A 4.2 Pro.  When those first came out I put one in each of my Booster cars unless it didn\'t perform well.\r\nThanx for everything Pimp !');
