INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (21069, 'f4a8ffcfe7', '[quote:f4a8ffcfe7="sg219"]You\'ll never get those kids to your site until you actually have some content to draw them there.  I say start an E Store at R7R, he has a whole section devoted to peoples private E stores.  Put one up there and link it to your actual site.  Ripper is cool and if you set up shop there and brought all the traffic thru that these parts are going to create, it would be good for everyone.  You and $$$, Ripper and traffic, and me, I\'m the Xmods MOD there!!![/quote:f4a8ffcfe7]\r\n\r\nI may do that after I get some stock in.  First I have to prove through my finincial adviser(wife) that I can sell the stuff and make a profit.\r\n\r\n[quote:f4a8ffcfe7]I say get black and especially silver/chrome!!!  Those are the most popular colors and they go with anything.  Plus, if your the only one with them, it doesn\'t matter what color!![/quote:f4a8ffcfe7]\r\n\r\nI want to get at least black, silver and red two alternate may be blue or purple\r\n\r\n[quote:f4a8ffcfe7]If you need anyhelp, just let me know, and remember I\'m on your side, not the other assholes out there.  I just like messin\' with people to get a rise out of them and have something to do for a few hours each night that doesn\'t bore me to death. Let them post what they want, the real people that know whats going on will understand.[/quote:f4a8ffcfe7]\r\n\r\nI\'ll take some money if you want to invest!  :grin:');
