INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (20545, '69140f35e6', '[quote:69140f35e6="DarkTari"]That\'s Pimpin Dave!  I like the scheme!\r\nABout the windows, I thought I taped the insides of them, and usually when I clear coat, I remove the exterior tape from the windows but leave the inside tape on.   Removing after everthing is dried on the outside.  If you didn\'t that [u:69140f35e6]may[/u:69140f35e6] explain the window issue, if not then I\'m stump\'d cause I never had that happen and I\'ve done 3 of these already and you\'ve done a couple too.   :???: \r\n\r\nI guess I\'m all caught up now.  Thanx a lot Dave![/quote:69140f35e6]I was wondering why you weren\'t responding to my PMs. Sometimes that popup window doesn\'t come up, so you have to keep looking at the top of the page to see if you got any messages. Also if you happened to be browsing your inbox when I sent those first 2, it would say you have no new messages, because it\'s assuming you saw them.\r\n\r\nAnyways, I was playing Monster Bit Garage last night, it was pretty fun, but I didn\'t win the tool set or Monster Garage CD. Luckily I was just playing, or I would of had to blow the car up too. :lol: \r\n\r\nI was frustrated with it last night, but looking at it this morning, I just need to spend a little time with it, appaently I don\'t do well with deadlines.\r\n\r\nTo fix the windows, I\'m gonna wet sand the windows with 1000 grit, and clear coat. That should work, I\'ve fixed windows like that before, let\'s just pray I have enough clear coat left.\r\n\r\nGood to hear I got time now, so I can relax, and try to get this perfect, but I\'m actually really excited about this car, it\'s gonna be difficult to wait a week to see people\'s response. Can we give a sneel peak in flossin\', huh, can we, can we, huh? :-D  :lol: \r\n\r\nDave');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (20546, '6e0bb368e2', '[code:1:6e0bb368e2]Sometimes that popup window doesn\'t come up, so you have to keep looking at the top of the page to see if you got any messages[/code:1:6e0bb368e2][b:6e0bb368e2]Nope, it said I had no new messages ???[/b:6e0bb368e2]\r\n\r\n[quote:6e0bb368e2]Can we give a sneel peak in flossin\', huh, can we, can we, huh? [/quote:6e0bb368e2]  \r\n[b:6e0bb368e2]Uh, Uh, UH! Now what did I tell you before Lil Davy?\r\nNow off to bed with ya   [/b:6e0bb368e2]:tired: :crybad:');
INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (20547, '28bdf9028f', '[quote:28bdf9028f="DarkTari"]I\'m just getting CaveyDave\'s PM\'s from July 6th up til now today ?????\r\n\r\nAny thoughs !   Just lettin ya know![/quote:28bdf9028f]I\'m not 100% sure, but here\'s what I think happened.\r\n\r\nwe we\'re having server troubles earlier this week, the 6th, 7th, and 8th.\r\nI\'m guessing the PM tried to send, but since the server went down, it didn\'t make it all the way through. after awhile, it still saw the PM sitting in CD\'s \'outbox\' and then saw you login and poof - it sent.\r\n\r\nthat\'s my guess anyway lol');
