INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (20855, 'e94cde4b75', '[quote:e94cde4b75="CaboWabo"]as long as starsky and hutch get fet\'ed I don\'t care lol[/quote:e94cde4b75]Seriously, before the auction came up or anything, your SE was first on the FETing list, so there is still set of FETs reserved for you, actually 2, cause I\'m gonna stack your FETs\r\n\r\n[quote:e94cde4b75]no, really...\r\nyou send me whatever, whenever the auctions are over - if you have to take out expenses, do so - no worries.[/quote:e94cde4b75]Well I can sell 3 FET mods right off the bat. So this money will come right back, I just didn\'t have the cash to invest in the first place.\r\n\r\n[quote:e94cde4b75]haven\'t checked yet, but did ya vote yet for the contest winners?\r\nI kinda felt like DT was trying to say he stuck to the "summer bling" theme and that\'s why his choices were so different from mine.\r\nI thought I did stick to the "summer bling" theme and even mentioned it by picking the mods that enduced the most "summer-time" feel (e.g. sg\'s boat)\r\nyea sg\'s boat isn\'t prestine, but its more modding than most enteries, it\'s modding a new vehicle (boat) and as far as I know, boat says summer bling more than a car.\r\nbut whatever, I\'m probably reading way too much in to like always.\r\nI\'ll go sit in my corner lol[/quote:e94cde4b75]D\'oh! Holy F\'in shit, I completely forgot about judging the contest. Sonnafabitch, this was a tricky one too.\r\n\r\nI\'m gonna go in and vote without looking what you guys have voted, but I will say this, boats do nothing for me, they just don\'t. I will be keeping the theme of the contest in strong consideration, but Hue\'s car is easily his swan song. He easily has the best eyes on the bPs, and just deserves recognition as "the best". It\'s convertable, so it\'s fits the theme close enough for me. So his \'maro\' will be getting my #1 vote without further consideration.');
