INSERT INTO phpbb_privmsgs_text VALUES (20833, '5c10d4c8a8', 'Congratulations on your winning bid!\r\n\r\n(look biatch, I\'m trying not to give you the non-typical "pre-canned" homo response here so bare with me lol)\r\n\r\nAlright...\r\n#1.) sorry nobody contacted you yet. our own dumb fault. call us names - we deserve it. I can only offer you a "sorry" and I guess a random "homey" to make up for it.\r\n#2.) you can pay cash or money order to me, or you can pay paypal to crazydave, if you would like to pay crazydave, please send him a PM (private message) asking for his paypal address and he will give it to you.\r\nif you would like to pay cash or money order, send it to me at:\r\nScott Lix\r\n16 Crystal Lake Drive\r\nSt. Peters, MO 63376\r\n#3.) if you want a homey to compensate for our retardness, you\'ll have to send me an address I can ship to you at.\r\n#4.) I appoligize again, I know this doesn\'t make us look "trust-worthy" (but you know we are) or like we are "on top of things" (we are, just maybe not on these type things).\r\nwe\'re not a shop. we\'ve never "sold" anything. and we don\'t want to be a "shop" or "sell" anything. this is kind of a once a year (if that) type thing and we\'re not looking to "sell", "rip-off", "get rich", or any of that type shit.\r\n\r\nanyways, you have your options, please let me know which you have chosen so I can make "it" happen.\r\n\r\nthanks for helping support bitPimps homey, you\'re doing your community a great deed as well as getting something kick ass in return for it. you should feel great and I hope you do.\r\n\r\nthanks again.\r\n- CaboWabo');
